1
00:00:00,933 --> 00:00:07,666
(Episode 5: Six Minus One Equals Six)

2
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:08,640
- Wonder Dogs!
- Wonder Dogs!

3
00:00:08,664 --> 00:00:10,552
The Wonder Dogs dropped
the first two sets,

4
00:00:10,577 --> 00:00:12,866
but they're completely dominating
Set 3 on a huge run.

5
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:17,766
Finally, a set we can watch
without biting our nails.

6
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:21,633
No kidding. The gap is massive right now.

7
00:00:22,633 --> 00:00:23,665
It's 10 to 0.

8
00:00:23,666 --> 00:00:25,566
(Hyo Rim, the serving sharpshooter)

9
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,900
(Her 11th consecutive serve)

10
00:00:33,133 --> 00:00:33,966
Hyo Rim!

11
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,166
(Stay calm.)

12
00:00:39,633 --> 00:00:41,133
(The target zone)

13
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:45,433
Boom!

14
00:00:45,866 --> 00:00:48,866
(Will she hit her spot again?)

15
00:00:51,633 --> 00:00:53,000
(Out)

16
00:00:53,366 --> 00:00:54,433
Long on the serve!

17
00:00:54,458 --> 00:00:55,522
(Sorry, guys.)

18
00:00:56,066 --> 00:00:58,225
Good serve!

19
00:00:58,433 --> 00:00:59,526
Don't worry about it, Hyo Rim.

20
00:01:00,066 --> 00:01:02,000
Good effort.

21
00:01:02,166 --> 00:01:03,666
(Cheers keep coming
despite the service error.)

22
00:01:03,933 --> 00:01:05,107
Nice!

23
00:01:05,132 --> 00:01:06,142
(The Pink Spiders are relieved.)

24
00:01:06,166 --> 00:01:07,666
Just get the next one.

25
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,266
Let's slow it down and play our game.

26
00:01:10,933 --> 00:01:12,666
Side out, let's go!

27
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,633
(Calling to target Enkhsoyol on the serve)

28
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,466
(Nodding)

29
00:01:20,133 --> 00:01:21,833
(Now it's our turn to receive.)

30
00:01:22,366 --> 00:01:23,633
(Glancing)

31
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:25,099
Ye Eun.

32
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:27,066
They're serving toward Enkhsoyol,
so shift over a bit.

33
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:28,666
Got it!

34
00:01:30,133 --> 00:01:32,133
Enkhsoyol, I'll help cover your side.

35
00:01:36,333 --> 00:01:37,832
(The serve heads toward Enkhsoyol.)

36
00:01:37,833 --> 00:01:39,000
Yours, Ye Eun!

37
00:01:40,666 --> 00:01:41,700
Ye Eun passes it up.

38
00:01:42,033 --> 00:01:42,833
Hyo Rim.

39
00:01:45,166 --> 00:01:47,699
- Enkhsoyol with the tip!
- Nice play!

40
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:50,000
They just need to avoid
giving up consecutive points.

41
00:01:51,566 --> 00:01:52,400
Bravo.

42
00:01:53,366 --> 00:01:54,599
(Ye Eun's pass...)

43
00:01:54,624 --> 00:01:57,657
Ye Eun's pass sets Enkhsoyol up perfectly.

44
00:01:59,026 --> 00:02:01,301
Those two have shown
incredible chemistry...

45
00:02:01,326 --> 00:02:02,522
since the start of Set 3.

46
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:07,533
And that's why Enkhsoyol
keeps converting on offense.

47
00:02:08,666 --> 00:02:09,632
(Way to hang in there!)

48
00:02:09,633 --> 00:02:10,533
(Patting her head)

49
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:16,133
(The lead is right back to 10 points.)

50
00:02:17,033 --> 00:02:18,365
It's 11 to 1.

51
00:02:18,366 --> 00:02:19,766
Enkhsoyol serves.

52
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:24,566
Watch the drop!

53
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:28,099
Enkhsoyol!

54
00:02:28,100 --> 00:02:29,149
Put some float on it.

55
00:02:29,743 --> 00:02:30,683
Put some float on it.

56
00:02:31,666 --> 00:02:32,466
Got it.

57
00:02:35,466 --> 00:02:37,365
(A perfectly placed float serve)

58
00:02:37,366 --> 00:02:38,365
The pass is unstable.

59
00:02:38,366 --> 00:02:39,633
There we go.

60
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:40,766
Set it up high.

61
00:02:41,866 --> 00:02:42,666
Da Eun.

62
00:02:48,466 --> 00:02:49,633
Off the block and out.

63
00:02:50,366 --> 00:02:52,532
That's it! Let's go!

64
00:02:52,533 --> 00:02:53,599
Nicely done!

65
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,132
Keep your heads cool.
Take it one point at a time.

66
00:02:55,133 --> 00:02:59,532
They just need to stay locked in
and trade side-outs.

67
00:02:59,533 --> 00:03:00,699
What did I say?

68
00:03:00,700 --> 00:03:02,265
I told you to pull back, didn't I?

69
00:03:02,266 --> 00:03:04,017
Get the next one!
That was totally playable!

70
00:03:04,042 --> 00:03:05,866
- We'll get the next one.
- Understood!

71
00:03:06,433 --> 00:03:08,032
It's 11 to 2 now.

72
00:03:08,033 --> 00:03:10,433
Run a C-quick off an A pass,
or back-C off a B pass.

73
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:13,933
(Got it!)

74
00:03:19,533 --> 00:03:20,565
Clean pass.

75
00:03:20,566 --> 00:03:21,333
C!

76
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,400
(Completely frozen!)

77
00:03:24,666 --> 00:03:25,500
Single block!

78
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:28,008
Yeon Joo working against a single block.

79
00:03:30,066 --> 00:03:31,133
There it is!

80
00:03:31,633 --> 00:03:32,533
Good.

81
00:03:33,233 --> 00:03:34,733
Calculated all the way. Absolutely.

82
00:03:35,633 --> 00:03:37,133
(What a play!)

83
00:03:39,802 --> 00:03:42,266
She saw the middle blocker running late...

84
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:45,665
and deliberately placed the tip
toward the sideline.

85
00:03:45,666 --> 00:03:46,932
Tips like that look simple,

86
00:03:46,933 --> 00:03:48,465
- but they're really tough.
- Exactly.

87
00:03:48,466 --> 00:03:50,632
You have to read the defense
in a split second...

88
00:03:50,633 --> 00:03:52,032
and drop it with pinpoint accuracy.

89
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,699
Come on, girls,
keep fighting till the whistle!

90
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:55,733
My bad!

91
00:03:56,166 --> 00:03:58,138
We're rushing our sets.
Min Ji's being forced to scramble too.

92
00:03:58,633 --> 00:04:01,900
(Time to pull away!)

93
00:04:05,300 --> 00:04:06,300
It's 12 to 3.

94
00:04:08,533 --> 00:04:09,799
Enkhsoyol receives.

95
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:10,600
C!

96
00:04:14,333 --> 00:04:15,900
(Two blockers up this time)

97
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:17,899
Here comes the swing!

98
00:04:17,900 --> 00:04:19,533
(Then rip it right through!)

99
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,075
Haven't seen a heater
like that in a while!

100
00:04:22,100 --> 00:04:23,732
(Another point from the Flame Deer!)

101
00:04:23,733 --> 00:04:24,900
Yes!

102
00:04:25,376 --> 00:04:26,975
Look at that sharp cross-court angle.

103
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,800
Classic Yeon Joo right there.

104
00:04:29,333 --> 00:04:31,238
She cut that at an unbelievable angle.

105
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:33,466
Nice.

106
00:04:34,033 --> 00:04:37,200
(Momentum swings back to the Wonder Dogs.)

107
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:51,233
(The 10-point cushion is back.)

108
00:04:53,433 --> 00:04:54,433
Dig it up!

109
00:04:55,233 --> 00:04:56,600
(Seung Ju's attack chance)

110
00:04:58,733 --> 00:04:59,665
Tip!

111
00:04:59,666 --> 00:05:00,700
Watch the tip!

112
00:05:03,466 --> 00:05:04,266
Yeon Joo!

113
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:06,006
- Seung Ju drops the tip.
- Yeon Joo!

114
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:07,366
Down it goes.

115
00:05:08,366 --> 00:05:09,399
All right!

116
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:11,566
- Great touch.
- Thank you.

117
00:05:15,333 --> 00:05:18,700
Yeon Joo, be ready for the tip!

118
00:05:22,466 --> 00:05:24,666
(The tips that burned them
all through Sets 1 and 2)

119
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:30,800
(Coach Yeon Koung warned them repeatedly.)

120
00:05:31,900 --> 00:05:34,065
Seung Ju is a veteran,

121
00:05:34,066 --> 00:05:36,136
and she knows
how to exploit plays like that.

122
00:05:43,166 --> 00:05:43,999
Bo Been!

123
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:46,133
Go down the line.

124
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,900
(Target: Seung Ju)

125
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:51,600
Now 13 to 4.

126
00:05:55,100 --> 00:05:55,866
Left side!

127
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,566
Hyo Rim.

128
00:05:59,233 --> 00:06:00,327
Free ball coming over.

129
00:06:01,566 --> 00:06:03,096
Hyo Rim handles the deflection cleanly.

130
00:06:03,366 --> 00:06:04,300
Transition!

131
00:06:05,166 --> 00:06:07,433
(Targeting Seung Ju begins.)

132
00:06:12,233 --> 00:06:14,732
Blocked at the net!

133
00:06:14,733 --> 00:06:16,033
She was waiting for it.

134
00:06:19,433 --> 00:06:21,600
Read that attack like an open book.

135
00:06:22,266 --> 00:06:23,984
Seung Ju is amazing.

136
00:06:24,828 --> 00:06:26,835
(Impressed)

137
00:06:27,233 --> 00:06:29,733
Min Ji, great positioning on that play.

138
00:06:30,033 --> 00:06:31,758
Stay right there on the next one too.

139
00:06:34,233 --> 00:06:37,432
They can't get comfortable with the lead.

140
00:06:37,433 --> 00:06:38,266
Exactly.

141
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,133
It's 13 to 5.

142
00:06:45,800 --> 00:06:47,107
A miscommunication there.

143
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:48,033
Hey!

144
00:06:48,766 --> 00:06:50,366
(There's our chance!)

145
00:06:52,300 --> 00:06:53,700
Off-speed tip!

146
00:06:54,066 --> 00:06:55,048
Seung Ju tips it over.

147
00:06:55,233 --> 00:06:56,466
Yeon Joo keeps it alive.

148
00:06:59,466 --> 00:07:01,266
(Stuffed at the net)

149
00:07:01,633 --> 00:07:02,699
Set out to Seung Ju.

150
00:07:02,700 --> 00:07:05,200
Soft tip!

151
00:07:06,246 --> 00:07:07,980
Soft tip!

152
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:10,129
Watch the tip!

153
00:07:10,130 --> 00:07:11,197
Just send it over!

154
00:07:13,130 --> 00:07:14,163
Chance ball!

155
00:07:16,445 --> 00:07:17,879
Seung Ju again!

156
00:07:23,079 --> 00:07:24,412
Out!

157
00:07:24,745 --> 00:07:25,878
Off the block!

158
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:27,327
All right!

159
00:07:27,352 --> 00:07:29,812
(Seung Ju scores three straight points.)

160
00:07:30,245 --> 00:07:33,479
That angle was nearly impossible.

161
00:07:33,779 --> 00:07:35,745
Yet Seung Ju pulled it off cleanly.

162
00:07:40,179 --> 00:07:42,412
(Wonder Dogs call a timeout.)

163
00:07:42,579 --> 00:07:46,145
Tip!

164
00:07:46,279 --> 00:07:48,378
Another tip!

165
00:07:48,379 --> 00:07:49,378
- Yes!
- Yes!

166
00:07:49,379 --> 00:07:50,770
Was there even a real spike?

167
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:52,045
The last one, fine.

168
00:07:52,279 --> 00:07:53,644
But you got caught by the tip again!

169
00:07:53,645 --> 00:07:54,811
- Twice! Three times!
- Yes!

170
00:07:54,812 --> 00:07:56,078
They're closing the gap!

171
00:07:56,079 --> 00:07:57,078
Lock it in!

172
00:07:57,079 --> 00:07:58,445
Stop rushing.

173
00:07:58,679 --> 00:08:00,711
Whenever the ball goes high, expect a tip.

174
00:08:00,712 --> 00:08:02,078
- Yes!
- What else would it be?

175
00:08:02,079 --> 00:08:03,078
- Yes, Coach!
- Yes, Coach!

176
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:05,144
- Watch the short drop!
- Let's go!

177
00:08:05,145 --> 00:08:06,345
- One, two, three! Fight!
- Fight!

178
00:08:07,112 --> 00:08:08,978
- Just side out!
- Ye Eun.

179
00:08:08,979 --> 00:08:09,978
I've got the short ball!

180
00:08:09,979 --> 00:08:12,212
- Watch the overpass!
- Got it!

181
00:08:13,545 --> 00:08:14,911
Watch the deep corner.
I'll cover the short stuff.

182
00:08:14,912 --> 00:08:16,579
Short is yours, deep is mine.

183
00:08:18,712 --> 00:08:19,779
Ye Eun!

184
00:08:20,755 --> 00:08:22,287
Find the seam.

185
00:08:22,312 --> 00:08:23,645
Push it deep!

186
00:08:23,979 --> 00:08:25,012
Got it!

187
00:08:26,179 --> 00:08:27,412
Let's go.

188
00:08:28,579 --> 00:08:31,012
With my pro club,
I was just a serving specialist.

189
00:08:31,379 --> 00:08:33,444
I never rotated in as a front-row hitter.

190
00:08:33,445 --> 00:08:35,481
I was only ever subbed in to serve.

191
00:08:36,045 --> 00:08:37,945
Since I hadn't attacked in so long,

192
00:08:38,079 --> 00:08:42,079
I honestly wasn't sure
if I could still pull it off.

193
00:08:44,112 --> 00:08:45,112
Mine!

194
00:08:46,388 --> 00:08:47,387
(Dig it up first.)

195
00:08:47,412 --> 00:08:48,412
Nice!

196
00:08:48,979 --> 00:08:50,012
Bo Been.

197
00:08:50,379 --> 00:08:51,545
Run the C! Go!

198
00:08:52,245 --> 00:08:53,311
(Setting Ye Eun)

199
00:08:53,312 --> 00:08:54,400
C on the left!

200
00:08:56,079 --> 00:08:58,745
All I kept thinking was,
"Just rip it through."

201
00:08:59,079 --> 00:09:00,078
Go!

202
00:09:00,079 --> 00:09:01,078
Swing away!

203
00:09:01,079 --> 00:09:02,845
(Facing a double block)

204
00:09:03,279 --> 00:09:04,579
Ye Eun takes a big swing!

205
00:09:04,745 --> 00:09:05,745
Down for the kill!

206
00:09:06,112 --> 00:09:07,844
(It pays off!)

207
00:09:07,845 --> 00:09:10,179
(There it is!)

208
00:09:10,712 --> 00:09:13,478
Ye Eun hasn't had much floor time,

209
00:09:13,479 --> 00:09:15,644
- so she looked pretty tense out there.
- Absolutely.

210
00:09:15,645 --> 00:09:18,144
They put their faith in her,
gave her the look,

211
00:09:18,169 --> 00:09:20,136
- and she came through big.
- Exactly.

212
00:09:20,906 --> 00:09:23,263
That single point meant the world to me.

213
00:09:23,679 --> 00:09:25,598
I couldn't wipe the smile off my face.

214
00:09:26,645 --> 00:09:28,678
Ye Eun is back to serve,
her signature weapon.

215
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:30,112
(Time for her specialty, the serve)

216
00:09:31,145 --> 00:09:33,145
(Signaling the target zone)

217
00:09:36,379 --> 00:09:37,711
(Did she catch the signal?)

218
00:09:37,712 --> 00:09:38,712
Ye Eun!

219
00:09:39,179 --> 00:09:40,179
Ye Eun!

220
00:09:40,579 --> 00:09:42,879
Someone tell her to check
Coach Kim's signs.

221
00:09:43,745 --> 00:09:45,251
She knows her spot, right?

222
00:09:45,579 --> 00:09:47,845
She serves with serious pace. Be ready!

223
00:09:48,745 --> 00:09:49,589
Serve!

224
00:09:49,614 --> 00:09:50,745
(The serve specialist
steps up to the line.)

225
00:09:57,345 --> 00:09:59,212
Told you! Look at that!

226
00:09:59,399 --> 00:10:00,854
That's her bread and butter!

227
00:10:00,879 --> 00:10:02,945
- Great read today.
- You know it!

228
00:10:07,065 --> 00:10:09,465
With that serve alone, Ye Eun has...

229
00:10:09,512 --> 00:10:13,178
She has torn up the V-League before.

230
00:10:13,179 --> 00:10:14,179
(Ye Eun's father)

231
00:10:14,712 --> 00:10:17,583
Hye Rim, that was playable.
That's your pass to make.

232
00:10:18,179 --> 00:10:21,079
(The Pink Spiders are visibly shaken.)

233
00:10:22,845 --> 00:10:25,378
(Meanwhile, the rookie coach
looks unfazed?)

234
00:10:25,379 --> 00:10:26,712
(Grinning)

235
00:10:28,879 --> 00:10:30,545
I clearly called Zone 4.

236
00:10:30,779 --> 00:10:32,844
- Did she even look over?
- I don't think she saw it.

237
00:10:32,845 --> 00:10:33,879
She totally missed it.

238
00:10:35,145 --> 00:10:37,879
(Calling for Zone 4)

239
00:10:43,179 --> 00:10:45,812
(Who cares, it's an ace!)

240
00:10:48,079 --> 00:10:50,312
She's definitely one of a kind.

241
00:10:50,845 --> 00:10:53,911
Sure, she tunes me out sometimes,

242
00:10:53,912 --> 00:10:56,944
but if she can step up,
trust her strengths,

243
00:10:56,945 --> 00:11:00,744
and find a way to score on her own,

244
00:11:00,745 --> 00:11:03,111
I'm more than happy
to let her run with it.

245
00:11:03,112 --> 00:11:05,379
Though if it backfires,

246
00:11:05,712 --> 00:11:08,545
she knows she's dead meat.

247
00:11:09,845 --> 00:11:12,312
Ye Eun holds serve.

248
00:11:12,545 --> 00:11:15,345
(No instructions this time)

249
00:11:15,812 --> 00:11:16,844
Serve!

250
00:11:16,845 --> 00:11:18,011
(Free-rein mode activated)

251
00:11:18,012 --> 00:11:19,178
- Boom!
- Boom!

252
00:11:19,179 --> 00:11:20,644
- That's it!
- Let's go!

253
00:11:20,645 --> 00:11:21,644
Mine!

254
00:11:21,645 --> 00:11:22,644
(Seung Ju elevates.)

255
00:11:22,645 --> 00:11:23,645
Watch out!

256
00:11:24,212 --> 00:11:25,678
Seung Ju. Off the hands!

257
00:11:25,679 --> 00:11:26,678
Yeon Joo with the dig!

258
00:11:26,679 --> 00:11:27,678
C!

259
00:11:27,679 --> 00:11:28,779
C quick!

260
00:11:29,338 --> 00:11:31,638
Hyo Rim adjusts her platform
and feeds the left.

261
00:11:32,421 --> 00:11:34,654
A hard swing!

262
00:11:34,679 --> 00:11:35,812
(Right out of the park!)

263
00:11:35,945 --> 00:11:38,178
(Bravo!)

264
00:11:38,179 --> 00:11:39,679
It's 16 to 6.

265
00:11:40,888 --> 00:11:42,420
Let's go! Great work!

266
00:11:42,445 --> 00:11:43,512
(Right in their face!)

267
00:11:45,645 --> 00:11:47,206
- Don't worry about it. Just one point.
- Let's get it back.

268
00:11:50,345 --> 00:11:52,679
- Ye Eun serves again.
- Serve!

269
00:11:52,979 --> 00:11:53,978
- Boom!
- Boom!

270
00:11:53,979 --> 00:11:55,144
(Shaky pass again)

271
00:11:55,145 --> 00:11:56,144
- Short!
- Set it!

272
00:11:56,145 --> 00:11:57,812
Chae Hyeon with the back set.

273
00:11:59,045 --> 00:12:00,044
Yu Kyung digs it up.

274
00:12:00,045 --> 00:12:01,178
Fast C!

275
00:12:01,179 --> 00:12:02,179
(Enkhsoyol charges in.)

276
00:12:02,845 --> 00:12:03,845
Spike!

277
00:12:05,079 --> 00:12:06,879
Off the block and out!

278
00:12:07,312 --> 00:12:08,312
This is brutal.

279
00:12:08,679 --> 00:12:09,712
There we go.

280
00:12:09,879 --> 00:12:10,945
Out!

281
00:12:11,465 --> 00:12:14,765
(Enkhsoyol on an absolute tear)

282
00:12:15,312 --> 00:12:17,045
- Nice kill!
- Well done!

283
00:12:17,579 --> 00:12:18,612
- Enkhsoyol!
- Enkhsoyol!

284
00:12:18,637 --> 00:12:21,238
Enkhsoyol, baby boy

285
00:12:21,345 --> 00:12:22,345
- Enkhsoyol!
- Enkhsoyol!

286
00:12:22,379 --> 00:12:24,844
- They're in total control right now.
- Absolutely.

287
00:12:24,845 --> 00:12:26,478
Coach Kim always knew they could do this.

288
00:12:26,479 --> 00:12:28,135
Which is why she was so frustrated before.

289
00:12:28,159 --> 00:12:28,812
Exactly.

290
00:12:29,145 --> 00:12:31,045
(Clapping instead of scolding)

291
00:12:31,812 --> 00:12:34,711
(An 11-point lead)

292
00:12:34,712 --> 00:12:36,745
- Great hustle!
- Nice!

293
00:12:37,812 --> 00:12:41,345
(The Pink Spiders are in free fall.)

294
00:12:41,779 --> 00:12:44,445
(The players are stunned into silence.)

295
00:12:45,745 --> 00:12:48,345
We keep getting burned
by the exact same look!

296
00:12:53,112 --> 00:12:54,912
(Sub in)

297
00:12:56,045 --> 00:12:59,811
The Pink Spiders bring Eun Ji and Na Yeon
back onto the floor.

298
00:12:59,812 --> 00:13:01,912
(Eun Ji and Na Yeon check in
as emergency substitutes.)

299
00:13:02,345 --> 00:13:03,478
Heads up!

300
00:13:03,479 --> 00:13:05,579
We need a side-out!

301
00:13:08,612 --> 00:13:11,545
(Na Yeon steps up in a pinch.)

302
00:13:11,645 --> 00:13:12,679
Na Yeon!

303
00:13:12,845 --> 00:13:15,111
If the outside is closed,
look to the middle.

304
00:13:15,112 --> 00:13:16,145
(Nodding)

305
00:13:17,112 --> 00:13:18,678
Ye Eun remains at the service line.

306
00:13:18,679 --> 00:13:20,712
- Let's go! Boom!
- Let's go! Boom!

307
00:13:21,179 --> 00:13:22,478
Pass it up!

308
00:13:22,479 --> 00:13:24,012
(Running the middle as planned)

309
00:13:25,445 --> 00:13:26,444
Quick attack right down the middle!

310
00:13:26,445 --> 00:13:27,445
(Ripping through the block)

311
00:13:27,479 --> 00:13:29,479
- Good!
- Nice touch!

312
00:13:29,912 --> 00:13:30,979
We've got this.

313
00:13:31,212 --> 00:13:32,945
Someone needed to pull up on that!
There were two of you there.

314
00:13:33,312 --> 00:13:34,379
The seam.

315
00:13:35,279 --> 00:13:36,412
My fault!

316
00:13:36,879 --> 00:13:39,911
- Na Yeon clearly...
- Yes.

317
00:13:39,912 --> 00:13:42,278
studied the rotations closely
from the bench before checking in.

318
00:13:42,279 --> 00:13:44,279
Right. And she's making
an immediate impact.

319
00:13:45,145 --> 00:13:46,144
(Na Yeon checks in
and delivers right away.)

320
00:13:46,145 --> 00:13:47,445
Let's do this.

321
00:13:51,345 --> 00:13:53,345
I wasn't intimidated at all.

322
00:13:54,079 --> 00:13:56,168
If you're scared,
how do you expect to win?

323
00:14:00,279 --> 00:14:01,379
Na Yeon serves.

324
00:14:01,445 --> 00:14:03,545
Wonder Dogs up by ten.

325
00:14:04,079 --> 00:14:05,478
Watch the short drop!

326
00:14:05,479 --> 00:14:07,511
- Got it!
- Call the ball!

327
00:14:07,512 --> 00:14:09,578
- Let's go! Boom!
- Let's go! Boom!

328
00:14:09,579 --> 00:14:10,579
Mine!

329
00:14:10,645 --> 00:14:11,717
Enkhsoyol handles the receive.

330
00:14:11,912 --> 00:14:12,945
There.

331
00:14:14,645 --> 00:14:16,112
The timing was a bit off.

332
00:14:16,345 --> 00:14:17,745
(Free ball gifted across)

333
00:14:18,745 --> 00:14:20,311
Tip to the right! Blocked!

334
00:14:20,312 --> 00:14:21,312
C!

335
00:14:21,545 --> 00:14:22,545
C!

336
00:14:22,679 --> 00:14:23,678
- Mine!
- Seung Ju!

337
00:14:23,679 --> 00:14:25,212
Tip!

338
00:14:26,145 --> 00:14:27,145
Another tip, right on cue!

339
00:14:27,679 --> 00:14:29,479
Enkhsoyol digs it clean!

340
00:14:30,345 --> 00:14:31,412
Bo Been.

341
00:14:31,912 --> 00:14:33,745
Su Yeon keeps it in play.

342
00:14:34,079 --> 00:14:35,979
Over on three. Yeon Joo.

343
00:14:36,145 --> 00:14:37,778
- Chance!
- Chance ball!

344
00:14:37,779 --> 00:14:38,812
Fast C!

345
00:14:39,612 --> 00:14:40,912
Running through Hyo Rim.

346
00:14:42,512 --> 00:14:44,779
Tip covered! Seon Ah picks it up.

347
00:14:45,079 --> 00:14:46,112
Again!

348
00:14:46,545 --> 00:14:48,078
Go! Take it!

349
00:14:48,079 --> 00:14:49,079
Run it back!

350
00:14:56,112 --> 00:14:58,612
Enkhsoyol tips it over again!

351
00:14:59,545 --> 00:15:00,544
Good.

352
00:15:00,545 --> 00:15:03,745
(Dousing their rally cold)

353
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:06,911
- That was pure veteran instinct.
- Exactly.

354
00:15:06,912 --> 00:15:08,778
Just as the court was getting chaotic,

355
00:15:08,779 --> 00:15:11,579
Enkhsoyol found the open floor
and dropped it right in.

356
00:15:12,472 --> 00:15:14,505
Huge play, Enkhsoyol.

357
00:15:14,712 --> 00:15:16,412
Take a breath.

358
00:15:17,112 --> 00:15:18,578
It's 18 to 8 now.

359
00:15:18,579 --> 00:15:20,412
Wonder Dogs holding a 10-point cushion.

360
00:15:20,512 --> 00:15:22,379
(Up next at the line...)

361
00:15:23,945 --> 00:15:26,145
(Seung Ju)

362
00:15:29,112 --> 00:15:31,112
- Watch the short drop.
- On it!

363
00:15:31,279 --> 00:15:33,011
Help cover Enkhsoyol!

364
00:15:33,012 --> 00:15:34,012
(Seung Ju alert)

365
00:15:35,879 --> 00:15:36,879
Seung Ju serves.

366
00:15:38,179 --> 00:15:39,178
Mine!

367
00:15:39,179 --> 00:15:40,212
Shaky first contact.

368
00:15:40,812 --> 00:15:41,812
Cover!

369
00:15:41,879 --> 00:15:43,112
Ye Dam backpedals!

370
00:15:43,579 --> 00:15:45,079
High ball coming up!

371
00:15:45,479 --> 00:15:46,512
Seon Ah with the second touch.

372
00:15:46,745 --> 00:15:47,779
Enkhsoyol!

373
00:15:48,445 --> 00:15:49,478
Cover!

374
00:15:49,479 --> 00:15:50,478
Cover the block!

375
00:15:50,479 --> 00:15:51,544
Spike!

376
00:15:51,545 --> 00:15:52,578
Long!

377
00:15:52,579 --> 00:15:53,911
(Sailing out of bounds)

378
00:15:53,912 --> 00:15:55,812
It's called out.

379
00:15:58,445 --> 00:16:00,944
They have to stay sharp
when Seung Ju is serving.

380
00:16:00,945 --> 00:16:01,627
For sure.

381
00:16:01,876 --> 00:16:02,795
That's on me.

382
00:16:03,145 --> 00:16:04,212
My bad.

383
00:16:05,426 --> 00:16:06,526
Shake it off!

384
00:16:08,145 --> 00:16:09,878
Seung Ju back at the line.

385
00:16:09,879 --> 00:16:10,879
(Seung Ju ready to serve again)

386
00:16:11,339 --> 00:16:12,605
Watch the short ball first!

387
00:16:13,648 --> 00:16:14,778
Watch the tape!

388
00:16:14,779 --> 00:16:15,779
Ready!

389
00:16:19,812 --> 00:16:21,211
- Mine!
- Ye Eun with the pass.

390
00:16:21,212 --> 00:16:22,412
(High set)

391
00:16:22,779 --> 00:16:23,812
Free ball!

392
00:16:24,112 --> 00:16:25,187
Hyo Rim.

393
00:16:25,212 --> 00:16:26,252
It's dug up.

394
00:16:26,545 --> 00:16:28,412
- Enkhsoyol.
- Fast C!

395
00:16:30,205 --> 00:16:31,272
Push it deep!

396
00:16:31,379 --> 00:16:33,479
Enkhsoyol denied by the block.

397
00:16:34,179 --> 00:16:35,779
- Good try!
- Yes!

398
00:16:36,212 --> 00:16:37,279
That's it, easy.

399
00:16:40,679 --> 00:16:42,535
Why are you smashing down?

400
00:16:44,545 --> 00:16:47,011
Seung Ju's serve has plenty of bite on it.

401
00:16:47,012 --> 00:16:48,012
No doubt about it.

402
00:16:48,679 --> 00:16:49,812
(Can't let them build any momentum)

403
00:16:49,979 --> 00:16:51,779
One more! Let's get the side-out!

404
00:16:52,679 --> 00:16:54,744
Seung Ju stays on the serve.

405
00:16:54,745 --> 00:16:56,079
(Seung Ju serves
for the third straight point.)

406
00:16:56,345 --> 00:16:57,345
Mine!

407
00:16:57,879 --> 00:16:58,878
Right there!

408
00:16:58,879 --> 00:17:00,745
Ye Eun handles the pass. Hyo Rim.

409
00:17:01,345 --> 00:17:02,379
The line!

410
00:17:07,551 --> 00:17:09,250
(A surprise tip!)

411
00:17:09,251 --> 00:17:10,950
That is classic Hyo Rim right there.

412
00:17:10,951 --> 00:17:12,884
- Let's go!
- Let's do it!

413
00:17:12,885 --> 00:17:13,785
Nice!

414
00:17:15,946 --> 00:17:16,745
There we go!

415
00:17:16,746 --> 00:17:18,378
Hyo Rim always delivers on those.

416
00:17:18,379 --> 00:17:19,445
She sure does.

417
00:17:19,446 --> 00:17:20,979
And that stops the bleeding.

418
00:17:21,446 --> 00:17:24,479
Why didn't anyone cover? Cover the floor!

419
00:17:27,565 --> 00:17:30,732
(Caught flat-footed)

420
00:17:32,546 --> 00:17:35,113
(Hyo Rim makes it look so easy.)

421
00:17:35,451 --> 00:17:37,745
(Stepping up to the service line is...)

422
00:17:37,746 --> 00:17:40,712
Hyo Rim of the Wonder Dogs!

423
00:17:40,713 --> 00:17:41,779
Hyo Rim serves.

424
00:17:42,279 --> 00:17:45,813
(Eleven straight serves in Set 3 alone)

425
00:17:47,513 --> 00:17:48,279
Damn it.

426
00:17:48,679 --> 00:17:52,546
(Hyo Rim, the serving sharpshooter)

427
00:17:55,079 --> 00:17:57,413
Hey, she's going deep.
Let's get the side-out right here!

428
00:17:58,579 --> 00:18:00,846
(Full alert)

429
00:18:00,979 --> 00:18:03,779
(Let's see...)

430
00:18:08,713 --> 00:18:10,679
(Target locked)

431
00:18:12,746 --> 00:18:13,813
Zone 4.

432
00:18:15,413 --> 00:18:18,313
(Dialing in on Zone 4)

433
00:18:23,146 --> 00:18:24,045
Shaky first contact!

434
00:18:24,046 --> 00:18:25,113
(Bullseye)

435
00:18:25,946 --> 00:18:26,746
Na Yeon.

436
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:28,513
Spike from the right side.

437
00:18:31,179 --> 00:18:32,379
Hyo Rim digs it up!

438
00:18:34,579 --> 00:18:36,046
(Another chance for the Pink Spiders)

439
00:18:36,446 --> 00:18:37,813
Na Yeon sets the left pin.

440
00:18:39,146 --> 00:18:40,479
(Only a single block to beat)

441
00:18:40,713 --> 00:18:41,613
Yeon Joo!

442
00:18:42,413 --> 00:18:44,679
(The Flame Deer takes off.)

443
00:18:46,613 --> 00:18:47,478
Right pin!

444
00:18:47,479 --> 00:18:49,246
Stuffed at the net!

445
00:18:50,913 --> 00:18:51,713
There it is.

446
00:18:52,679 --> 00:18:55,379
(Veteran instincts on full display)

447
00:18:56,813 --> 00:18:58,845
Way to go, Yeon Joo!

448
00:18:58,846 --> 00:19:00,246
Thank you!

449
00:19:01,513 --> 00:19:03,278
Off Yeon Joo's hands!

450
00:19:03,279 --> 00:19:04,378
It's 20 to 10.

451
00:19:04,379 --> 00:19:07,479
(A 10-point cushion restored)

452
00:19:09,013 --> 00:19:10,212
Hyo Rim serves again.

453
00:19:10,213 --> 00:19:12,179
(Back-to-back serves from Hyo Rim)

454
00:19:18,413 --> 00:19:20,346
(Target acquired)

455
00:19:21,579 --> 00:19:22,746
(Aim for Zone 2.)

456
00:19:36,946 --> 00:19:37,944
Did that catch the line?

457
00:19:37,979 --> 00:19:39,445
Long!

458
00:19:39,446 --> 00:19:40,313
Out!

459
00:19:40,813 --> 00:19:42,046
In!

460
00:19:42,413 --> 00:19:44,150
- In!
- Didn't that hit the line?

461
00:19:46,346 --> 00:19:48,213
Down on the line!

462
00:19:48,806 --> 00:19:50,706
Ace number two for Hyo Rim!

463
00:19:50,729 --> 00:19:55,499
(Second service ace)

464
00:19:55,524 --> 00:19:58,657
Service aces have been pouring in
throughout Set 3.

465
00:19:59,881 --> 00:20:01,934
The lead stretches to 11.

466
00:20:03,514 --> 00:20:05,972
Na Yeon.

467
00:20:06,414 --> 00:20:08,881
(While the Pink Spiders regroup,)

468
00:20:09,381 --> 00:20:12,181
(Coach Kim lines up the next target.)

469
00:20:25,048 --> 00:20:27,514
(Zone 3 this time.)

470
00:20:35,248 --> 00:20:36,214
Seung Ju handles the receive.

471
00:20:36,548 --> 00:20:38,047
- Underhand pass.
- Da Eun.

472
00:20:38,048 --> 00:20:38,848
Da Eun.

473
00:20:39,514 --> 00:20:40,940
Watch the seam!

474
00:20:42,548 --> 00:20:43,881
- Kept alive!
- That's it!

475
00:20:44,485 --> 00:20:45,311
Look ahead!

476
00:20:45,848 --> 00:20:46,946
Tough ball to handle.

477
00:20:48,914 --> 00:20:49,949
She keeps it in play!

478
00:20:51,048 --> 00:20:52,347
Rip it, Enkhsoyol!

479
00:20:52,348 --> 00:20:53,314
Enkhsoyol!

480
00:20:56,948 --> 00:20:59,281
Pushes it into open space for the kill!

481
00:21:01,948 --> 00:21:04,714
(Three consecutive points)

482
00:21:08,781 --> 00:21:11,381
(Great play!)

483
00:21:14,781 --> 00:21:16,414
Great hustle!

484
00:21:17,281 --> 00:21:21,581
Hyo Rim somehow gets that set off
cleanly under pressure.

485
00:21:22,814 --> 00:21:23,980
Pushes it all the way out wide,

486
00:21:23,981 --> 00:21:26,180
giving Enkhsoyol
the perfect window to finish.

487
00:21:26,181 --> 00:21:27,214
Brilliant execution.

488
00:21:28,948 --> 00:21:30,947
(The Wonder Dogs are firing
on all cylinders.)

489
00:21:30,948 --> 00:21:32,748
Just a clinic of a third set!

490
00:21:33,181 --> 00:21:35,648
Get a solid pass
so we can run our offense!

491
00:21:37,448 --> 00:21:38,880
Stay aggressive!

492
00:21:38,881 --> 00:21:40,433
- It's 22 to 11.
- One more!

493
00:21:40,681 --> 00:21:42,613
They should limit the unforced errors...

494
00:21:42,614 --> 00:21:44,537
and see this through to the final whistle.

495
00:21:45,460 --> 00:21:46,526
(They're taking on a pro squad.)

496
00:21:46,527 --> 00:21:48,440
Keep battling, we've got this!

497
00:21:49,026 --> 00:21:50,692
Short balls are mine!

498
00:21:50,693 --> 00:21:52,360
(No room for complacency)

499
00:21:54,226 --> 00:21:56,159
Let's finish this!

500
00:21:56,160 --> 00:21:58,026
(Calling for a targeted serve)

501
00:21:58,826 --> 00:22:00,907
(Target)

502
00:22:00,932 --> 00:22:01,987
Run a C quick!

503
00:22:02,007 --> 00:22:03,249
(Enkhsoyol)

504
00:22:03,626 --> 00:22:05,925
Watch the short drop first!

505
00:22:05,926 --> 00:22:06,793
Yes, Coach.

506
00:22:07,426 --> 00:22:09,526
We need this side-out!

507
00:22:10,193 --> 00:22:10,993
Ye Rim serves.

508
00:22:11,646 --> 00:22:13,119
(Service targeted at Enkhsoyol)

509
00:22:17,600 --> 00:22:18,777
Ye Eun steps in to take the pass.

510
00:22:19,760 --> 00:22:20,560
Nice!

511
00:22:21,460 --> 00:22:22,259
Swing away!

512
00:22:22,260 --> 00:22:23,475
Rip it, Enkhsoyol!

513
00:22:23,893 --> 00:22:25,925
Enkhsoyol unloads on it!

514
00:22:25,926 --> 00:22:26,860
(Enkhsoyol puts it away.)

515
00:22:27,126 --> 00:22:28,260
There it is!

516
00:22:31,336 --> 00:22:32,793
(Cheering)

517
00:22:33,586 --> 00:22:34,953
Great finish, Enkhsoyol!

518
00:22:35,660 --> 00:22:37,959
Plugging Ye Eun into the rotation...

519
00:22:37,960 --> 00:22:40,860
has completely changed
the complexion of Set 3.

520
00:22:42,426 --> 00:22:43,892
(During the previous timeout)

521
00:22:43,893 --> 00:22:46,025
Enkhsoyol, if you hear me call "Mine,"
clear out,

522
00:22:46,026 --> 00:22:47,125
and get ready to hit.

523
00:22:47,126 --> 00:22:48,767
Don't worry about it.
Let's just play our ball.

524
00:22:49,726 --> 00:22:51,303
Watch the short drop.
I'll cover behind you.

525
00:22:51,893 --> 00:22:53,660
Short ball is mine!

526
00:22:55,060 --> 00:22:58,425
Facing heat like that,

527
00:22:58,426 --> 00:23:00,893
Ye Eun opened up her shoulders
and made a clean pass.

528
00:23:01,660 --> 00:23:03,425
With Ye Eun locking down the back row,

529
00:23:03,426 --> 00:23:05,959
Enkhsoyol is free to swing
with full confidence.

530
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:07,926
(Enkhsoyol's offense is rolling.)

531
00:23:08,360 --> 00:23:09,493
Let's get another!

532
00:23:10,293 --> 00:23:10,860
(A quick high five)

533
00:23:11,193 --> 00:23:13,193
Da Eun steps back to serve.

534
00:23:14,860 --> 00:23:15,826
Tough pass.

535
00:23:17,460 --> 00:23:18,726
(Followed by an awkward set)

536
00:23:19,193 --> 00:23:20,293
Covering!

537
00:23:21,026 --> 00:23:21,826
Heads up!

538
00:23:21,926 --> 00:23:22,993
Ye Eun rises up.

539
00:23:23,860 --> 00:23:24,859
She swings!

540
00:23:24,860 --> 00:23:26,026
Ye Eun with the kill!

541
00:23:29,060 --> 00:23:30,792
When Ye Eun passes, Enkhsoyol terminates.

542
00:23:30,793 --> 00:23:32,626
When Enkhsoyol passes, Ye Eun finishes.

543
00:23:33,226 --> 00:23:36,826
These two pins are
in complete sync right now!

544
00:23:37,226 --> 00:23:39,360
Their chemistry is clicking
on every rotation.

545
00:23:40,126 --> 00:23:45,626
I felt like I could lean
on Ye Eun completely today.

546
00:23:47,593 --> 00:23:50,159
Watching Enkhsoyol
rediscover her rhythm...

547
00:23:50,160 --> 00:23:51,893
made me so proud of her.

548
00:23:53,319 --> 00:23:55,953
(Fueled by the Enkhsoyol-Ye Eun
connection)

549
00:23:57,060 --> 00:24:01,126
The Wonder Dogs look like an entirely
different squad from Sets 1 and 2.

550
00:24:02,260 --> 00:24:03,909
They are in an absolute groove.

551
00:24:04,160 --> 00:24:06,426
And just look at that scoreboard.

552
00:24:07,493 --> 00:24:09,059
It's 24 to 12.

553
00:24:09,060 --> 00:24:12,160
The Wonder Dogs have doubled them up.
Set point, Set 3.

554
00:24:13,393 --> 00:24:14,620
Incredible turnaround.

555
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:20,360
(Stunned silence
on the Pink Spiders' bench)

556
00:24:24,460 --> 00:24:25,760
Watch that side.

557
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:29,926
Na Yeon!

558
00:24:31,260 --> 00:24:33,092
Run the middle quick...

559
00:24:33,093 --> 00:24:34,526
if a free ball comes across.

560
00:24:36,560 --> 00:24:37,909
- Call the slide.
- Got it.

561
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:39,645
I'll put one away for us.

562
00:24:39,926 --> 00:24:41,913
We're fine. We can turn this around!

563
00:24:43,560 --> 00:24:45,160
(Pumping herself up)

564
00:24:47,460 --> 00:24:48,560
Ye Dam serves.

565
00:24:49,926 --> 00:24:51,460
- Clean pass.
- Slide!

566
00:24:51,826 --> 00:24:53,260
Back set!

567
00:24:53,560 --> 00:24:54,326
Slide attack!

568
00:24:55,226 --> 00:24:56,325
Off the block and out.

569
00:24:56,326 --> 00:24:58,493
(Ji Su converts on the slide.)

570
00:24:59,126 --> 00:25:00,760
Good read. Keep that momentum going.

571
00:25:01,460 --> 00:25:02,925
Whenever they're in system,

572
00:25:02,926 --> 00:25:05,825
Na Yeon loves going to that slide.

573
00:25:05,826 --> 00:25:07,659
Exactly. Even with the Wonder Dogs
in full control,

574
00:25:07,660 --> 00:25:10,093
you can't sleep
on that Na Yeon-Ji Su connection.

575
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:12,793
(Keeping a sharp eye on the floor)

576
00:25:13,626 --> 00:25:14,393
Ji Su!

577
00:25:16,226 --> 00:25:17,793
- Look for the tip if it's there.
- The tip is open.

578
00:25:21,026 --> 00:25:24,093
Time to close the door on this set.

579
00:25:25,593 --> 00:25:26,693
Eun Ji serves.

580
00:25:27,493 --> 00:25:28,360
Solid pass.

581
00:25:30,793 --> 00:25:31,926
Big swing coming!

582
00:25:32,193 --> 00:25:33,760
Feeding Seung Ju on the left.

583
00:25:34,260 --> 00:25:35,193
Spike!

584
00:25:35,593 --> 00:25:37,760
- Tip!
- Tip!

585
00:25:39,060 --> 00:25:39,886
Watch the tip!

586
00:25:39,911 --> 00:25:41,159
Pushed short.

587
00:25:41,160 --> 00:25:41,993
Hey!

588
00:25:43,393 --> 00:25:45,992
(Ji Su scores again.)

589
00:25:45,993 --> 00:25:49,060
They can't let Ji Su heat up like this.

590
00:25:50,426 --> 00:25:52,992
Stop giving away cheap points!

591
00:25:52,993 --> 00:25:53,793
- Yes, Coach!
- Yes, Coach!

592
00:25:54,026 --> 00:25:55,693
I'll flash the signs again.

593
00:25:56,060 --> 00:25:57,693
Stay on your toes for the short drop.

594
00:26:01,526 --> 00:26:03,460
Na Yeon!

595
00:26:03,949 --> 00:26:06,008
(Signaling a back set)

596
00:26:06,741 --> 00:26:08,208
Run the back A off a free ball.

597
00:26:08,209 --> 00:26:08,934
Got it.

598
00:26:12,207 --> 00:26:13,807
The score is 24 to 14.

599
00:26:15,144 --> 00:26:16,010
Set it up!

600
00:26:16,011 --> 00:26:17,745
Bo Been bumps it to Yeon Joo.

601
00:26:18,533 --> 00:26:19,533
(Defense broken down)

602
00:26:20,615 --> 00:26:22,616
Dug up, and a back set.

603
00:26:24,253 --> 00:26:25,253
It's kept alive.

604
00:26:25,254 --> 00:26:26,269
(Barely keeping it alive)

605
00:26:26,855 --> 00:26:27,721
A push shot.

606
00:26:28,857 --> 00:26:29,588
Slide attack!

607
00:26:29,613 --> 00:26:30,747
Ji Su on the attack.

608
00:26:32,861 --> 00:26:33,861
Down for the kill.

609
00:26:34,562 --> 00:26:39,399
(Ji Su scores three in a row.)

610
00:26:40,236 --> 00:26:42,237
- Great play right there.
- Great job.

611
00:26:42,238 --> 00:26:43,838
Unlike earlier,

612
00:26:43,839 --> 00:26:46,707
the Wonder Dogs are leaking
far too many late points.

613
00:26:47,943 --> 00:26:49,007
Nice work, Na Yeon.

614
00:26:51,513 --> 00:26:53,345
They need to put this away now.

615
00:26:54,450 --> 00:26:55,981
Focus on this one!

616
00:26:56,460 --> 00:26:57,827
(First set)

617
00:26:57,852 --> 00:27:01,721
(The Wonder Dogs rattled off
seven straight points in Set 1.)

618
00:27:02,524 --> 00:27:05,559
Even with the win,
you want to finish on a clean note...

619
00:27:05,560 --> 00:27:07,461
to carry that momentum
into the next frame.

620
00:27:07,462 --> 00:27:08,496
(Third set, Pink Spiders 15
: Wonder Dogs 24)

621
00:27:08,497 --> 00:27:11,565
Even holding a big lead, this is no time
to take your foot off the gas.

622
00:27:11,566 --> 00:27:12,601
(The opponent is right on their heels.)

623
00:27:12,602 --> 00:27:14,668
Just run our system.

624
00:27:16,705 --> 00:27:18,105
Running a B or a back C is okay.

625
00:27:18,707 --> 00:27:20,107
Focus on clean execution.

626
00:27:20,209 --> 00:27:21,075
Understood.

627
00:27:21,943 --> 00:27:23,010
Let's run the B.

628
00:27:28,483 --> 00:27:30,384
Get ready for Bo Been's quick.

629
00:27:31,186 --> 00:27:32,419
I've got her.

630
00:27:32,964 --> 00:27:35,832
Set point in Set 3 for the Wonder Dogs.

631
00:27:35,857 --> 00:27:36,657
Mine.

632
00:27:36,925 --> 00:27:37,992
Enkhsoyol handles the pass.

633
00:27:37,993 --> 00:27:40,394
(Bo Been charging in)

634
00:27:40,428 --> 00:27:41,428
(Timing the approach)

635
00:27:41,663 --> 00:27:42,896
Hyo Rim with the back set!

636
00:27:43,231 --> 00:27:44,231
(Blocker completely fooled)

637
00:27:44,359 --> 00:27:46,060
(The set goes out to Yeon Joo.)

638
00:27:46,261 --> 00:27:47,127
Swing away!

639
00:27:47,535 --> 00:27:48,468
Put it down!

640
00:27:51,178 --> 00:27:53,312
Yeon Joo scores!

641
00:27:53,337 --> 00:27:54,539
Nice!

642
00:27:55,410 --> 00:27:58,278
(The veteran captain slams the door shut.)

643
00:27:58,279 --> 00:27:59,146
Nice one!

644
00:28:02,651 --> 00:28:05,586
At last, with a score of 25 to 15,

645
00:28:05,820 --> 00:28:08,488
the Wonder Dogs cruise
to a dominant 10-point victory.

646
00:28:08,489 --> 00:28:10,157
The Wonder Dogs take Set 3!

647
00:28:10,158 --> 00:28:11,158
(Set score, Pink Spiders 2
: Wonder Dogs 1)

648
00:28:12,337 --> 00:28:13,503
Never thought I'd see the day.

649
00:28:13,528 --> 00:28:14,395
(Feels surreal)

650
00:28:15,563 --> 00:28:19,299
(How does it feel to take a set
off a pro club by 10 points?)

651
00:28:19,601 --> 00:28:21,635
We had all the momentum rolling
in the third set.

652
00:28:23,305 --> 00:28:25,370
Still, in my head, it was just one set.

653
00:28:25,740 --> 00:28:27,340
The match isn't over.

654
00:28:27,776 --> 00:28:29,241
It's only the start of the battle.

655
00:28:30,345 --> 00:28:32,611
Even so, that was the moment
I started to believe,

656
00:28:33,148 --> 00:28:35,349
"We can definitely pull this off."

657
00:28:35,884 --> 00:28:37,017
That's what I thought.

658
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:41,521
They can definitely
slow down their offense.

659
00:28:42,424 --> 00:28:44,725
You got it. Right there.

660
00:28:45,761 --> 00:28:46,761
I caught the mosquito.

661
00:28:47,295 --> 00:28:48,327
Let's chase them down!

662
00:28:48,830 --> 00:28:49,630
Got it!

663
00:28:49,631 --> 00:28:50,397
(Chuckling)

664
00:28:50,700 --> 00:28:52,500
Yeah, let's hunt down the Pink Spiders.

665
00:28:53,402 --> 00:28:54,935
But they're Spiders.
I only got a mosquito.

666
00:28:55,370 --> 00:28:56,804
(Chuckling)

667
00:28:57,472 --> 00:29:01,141
(Strategy huddle for the fourth set)

668
00:29:07,349 --> 00:29:08,582
Na Yeon,

669
00:29:08,783 --> 00:29:10,784
their block shifts left in advance
during the rally.

670
00:29:12,087 --> 00:29:13,120
Left!

671
00:29:13,564 --> 00:29:16,866
(Anticipated the set to the left)

672
00:29:16,891 --> 00:29:18,258
Going out to Choi Eun Ji.

673
00:29:18,259 --> 00:29:22,496
(Wonder Dogs sealed the left pin.)

674
00:29:22,697 --> 00:29:24,031
Feed the right side instead.

675
00:29:24,032 --> 00:29:26,266
When the pass is up,
stay loose and swing easy.

676
00:29:26,734 --> 00:29:28,869
(Meanwhile,
over on the Wonder Dogs' bench)

677
00:29:28,870 --> 00:29:30,937
Between Eun Ji and Da Eun,
who is she feeding more?

678
00:29:31,058 --> 00:29:32,625
- Da Eun.
- She feeds Da Eun more.

679
00:29:33,641 --> 00:29:36,411
(Bled points to Da Eun's attacks)

680
00:29:36,412 --> 00:29:38,478
Da Eun turned it cross-court for a kill.

681
00:29:38,713 --> 00:29:39,714
It keeps going to Da Eun.

682
00:29:39,715 --> 00:29:42,249
So keep your eyes locked
on their middle blocker.

683
00:29:42,250 --> 00:29:45,085
Why are you committing here
when the play is over there?

684
00:29:45,720 --> 00:29:48,422
Get your hands over and set a solid block!

685
00:29:50,325 --> 00:29:51,325
(Stepping into the huddle)

686
00:29:53,528 --> 00:29:57,197
(Handing over a banana)

687
00:29:58,900 --> 00:30:00,977
(Coach Yoon's quiet support)

688
00:30:01,002 --> 00:30:03,035
- The service runs were great.
- Hyo Rim delivered at the line.

689
00:30:04,639 --> 00:30:06,139
(While Yeon Koung gives her fiery speech,)

690
00:30:06,875 --> 00:30:09,743
(Coach Yoon carefully peels a banana.)

691
00:30:11,413 --> 00:30:13,047
- Ye Eun is stepping up big.
- What?

692
00:30:13,048 --> 00:30:14,179
Ye Eun is playing well.

693
00:30:14,490 --> 00:30:16,977
(Nutrition delivered
alongside high praise)

694
00:30:17,819 --> 00:30:19,017
Ye Eun is amazing.

695
00:30:19,154 --> 00:30:20,730
This is exactly the look we needed, right?

696
00:30:20,755 --> 00:30:23,223
I had no idea she could hit that hard.

697
00:30:27,061 --> 00:30:28,595
Coach Kim is...

698
00:30:28,963 --> 00:30:30,230
eating a banana.

699
00:30:30,231 --> 00:30:31,565
She needs to recharge the tank.

700
00:30:31,566 --> 00:30:33,467
Even back in her playing days,

701
00:30:33,468 --> 00:30:35,734
I rarely ever caught her eating mid-match.

702
00:30:35,759 --> 00:30:39,072
True, she rarely ate during competition.

703
00:30:40,075 --> 00:30:41,907
It's a battle of stamina again.

704
00:30:41,932 --> 00:30:43,544
(Just like the Shujitsu match)

705
00:30:44,445 --> 00:30:46,112
(Meanwhile,
over on the Pink Spiders' bench)

706
00:30:46,113 --> 00:30:47,647
Listen up,

707
00:30:47,882 --> 00:30:50,417
we have to take this next set.

708
00:30:50,418 --> 00:30:51,284
Got it!

709
00:30:51,285 --> 00:30:53,151
If we let this one slip,
we're in serious trouble.

710
00:30:59,094 --> 00:31:00,362
Tighten up.

711
00:31:00,363 --> 00:31:02,329
Seung Ju will be communicating a lot
with the team.

712
00:31:02,330 --> 00:31:04,765
- Let's finish this early!
- We need to jump on them early.

713
00:31:04,766 --> 00:31:07,334
"Let's play clean." "Stay dialed in."

714
00:31:07,359 --> 00:31:08,626
She's going to rally the troops.

715
00:31:08,670 --> 00:31:10,037
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

716
00:31:10,038 --> 00:31:11,138
We've got this!

717
00:31:11,139 --> 00:31:12,706
(Set 4 is a test of sheer stamina.)

718
00:31:12,841 --> 00:31:14,241
- One, two, three.
- Let's go!

719
00:31:14,242 --> 00:31:15,842
(We have to take this set.)

720
00:31:15,843 --> 00:31:17,444
Grab the early momentum.

721
00:31:17,445 --> 00:31:18,778
Stay locked in.

722
00:31:19,914 --> 00:31:22,582
(Na Yeon steps up to serve.)

723
00:31:23,485 --> 00:31:24,418
(Fourth set, Pink Spiders 0
: Wonder Dogs 0)

724
00:31:24,419 --> 00:31:25,719
Set 4 is underway.

725
00:31:27,319 --> 00:31:28,531
(Clean first pass)

726
00:31:28,556 --> 00:31:29,389
Cover.

727
00:31:29,390 --> 00:31:30,824
(Facing a two-man block)

728
00:31:30,849 --> 00:31:31,782
Swing!

729
00:31:31,887 --> 00:31:33,159
A push shot.

730
00:31:33,261 --> 00:31:34,194
(Na Yeon digs it up.)

731
00:31:36,498 --> 00:31:37,431
Free ball over.

732
00:31:37,432 --> 00:31:38,433
(Free ball)

733
00:31:38,434 --> 00:31:39,333
Set it up high.

734
00:31:39,358 --> 00:31:41,159
- Pop it up!
- Cover.

735
00:31:41,369 --> 00:31:42,970
Ye Dam sets it up. Yeon Joo!

736
00:31:43,471 --> 00:31:44,604
(Effortless defense)

737
00:31:44,939 --> 00:31:45,972
(Pushing the set to the right pin)

738
00:31:46,741 --> 00:31:48,575
Da Eun takes a cut, but gets stuffed!

739
00:31:48,576 --> 00:31:49,409
(Block stands tall.)

740
00:31:50,378 --> 00:31:51,511
Enkhsoyol, take a breath.

741
00:31:51,512 --> 00:31:52,778
Enkhsoyol with a standing spike.

742
00:31:53,756 --> 00:31:54,974
(Digging it off her elbow)

743
00:31:55,575 --> 00:31:57,307
Seung Ju on the left.

744
00:31:58,062 --> 00:31:59,062
Spike!

745
00:31:59,087 --> 00:31:59,920
(Ball ricochets up.)

746
00:31:59,921 --> 00:32:01,221
Popped up high off the block!

747
00:32:01,456 --> 00:32:02,423
Mine!

748
00:32:02,991 --> 00:32:04,258
Ye Eun handles the first touch.

749
00:32:04,259 --> 00:32:05,092
Run the C!

750
00:32:05,093 --> 00:32:06,493
Hyo Rim pushes it out to the left pin.

751
00:32:06,561 --> 00:32:07,661
Enkhsoyol takes a swing!

752
00:32:08,196 --> 00:32:09,029
Set it up!

753
00:32:09,597 --> 00:32:10,430
To the right!

754
00:32:10,431 --> 00:32:11,431
It's a tip!

755
00:32:14,144 --> 00:32:15,635
(Perfectly read the tip)

756
00:32:15,660 --> 00:32:18,105
Clean pickup.
Na Yeon sets it to the middle.

757
00:32:18,106 --> 00:32:19,039
(An off-speed tip)

758
00:32:19,040 --> 00:32:21,506
Watch the tip! Please!

759
00:32:23,257 --> 00:32:24,976
Enkhsoyol keeps it alive!

760
00:32:25,713 --> 00:32:26,813
To the middle!

761
00:32:26,814 --> 00:32:27,847
I'm on it.

762
00:32:27,848 --> 00:32:29,316
(Attempting a surprise back-row attack)

763
00:32:29,417 --> 00:32:31,852
(Determined to lock down the first point)

764
00:32:32,129 --> 00:32:33,196
(An open net)

765
00:32:33,432 --> 00:32:35,122
Back-row attack!

766
00:32:36,357 --> 00:32:37,958
(Out)

767
00:32:38,593 --> 00:32:40,694
- It went long.
- Yes.

768
00:32:46,301 --> 00:32:47,167
Hey!

769
00:32:48,002 --> 00:32:49,769
- Heads up!
- Sorry, bad ball.

770
00:32:49,947 --> 00:32:52,215
Don't rush to finish the play.

771
00:32:52,240 --> 00:32:53,574
Just cut the errors!

772
00:32:54,185 --> 00:32:55,418
It's 0 to 1.

773
00:32:55,443 --> 00:32:59,113
That's the first time all match
the Pink Spiders have drawn first blood.

774
00:32:59,114 --> 00:33:00,080
(Fourth set, Pink Spiders 1
: Wonder Dogs 0)

775
00:33:01,422 --> 00:33:02,656
Hyo Rim.

776
00:33:02,657 --> 00:33:05,358
Run a B to back C.

777
00:33:05,593 --> 00:33:06,860
B to back C.

778
00:33:08,095 --> 00:33:08,928
(Checking the call)

779
00:33:10,030 --> 00:33:10,896
Back C.

780
00:33:11,065 --> 00:33:13,199
(Back C, noted.)

781
00:33:15,882 --> 00:33:16,695
Mine!

782
00:33:16,770 --> 00:33:17,737
Ye Eun handles the first pass.

783
00:33:17,738 --> 00:33:18,971
(The veteran steps back
to take the back-C set.)

784
00:33:18,972 --> 00:33:19,839
Hyo Rim.

785
00:33:21,108 --> 00:33:22,408
Yeon Joo, a push shot.

786
00:33:22,743 --> 00:33:23,543
Mine!

787
00:33:24,178 --> 00:33:25,044
Good!

788
00:33:25,045 --> 00:33:26,713
(This time for the opposite veteran)

789
00:33:26,714 --> 00:33:27,614
(Shutting down the seam)

790
00:33:29,316 --> 00:33:31,784
Seung Ju cuts back against the grain.

791
00:33:32,219 --> 00:33:34,587
- That's Seung Ju's bread and butter.
- Absolutely.

792
00:33:35,499 --> 00:33:38,401
Snapping her wrist to create sharp angles.

793
00:33:38,426 --> 00:33:39,226
Exactly.

794
00:33:39,227 --> 00:33:41,228
(Her signature sharp cross-court cut)

795
00:33:44,698 --> 00:33:46,032
Score moves to 2 to 0.

796
00:33:46,033 --> 00:33:47,409
They need to stop the bleeding right here.

797
00:33:47,457 --> 00:33:48,126
Mine.

798
00:33:48,151 --> 00:33:49,495
Ye Eun fields the serve.

799
00:33:49,570 --> 00:33:50,370
Set it up.

800
00:33:50,604 --> 00:33:51,504
Cover!

801
00:33:51,505 --> 00:33:52,271
(Another back-C set)

802
00:33:52,673 --> 00:33:54,307
(Seung Ju alone on the block)

803
00:33:56,186 --> 00:33:58,120
Yeon Joo takes a swing, but gets denied!

804
00:33:58,145 --> 00:33:58,878
(Seung Ju wins the battle at the tape.)

805
00:33:59,914 --> 00:34:00,947
Nice!

806
00:34:03,684 --> 00:34:06,320
Yeon Joo, that approach was too slow.

807
00:34:06,321 --> 00:34:07,120
Was it?

808
00:34:08,589 --> 00:34:09,522
It's okay.

809
00:34:10,425 --> 00:34:12,793
Let me take the solo block.
Just read the short tip.

810
00:34:12,961 --> 00:34:15,494
If it's deep, shift out left.

811
00:34:18,966 --> 00:34:20,667
Stick with the A and C.

812
00:34:22,002 --> 00:34:23,235
And remember,

813
00:34:23,304 --> 00:34:25,472
Enkhsoyol likes to rip cross-court...

814
00:34:25,473 --> 00:34:27,574
instead of taking the line.

815
00:34:27,575 --> 00:34:28,909
So don't overcommit. Hold your spot.

816
00:34:28,910 --> 00:34:29,776
(Seung Ju taking charge)

817
00:34:29,777 --> 00:34:30,710
Short balls are on me.

818
00:34:30,711 --> 00:34:33,446
(Fourth set, Pink Spiders 4
: Wonder Dogs 0)

819
00:34:34,315 --> 00:34:36,249
(Time to stop this slide.)

820
00:34:40,888 --> 00:34:41,821
Swing!

821
00:34:42,056 --> 00:34:42,922
C!

822
00:34:43,433 --> 00:34:44,767
(Setting Enkhsoyol as planned)

823
00:34:44,792 --> 00:34:45,691
Swing it!

824
00:34:45,692 --> 00:34:47,019
It's a deep one.

825
00:34:47,044 --> 00:34:47,927
(Anticipating a cross-court blast)

826
00:34:51,365 --> 00:34:52,999
Enkhsoyol cuts right through!

827
00:34:53,000 --> 00:34:54,701
(Going down the line
instead of cross-court)

828
00:34:54,702 --> 00:34:56,402
- Are you serving?
- Great hit!

829
00:34:56,403 --> 00:34:59,439
(Fourth set, Pink Spiders 4
: Wonder Dogs 1)

830
00:34:59,607 --> 00:35:01,474
Let's shake it off.

831
00:35:02,476 --> 00:35:06,012
(Time to battle back.)

832
00:35:06,690 --> 00:35:07,990
Score is 1 to 4.

833
00:35:08,015 --> 00:35:09,516
(Enkhsoyol at the service line)

834
00:35:09,517 --> 00:35:10,283
Serve!

835
00:35:12,119 --> 00:35:12,952
Mine!

836
00:35:12,953 --> 00:35:14,053
(Shaky pass)

837
00:35:14,054 --> 00:35:14,987
There it is.

838
00:35:15,890 --> 00:35:17,223
Na Yeon with the back set.

839
00:35:17,625 --> 00:35:18,717
Take your cut!

840
00:35:19,093 --> 00:35:19,993
Going to Da Eun!

841
00:35:22,396 --> 00:35:24,697
(They anticipated Da Eun's swing.)

842
00:35:26,476 --> 00:35:28,678
Da Eun rips it down the line. Touch-out.

843
00:35:28,703 --> 00:35:29,702
Hey!

844
00:35:31,438 --> 00:35:32,464
Cover the line.

845
00:35:32,973 --> 00:35:35,741
Da Eun is slowly finding her range.

846
00:35:36,744 --> 00:35:38,511
(Thumbs up)

847
00:35:38,512 --> 00:35:40,347
Ye Eun, you have to be set
before she takes off!

848
00:35:40,348 --> 00:35:42,983
Get outside and seal that line!

849
00:35:42,984 --> 00:35:44,284
Get out there!

850
00:35:44,518 --> 00:35:45,417
Understood.

851
00:35:47,554 --> 00:35:49,088
(Fourth set, Pink Spiders 5
: Wonder Dogs 3)

852
00:35:49,089 --> 00:35:50,356
It's 3 to 5.

853
00:35:51,925 --> 00:35:52,725
I'll serve.

854
00:35:53,961 --> 00:35:54,861
Mine!

855
00:35:55,996 --> 00:35:56,722
Na Yeon.

856
00:35:56,747 --> 00:35:57,507
(To Da Eun again)

857
00:35:57,531 --> 00:35:58,598
Seal the line.

858
00:35:59,133 --> 00:36:01,001
(Glued to the line)

859
00:36:01,602 --> 00:36:03,236
(I have to shut the door this time.)

860
00:36:04,944 --> 00:36:05,853
A little hop.

861
00:36:05,873 --> 00:36:06,740
There it is.

862
00:36:06,740 --> 00:36:08,773
(Another straight shot)

863
00:36:09,607 --> 00:36:11,507
I told you to clear out!

864
00:36:11,807 --> 00:36:12,973
Shake it off.

865
00:36:12,973 --> 00:36:15,173
(The back-row defense is
causing trouble again.)

866
00:36:15,173 --> 00:36:17,840
- Great hustle.
- Keep it up.

867
00:36:18,573 --> 00:36:23,007
Da Eun seems to have noticed
the line is wide open.

868
00:36:23,007 --> 00:36:23,807
Exactly.

869
00:36:24,673 --> 00:36:27,207
One point at a time.

870
00:36:28,273 --> 00:36:30,940
I knew our team needed
to swing the momentum,

871
00:36:30,940 --> 00:36:32,773
but things just weren't falling our way,

872
00:36:32,773 --> 00:36:33,807
and it was getting so frustrating.

873
00:36:33,807 --> 00:36:36,773
I had to step up.
I had to make something happen.

874
00:36:36,773 --> 00:36:38,507
That really lit a fire under me.

875
00:36:40,007 --> 00:36:41,007
Hyo Rim.

876
00:36:41,007 --> 00:36:42,873
You can set it to Ye Eun more.

877
00:36:42,873 --> 00:36:43,840
Got it.

878
00:36:43,840 --> 00:36:45,173
I'm on it.

879
00:36:46,740 --> 00:36:48,540
- Wonder Dogs!
- Wonder Dogs!

880
00:36:49,073 --> 00:36:51,173
The score is 6 to 3, down by three.

881
00:36:51,740 --> 00:36:52,707
Hye Rim serves.

882
00:36:55,840 --> 00:36:57,040
(Good reception)

883
00:36:57,340 --> 00:36:58,073
Out to the left.

884
00:36:59,707 --> 00:37:01,807
(Back to Ye Eun)

885
00:37:02,640 --> 00:37:03,640
That's it.

886
00:37:03,640 --> 00:37:04,540
Put it away!

887
00:37:05,707 --> 00:37:06,940
Crushed it!

888
00:37:06,940 --> 00:37:07,740
Point!

889
00:37:07,740 --> 00:37:10,307
(A straight shot in response)

890
00:37:10,540 --> 00:37:11,473
Nice!

891
00:37:15,207 --> 00:37:16,740
(Ye Eun alert issued.)

892
00:37:16,740 --> 00:37:17,873
Off-speed, then back to pace.

893
00:37:18,573 --> 00:37:19,607
Tip.

894
00:37:24,873 --> 00:37:26,507
(Another serve)

895
00:37:27,640 --> 00:37:28,573
Min Ji handles the pass.

896
00:37:29,440 --> 00:37:30,840
(A surprise attack through the middle)

897
00:37:31,173 --> 00:37:32,040
Dig it!

898
00:37:34,240 --> 00:37:35,340
Kept in play!

899
00:37:36,317 --> 00:37:37,091
Mine.

900
00:37:37,116 --> 00:37:38,095
Free ball over.

901
00:37:40,107 --> 00:37:41,907
(Signaling the play)

902
00:37:43,507 --> 00:37:44,974
(The ball is heading toward Min Ji.)

903
00:37:45,073 --> 00:37:46,640
(What?)

904
00:37:47,640 --> 00:37:49,707
(A costly mistake)

905
00:37:55,140 --> 00:37:56,007
What happened there?

906
00:37:59,536 --> 00:38:01,318
I sent you a sign.

907
00:38:01,319 --> 00:38:02,437
Why did you come like that?

908
00:38:03,207 --> 00:38:04,073
My bad.

909
00:38:05,007 --> 00:38:06,007
It's fine, shake it off.

910
00:38:07,207 --> 00:38:09,507
(An opponent's mistake is...)

911
00:38:10,740 --> 00:38:12,507
(our opportunity.)

912
00:38:12,635 --> 00:38:14,807
(Quickly giving instructions
to seize the opportunity)

913
00:38:15,173 --> 00:38:18,007
Bo Been, rip it down the line.

914
00:38:18,374 --> 00:38:19,373
Back to a two-point game.

915
00:38:20,314 --> 00:38:21,114
Ye Eun.

916
00:38:22,573 --> 00:38:23,407
Let's go.

917
00:38:23,407 --> 00:38:24,207
Hyo Rim.

918
00:38:24,440 --> 00:38:26,007
(The ball goes to Bo Been as planned.)

919
00:38:26,007 --> 00:38:27,007
Run the system.

920
00:38:27,007 --> 00:38:28,573
- Min Ji.
- Settle down.

921
00:38:30,640 --> 00:38:31,573
Slide.

922
00:38:31,573 --> 00:38:33,240
Great dig by Su Yeon!

923
00:38:33,573 --> 00:38:34,740
Out to Min Ji!

924
00:38:34,740 --> 00:38:35,873
(Spike)

925
00:38:36,407 --> 00:38:37,906
- Enkhsoyol pops it up!
- Transition!

926
00:38:38,107 --> 00:38:39,173
Take your swing!

927
00:38:39,173 --> 00:38:39,973
Cover!

928
00:38:40,307 --> 00:38:41,207
Yeon Joo.

929
00:38:46,340 --> 00:38:48,707
(We made an unforced error, too.)

930
00:38:48,707 --> 00:38:50,656
- It's okay, let's reset!
- Talk to each other!

931
00:38:51,940 --> 00:38:54,040
Both sides are getting rattled,

932
00:38:54,040 --> 00:38:55,507
and the errors are piling up.

933
00:38:57,073 --> 00:38:58,507
(Whispering)

934
00:38:58,532 --> 00:38:59,332
Understood.

935
00:39:02,640 --> 00:39:05,307
Ye Eun, lock your eyes
on their middle blocker!

936
00:39:07,640 --> 00:39:09,573
Da Eun keeps the run going from the line.

937
00:39:11,307 --> 00:39:12,807
- Mine!
- Dropping short!

938
00:39:12,807 --> 00:39:13,996
She dives forward to pass it!

939
00:39:14,248 --> 00:39:15,048
Swing!

940
00:39:15,073 --> 00:39:16,288
Back quick from the middle!

941
00:39:16,607 --> 00:39:17,973
- Ji Su!
- Ji Su!

942
00:39:18,907 --> 00:39:19,740
Ji Su!

943
00:39:21,873 --> 00:39:23,140
Ye Eun. Back set. Slide!

944
00:39:23,873 --> 00:39:24,907
Ji Su puts it down!

945
00:39:24,907 --> 00:39:25,940
(Ji Su's slide attack succeeds.)

946
00:39:27,107 --> 00:39:28,282
Beautifully executed.

947
00:39:28,307 --> 00:39:29,707
Ji Su, keep moving your feet!

948
00:39:29,707 --> 00:39:30,740
Got it.

949
00:39:30,740 --> 00:39:32,607
The opponent is starting to settle down.

950
00:39:32,607 --> 00:39:35,594
Commit inside! She's
their only live option!

951
00:39:35,594 --> 00:39:37,020
(Frustrated)

952
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:38,940
I had a read on it, though.

953
00:39:41,540 --> 00:39:43,664
We spent the whole time
playing from behind,

954
00:39:43,688 --> 00:39:46,473
constantly chasing the score.

955
00:39:49,640 --> 00:39:51,607
(We can't let the gap widen.)

956
00:39:53,007 --> 00:39:56,740
If we just lock down our blocking,

957
00:39:56,740 --> 00:39:58,340
we take this game.

958
00:39:59,607 --> 00:40:02,307
When they have two front-row attackers,

959
00:40:02,507 --> 00:40:05,860
this is when we need
to score a lot of points.

960
00:40:06,429 --> 00:40:11,373
The reason this is our opportunity when
they have two front-row attackers is...

961
00:40:12,074 --> 00:40:13,540
- No back-row attack to worry about.
- Exactly.

962
00:40:13,540 --> 00:40:15,873
That's why we only need to watch
the front-row attackers.

963
00:40:16,340 --> 00:40:18,273
(The setter is in the front row,)

964
00:40:18,273 --> 00:40:20,307
(leaving only two front-row attackers.)

965
00:40:20,607 --> 00:40:23,907
(Just focus
on those two front-row attackers.)

966
00:40:25,307 --> 00:40:31,140
(In particular, the OH must mark
the opponent's middle blocker.)

967
00:40:31,140 --> 00:40:33,473
This is where we have to cash in
on points!

968
00:40:33,840 --> 00:40:34,773
Got it?

969
00:40:35,207 --> 00:40:39,307
(The coach reiterates the point
to the OH during the timeout.)

970
00:40:40,040 --> 00:40:45,840
(Watch only their middle blocker.)

971
00:40:46,940 --> 00:40:50,507
(You only have one player to watch.)

972
00:40:54,173 --> 00:40:55,407
(If you time your jump right,
you can block it.)

973
00:40:55,407 --> 00:40:58,407
In this rotation, she has to seal
that attack lane completely.

974
00:40:58,407 --> 00:40:59,240
No doubt about it.

975
00:40:59,773 --> 00:41:00,640
Sweet set.

976
00:41:01,873 --> 00:41:03,273
Watch whether it's a back A or a slide!

977
00:41:03,273 --> 00:41:04,799
I told you not to take your eyes off her!

978
00:41:04,800 --> 00:41:05,307
Okay.

979
00:41:06,440 --> 00:41:08,640
(OH, just watch their middle blocker.)

980
00:41:08,640 --> 00:41:09,907
Let's run it back!

981
00:41:11,307 --> 00:41:12,907
(Will the strategy work this time?)

982
00:41:12,907 --> 00:41:14,040
Da Eun at the service line.

983
00:41:15,607 --> 00:41:17,173
Seon Ah stumbles on the receive!

984
00:41:17,673 --> 00:41:18,940
Ye Eun with a tip.

985
00:41:18,940 --> 00:41:19,907
Off the hands!

986
00:41:20,173 --> 00:41:20,973
Back quick!

987
00:41:23,240 --> 00:41:25,173
Inside!

988
00:41:25,173 --> 00:41:25,940
Dig it!

989
00:41:27,207 --> 00:41:28,764
Another hammer through the middle!

990
00:41:29,140 --> 00:41:32,440
(Failed to mark the middle blocker)

991
00:41:33,373 --> 00:41:35,240
Why weren't your feet set?

992
00:41:36,240 --> 00:41:37,773
You can't just stand flat-footed!

993
00:41:37,773 --> 00:41:38,973
Get moving!

994
00:41:40,073 --> 00:41:41,207
(All you need to do is
watch their middle blocker.)

995
00:41:41,207 --> 00:41:44,107
They've been killing us
with those looks all day.

996
00:41:44,107 --> 00:41:47,273
Honestly, we didn't see
many of those in the third set.

997
00:41:47,273 --> 00:41:49,607
Which shows that
when the Pink Spiders find their groove,

998
00:41:49,607 --> 00:41:52,073
they run their middle blockers
so much better.

999
00:41:52,907 --> 00:41:56,140
The real test is how we adjust to it.

1000
00:41:56,473 --> 00:41:57,907
When are you going to step up?

1001
00:41:59,040 --> 00:42:00,573
Our outside blocker...

1002
00:42:00,573 --> 00:42:03,840
I wasn't happy with her
positioning on that block at all.

1003
00:42:04,073 --> 00:42:06,907
We can't let this deficit get any bigger.

1004
00:42:07,173 --> 00:42:09,473
Na Yeon, you're giving up
too many tool touches.

1005
00:42:09,473 --> 00:42:11,373
When you drift outside,
pull your hands back and let it sail.

1006
00:42:13,373 --> 00:42:14,940
(A pipe attack is also an option.)

1007
00:42:16,807 --> 00:42:17,673
Enkhsoyol.

1008
00:42:17,698 --> 00:42:20,249
(Get ready for a back-row attack.)

1009
00:42:21,507 --> 00:42:22,740
Dropping short!

1010
00:42:22,740 --> 00:42:24,407
(We need to close the gap.)

1011
00:42:24,407 --> 00:42:25,840
They have to chase that down!

1012
00:42:27,640 --> 00:42:28,440
Mine!

1013
00:42:28,873 --> 00:42:29,640
Seon Ah.

1014
00:42:29,640 --> 00:42:30,540
Go.

1015
00:42:30,840 --> 00:42:31,840
Hyo Rim.

1016
00:42:31,840 --> 00:42:32,607
Slide.

1017
00:42:33,007 --> 00:42:34,907
- Covered!
- It's a C-quick.

1018
00:42:35,973 --> 00:42:37,107
If Na Yeon is matched up there...

1019
00:42:37,107 --> 00:42:38,273
(Targeting Na Yeon, whose block is low)

1020
00:42:38,273 --> 00:42:39,240
Ye Eun closes fast!

1021
00:42:40,073 --> 00:42:41,040
Again!

1022
00:42:41,673 --> 00:42:43,340
- Take your time.
- Covered again!

1023
00:42:43,340 --> 00:42:44,407
Gearing up for another swing!

1024
00:42:44,407 --> 00:42:46,107
- Put it away!
- Finish this!

1025
00:42:46,107 --> 00:42:47,143
(Openly targeting Na Yeon)

1026
00:42:47,807 --> 00:42:48,601
Spike!

1027
00:42:48,601 --> 00:42:49,679
(She gets through.)

1028
00:42:49,940 --> 00:42:50,740
Nicely done!

1029
00:42:50,744 --> 00:42:51,647
Hang on!

1030
00:42:55,707 --> 00:42:57,473
(They keep it alive.)

1031
00:42:57,473 --> 00:42:59,140
(And right back up.)

1032
00:42:59,540 --> 00:43:00,473
Free ball coming over!

1033
00:43:00,873 --> 00:43:01,673
Seon Ah first.

1034
00:43:02,473 --> 00:43:04,307
- Watch it!
- Back A!

1035
00:43:04,307 --> 00:43:05,573
Running the back A!

1036
00:43:05,907 --> 00:43:06,840
Where's the set going?

1037
00:43:07,307 --> 00:43:08,307
Pipe attack!

1038
00:43:08,607 --> 00:43:09,707
Through Hyo Rim!

1039
00:43:10,307 --> 00:43:11,873
Take a crack at it!

1040
00:43:14,007 --> 00:43:15,440
Crushed through the middle!

1041
00:43:15,440 --> 00:43:16,740
(They manage to block it.)

1042
00:43:17,340 --> 00:43:18,107
Mine!

1043
00:43:18,940 --> 00:43:20,073
Min Ji, take a cut!

1044
00:43:20,073 --> 00:43:21,007
Min Ji.

1045
00:43:22,573 --> 00:43:23,940
Enkhsoyol digs it out from deep!

1046
00:43:23,940 --> 00:43:24,840
Oh, boy!

1047
00:43:26,707 --> 00:43:27,640
Soft tip!

1048
00:43:28,740 --> 00:43:30,540
The Pink Spiders keep
the ball alive again.

1049
00:43:30,540 --> 00:43:31,607
Oh, boy!

1050
00:43:31,940 --> 00:43:32,873
Min Ji.

1051
00:43:35,007 --> 00:43:36,073
Min Ji.

1052
00:43:37,573 --> 00:43:38,540
Open up!

1053
00:43:40,333 --> 00:43:41,377
Ye Eun tips it over.

1054
00:43:41,378 --> 00:43:42,893
But they keep it off the floor again!

1055
00:43:42,907 --> 00:43:45,040
(Na Yeon's fighting spirit)

1056
00:43:47,040 --> 00:43:48,240
Min Ji, just go for it!

1057
00:43:50,507 --> 00:43:51,640
Ye Eun in perfect position.

1058
00:43:51,640 --> 00:43:52,673
She digs it up.

1059
00:43:54,340 --> 00:43:55,107
It's coming back.

1060
00:43:55,607 --> 00:43:56,740
Transitioning for another attack!

1061
00:43:56,740 --> 00:43:57,707
Let's go.

1062
00:43:57,940 --> 00:44:00,073
Na Yeon, pull your hands back
if she swings wide!

1063
00:44:01,540 --> 00:44:03,007
Na Yeon pulls her hands back!

1064
00:44:03,607 --> 00:44:04,540
Touch!

1065
00:44:04,940 --> 00:44:06,473
Spike!

1066
00:44:06,473 --> 00:44:08,007
They finish this rally with a point!

1067
00:44:09,207 --> 00:44:10,373
(She avoids Na Yeon's trap.)

1068
00:44:10,373 --> 00:44:11,440
There it is!

1069
00:44:13,907 --> 00:44:15,307
Oh, man.

1070
00:44:17,507 --> 00:44:18,740
Great.

1071
00:44:18,740 --> 00:44:20,007
Everyone is running on fumes out there.

1072
00:44:20,907 --> 00:44:23,073
We just have to grind through it together.

1073
00:44:24,807 --> 00:44:25,807
Hyo Rim.

1074
00:44:26,073 --> 00:44:27,807
Take the pipe out of the rotation.

1075
00:44:27,807 --> 00:44:28,907
You always telegraph that look.

1076
00:44:28,907 --> 00:44:30,807
Take that out of the play.

1077
00:44:30,807 --> 00:44:32,381
(Planned play is just
as important as scoring.)

1078
00:44:33,140 --> 00:44:34,573
Just side out on the first ball.

1079
00:44:34,573 --> 00:44:38,773
(With the setter still in the front row,
there are only two attackers available.)

1080
00:44:39,240 --> 00:44:43,373
(OH, just watch their middle blocker.)

1081
00:44:43,373 --> 00:44:45,940
(Enkhsoyol,
just watch their middle blocker.)

1082
00:44:46,573 --> 00:44:48,673
Enkhsoyol, watch Ji Su.

1083
00:44:48,673 --> 00:44:50,873
Stay on her, Enkhsoyol.

1084
00:44:51,307 --> 00:44:53,740
(Keeping a close eye on the block)

1085
00:44:54,473 --> 00:44:56,840
Now, Ye Eun is serving.

1086
00:44:58,607 --> 00:44:59,673
Trailing by four.

1087
00:44:59,673 --> 00:45:00,773
(Ye Eun's serve)

1088
00:45:01,773 --> 00:45:02,711
Pass comes up short!

1089
00:45:03,140 --> 00:45:04,273
Underhand bump set.

1090
00:45:04,273 --> 00:45:06,140
Tip!

1091
00:45:06,140 --> 00:45:07,307
Min Ji drops a soft tip!

1092
00:45:07,773 --> 00:45:08,873
Ji Su keeps it off the floor!

1093
00:45:08,873 --> 00:45:09,740
Back to Min Ji!

1094
00:45:10,307 --> 00:45:12,273
- Rip it!
- Set behind her!

1095
00:45:13,773 --> 00:45:14,607
Go!

1096
00:45:16,373 --> 00:45:17,607
She's scrambling to get there!

1097
00:45:18,373 --> 00:45:19,740
(A high ball)

1098
00:45:19,743 --> 00:45:20,565
Back A!

1099
00:45:20,590 --> 00:45:21,548
(Now it's Enkhsoyol's turn.)

1100
00:45:21,573 --> 00:45:23,607
Enkhsoyol, stay on Ji Su.

1101
00:45:23,607 --> 00:45:24,573
Back A!

1102
00:45:26,773 --> 00:45:28,740
(Checking on Enkhsoyol)

1103
00:45:28,740 --> 00:45:29,840
Enkhsoyol.

1104
00:45:29,840 --> 00:45:30,740
Back A!

1105
00:45:31,507 --> 00:45:32,707
Behind Na Yeon!

1106
00:45:32,707 --> 00:45:34,707
(The expected attack pattern)

1107
00:45:34,707 --> 00:45:36,073
Come over!

1108
00:45:39,407 --> 00:45:40,640
Wiped off the block and out!

1109
00:45:40,640 --> 00:45:42,140
(Failed block)

1110
00:45:43,473 --> 00:45:44,740
You have to close that seam!

1111
00:45:44,740 --> 00:45:45,907
Where were you going?

1112
00:45:46,485 --> 00:45:49,024
(We knew it was coming,
but still couldn't block it.)

1113
00:45:49,740 --> 00:45:54,607
This is so damn frustrating!

1114
00:45:56,773 --> 00:45:59,673
(The strategy isn't
being followed at all.)

1115
00:46:04,755 --> 00:46:05,599
It's broken.

1116
00:46:07,223 --> 00:46:09,124
(The broken clipboard)

1117
00:46:15,064 --> 00:46:16,931
This is so damn frustrating!

1118
00:46:21,137 --> 00:46:23,372
(What just happened?)

1119
00:46:27,377 --> 00:46:29,478
Su Yeon, be decisive!

1120
00:46:29,479 --> 00:46:30,379
Play with confidence!

1121
00:46:30,380 --> 00:46:31,613
(Meanwhile,
Coach Dae Kyung across the court)

1122
00:46:32,682 --> 00:46:36,218
(Backing away even further)

1123
00:46:37,120 --> 00:46:39,655
(Coach Bong Woo,
who was about to chime in...)

1124
00:46:40,957 --> 00:46:43,492
(clamps his mouth shut.)

1125
00:46:43,960 --> 00:46:47,196
(Even the PR manager...)

1126
00:46:47,197 --> 00:46:50,232
(is holding his breath.)

1127
00:46:50,967 --> 00:46:53,201
(Cautiously)

1128
00:46:55,805 --> 00:46:56,731
Should I hand this back to her?

1129
00:47:00,610 --> 00:47:02,344
Before I even realized it, I'd hurled it.

1130
00:47:03,980 --> 00:47:06,081
I guess I slammed it down pretty hard.

1131
00:47:06,516 --> 00:47:10,586
I needed to flash serving
signals and call out plays,

1132
00:47:10,853 --> 00:47:13,755
but you can't conceal them
properly with bare hands.

1133
00:47:13,890 --> 00:47:15,424
So I asked where my board went.

1134
00:47:15,525 --> 00:47:18,427
It was hanging on by a thread.
Completely shattered.

1135
00:47:18,428 --> 00:47:19,695
(Patching it up herself whenever she can)

1136
00:47:20,063 --> 00:47:21,997
I literally bought this today.

1137
00:47:22,965 --> 00:47:24,666
Guess I'll just tape it up
and keep using it.

1138
00:47:25,468 --> 00:47:28,036
Coach Yeon Koung is absolutely fuming.

1139
00:47:28,271 --> 00:47:31,006
She kept drilling into them
to get up on the block,

1140
00:47:32,342 --> 00:47:35,244
but they just haven't executed the scheme.

1141
00:47:36,045 --> 00:47:39,481
(Right when they
desperately need a side-out...)

1142
00:47:40,283 --> 00:47:41,850
And that is why she's blowing a gasket.

1143
00:47:41,851 --> 00:47:43,051
(Bleeding three straight points
after blowing the assignment)

1144
00:47:43,138 --> 00:47:45,014
This is by far the angriest
Coach Yeon Koung has looked...

1145
00:47:45,015 --> 00:47:46,730
since taking the reins of the Wonder Dogs.

1146
00:47:46,731 --> 00:47:47,681
True.

1147
00:47:50,060 --> 00:47:54,129
My mind was completely set on shutting
down their attack with the block.

1148
00:47:54,598 --> 00:47:57,866
If we can just stop the bleeding here,
another opening will come.

1149
00:47:58,201 --> 00:47:59,413
Back quick!

1150
00:48:00,036 --> 00:48:02,838
(Still just two front-row hitters)

1151
00:48:03,172 --> 00:48:08,076
(Enkhsoyol stays glued
to the middle blocker.)

1152
00:48:08,544 --> 00:48:10,912
(Locked in)

1153
00:48:11,981 --> 00:48:13,614
- Mine!
- There you go! Nice!

1154
00:48:13,615 --> 00:48:16,751
- Back quick!
- Watch Ji Su!

1155
00:48:17,287 --> 00:48:19,188
Na Yeon tracks down
the pass and sets it up!

1156
00:48:19,322 --> 00:48:20,455
(Ji Su takes off!)

1157
00:48:20,456 --> 00:48:21,624
(Eyes darting across the tape)

1158
00:48:21,625 --> 00:48:22,524
Enkhsoyol!

1159
00:48:23,226 --> 00:48:25,760
(The lightning-fast Ji Su...)

1160
00:48:26,195 --> 00:48:28,463
(who nearly wrecked the coach's knees...)

1161
00:48:29,365 --> 00:48:33,768
(and destroyed her brand-new clipboard)

1162
00:48:35,071 --> 00:48:36,772
(The middle blocker
who got Enkhsoyol chewed out)

1163
00:48:36,773 --> 00:48:37,706
(Giggling)

1164
00:48:38,274 --> 00:48:39,507
We have to shut her down right here!

1165
00:48:43,179 --> 00:48:44,679
Roof! Stuffed at the tape!

1166
00:48:46,215 --> 00:48:47,081
All right!

1167
00:48:47,082 --> 00:48:50,151
(Gotcha!)

1168
00:48:50,820 --> 00:48:52,154
(Fearless)

1169
00:48:52,155 --> 00:48:53,255
There it is!

1170
00:48:54,957 --> 00:48:56,758
(They stuff the attack...)

1171
00:48:56,759 --> 00:48:58,660
- Ball's coming over!
- Chance ball!

1172
00:48:59,862 --> 00:49:01,596
- Ye Eun with the pass!
- Free ball!

1173
00:49:02,065 --> 00:49:03,466
Feed the C quick!

1174
00:49:03,467 --> 00:49:04,466
That's it!

1175
00:49:04,534 --> 00:49:05,934
- Rip it!
- Elevate!

1176
00:49:06,536 --> 00:49:08,737
(The tables have completely turned.)

1177
00:49:09,639 --> 00:49:11,907
Enkhsoyol puts it away!

1178
00:49:11,975 --> 00:49:12,941
They're storming right back!

1179
00:49:14,277 --> 00:49:15,911
(Fist pump!)

1180
00:49:16,213 --> 00:49:17,913
Way to battle, girls!

1181
00:49:18,281 --> 00:49:20,515
(See? Told you it works!)

1182
00:49:22,051 --> 00:49:23,418
(Happy little victory dance)

1183
00:49:24,087 --> 00:49:24,987
- Enkhsoyol!
- Great hustle!

1184
00:49:25,188 --> 00:49:26,654
Nice!

1185
00:49:26,655 --> 00:49:29,357
(Finally executing the block assignment)

1186
00:49:31,527 --> 00:49:34,996
Whenever they give you a free ball,
feed Enkhsoyol!

1187
00:49:35,731 --> 00:49:37,268
Enkhsoyol executes Coach Yeon Koung's
instructions to perfection,

1188
00:49:37,269 --> 00:49:38,933
stonewalling the attack...

1189
00:49:38,934 --> 00:49:40,602
and turning defense
straight into instant offense!

1190
00:49:40,603 --> 00:49:43,838
Shake it off. We ran off a bunch of points
in this exact rotation earlier.

1191
00:49:43,839 --> 00:49:45,240
Let's string a run together
and flip this thing right now!

1192
00:49:45,808 --> 00:49:46,608
(Deep breath)

1193
00:49:46,609 --> 00:49:48,510
Deficit cut down to three!

1194
00:49:48,511 --> 00:49:50,111
It's 11 to 8!

1195
00:49:54,851 --> 00:49:55,651
Jump!

1196
00:49:56,520 --> 00:49:57,386
Tip!

1197
00:49:59,055 --> 00:50:00,822
Seung Ju pushes it deep! Popped up!

1198
00:50:00,823 --> 00:50:01,823
Great dig, Yeon Joo!

1199
00:50:01,824 --> 00:50:02,791
Mine!

1200
00:50:03,259 --> 00:50:04,192
Left pin!

1201
00:50:04,360 --> 00:50:05,860
- Nice!
- Good ball!

1202
00:50:05,861 --> 00:50:06,761
Enkhsoyol!

1203
00:50:07,029 --> 00:50:09,497
Here it comes! Go!

1204
00:50:09,966 --> 00:50:12,801
Enkhsoyol unloads on it!

1205
00:50:12,802 --> 00:50:13,835
(Enkhsoyol crushes a heavy swing!)

1206
00:50:16,072 --> 00:50:17,973
(Off the block and past the antenna!)

1207
00:50:20,343 --> 00:50:22,010
All right!

1208
00:50:22,011 --> 00:50:24,246
Out! Great!

1209
00:50:24,714 --> 00:50:25,580
It paid off!

1210
00:50:25,581 --> 00:50:26,548
(Now just a two-point deficit!)

1211
00:50:26,549 --> 00:50:28,350
The Wonder Dogs are
breathing down their necks!

1212
00:50:28,684 --> 00:50:30,351
- Great read.
- Thank you!

1213
00:50:30,352 --> 00:50:32,353
Beautiful swing!

1214
00:50:33,256 --> 00:50:34,957
(Stumbling on weary legs)

1215
00:50:37,059 --> 00:50:39,861
Seung Ju looks completely gassed as well,

1216
00:50:40,496 --> 00:50:42,163
but at this stage,
both squads are running on pure fumes.

1217
00:50:43,633 --> 00:50:45,300
Let's get this side-out right here!

1218
00:50:45,768 --> 00:50:47,235
Stay disciplined on the setter!

1219
00:50:47,603 --> 00:50:48,503
Hey, watch the C quick!

1220
00:50:49,005 --> 00:50:50,606
Back quick!

1221
00:50:50,673 --> 00:50:52,073
Don't bite early on the setter!

1222
00:50:52,074 --> 00:50:53,942
Let's get one!

1223
00:50:53,943 --> 00:50:54,743
(Setting up the block again)

1224
00:50:54,744 --> 00:50:55,810
Take the line!

1225
00:50:55,811 --> 00:50:56,511
(Right on script)

1226
00:50:56,814 --> 00:50:58,480
- Only the middle is live!
- Got it!

1227
00:50:58,481 --> 00:51:01,283
(Enkhsoyol shadows the middle blocker
step for step.)

1228
00:51:01,984 --> 00:51:02,951
Let's do this!

1229
00:51:02,952 --> 00:51:04,419
(Target locked)

1230
00:51:06,088 --> 00:51:07,655
- Mine!
- Su Yeon fields the serve!

1231
00:51:07,656 --> 00:51:08,489
(Tracking her movement)

1232
00:51:08,724 --> 00:51:10,392
(Eyes strictly on the middle)

1233
00:51:10,626 --> 00:51:11,459
Back quick!

1234
00:51:11,961 --> 00:51:12,794
Na Yeon!

1235
00:51:13,296 --> 00:51:14,196
Back!

1236
00:51:14,697 --> 00:51:18,600
(Enkhsoyol, truth is...)

1237
00:51:19,862 --> 00:51:21,563
(blocking is...)

1238
00:51:21,571 --> 00:51:22,838
(pure offense too!)

1239
00:51:23,006 --> 00:51:24,539
Hye Rim takes a cut through the middle,
but gets rejected!

1240
00:51:26,742 --> 00:51:28,142
Solo stuff!

1241
00:51:28,143 --> 00:51:29,977
(Enkhsoyol delivers the solo block!)

1242
00:51:30,947 --> 00:51:32,581
(Told you it would work!)

1243
00:51:37,353 --> 00:51:38,353
(She's finally dialed in!)

1244
00:51:38,354 --> 00:51:41,356
- Let's go, girls! Huge play, Enkhsoyol!
- Awesome!

1245
00:51:42,124 --> 00:51:44,692
- That's what I'm talking about!
- Monster block!

1246
00:51:44,693 --> 00:51:45,460
Enkhsoyol!

1247
00:51:45,461 --> 00:51:46,294
Yes!

1248
00:51:46,295 --> 00:51:47,929
Hey! That was a true solo block!

1249
00:51:49,932 --> 00:51:51,566
(Staring her down)

1250
00:51:52,001 --> 00:51:54,936
Enkhsoyol has unlocked a
whole new level at the net!

1251
00:51:56,038 --> 00:51:57,171
- Enkhsoyol!
- Enkhsoyol!

1252
00:51:57,974 --> 00:51:59,040
Keep your eyes on her. Stay glued.

1253
00:51:59,041 --> 00:52:01,209
Zero in on that middle blocker!

1254
00:52:01,611 --> 00:52:02,444
Understood, Coach!

1255
00:52:02,445 --> 00:52:04,446
She shuts down the lane
completely! Down to two!

1256
00:52:04,447 --> 00:52:06,314
(Fourth set,
Pink Spiders: 13, Wonder Dogs: 11)

1257
00:52:06,950 --> 00:52:09,017
Take a full swing! Put
some authority on that ball!

1258
00:52:09,318 --> 00:52:10,285
What are we even running here?

1259
00:52:10,286 --> 00:52:11,653
(On edge)

1260
00:52:11,988 --> 00:52:13,889
(Targeted serve dialed into Zone 2)

1261
00:52:14,357 --> 00:52:16,792
(The service specialist gets the signal.)

1262
00:52:19,595 --> 00:52:20,762
(The target serve hits the bullseye!)

1263
00:52:20,763 --> 00:52:21,563
Na Yeon!

1264
00:52:21,798 --> 00:52:22,730
Over!

1265
00:52:22,865 --> 00:52:24,165
Overpass!

1266
00:52:25,301 --> 00:52:26,568
- Jump!
- Stay down!

1267
00:52:27,503 --> 00:52:29,837
Overpass kill!

1268
00:52:29,838 --> 00:52:32,807
(Enkhsoyol slams home the overpass!)

1269
00:52:33,943 --> 00:52:37,245
(Pure adrenaline)

1270
00:52:40,549 --> 00:52:41,849
Yes!

1271
00:52:41,850 --> 00:52:42,984
Let's go!

1272
00:52:42,985 --> 00:52:43,851
Awesome!

1273
00:52:45,087 --> 00:52:46,287
Damn it!

1274
00:52:46,956 --> 00:52:48,556
Come on, guys, let's just get one point!

1275
00:52:48,557 --> 00:52:49,991
(Momentum has swung
completely to the Wonder Dogs.)

1276
00:52:50,526 --> 00:52:52,260
The deficit is down to a single point!

1277
00:52:52,795 --> 00:52:53,661
Yes!

1278
00:52:53,662 --> 00:52:55,730
(Keep the foot on the gas!)

1279
00:52:56,699 --> 00:52:59,200
- Enkhsoyol is incredible!
- Let's go!

1280
00:52:59,535 --> 00:53:01,570
With Enkhsoyol taking over the floor,

1281
00:53:01,571 --> 00:53:03,905
the Wonder Dogs are within one!

1282
00:53:04,433 --> 00:53:05,551
What an unbelievable fight...

1283
00:53:05,559 --> 00:53:08,009
standing toe-to-toe
with a pro club without backing down!

1284
00:53:09,478 --> 00:53:12,713
They're generating the exact looks
they need to take the lead!

1285
00:53:12,714 --> 00:53:15,750
They have to keep applying pressure...

1286
00:53:15,851 --> 00:53:16,984
to avoid night training.

1287
00:53:18,611 --> 00:53:21,580
Chae Rim checks in
to shore up the back row.

1288
00:53:22,515 --> 00:53:24,816
Get your block set early!

1289
00:53:24,817 --> 00:53:27,099
(One point away from knotting it up!)

1290
00:53:27,100 --> 00:53:28,186
Three up!

1291
00:53:29,321 --> 00:53:31,623
Three players at the net.
Watch for the roll shot!

1292
00:53:31,624 --> 00:53:33,691
(We have to pull even!)

1293
00:53:33,926 --> 00:53:35,627
Chae Rim, hit Zone 3!

1294
00:53:35,628 --> 00:53:37,529
(Aiming the serve at Zone 3)

1295
00:53:41,500 --> 00:53:42,500
Chae Rim serves.

1296
00:53:44,844 --> 00:53:46,010
Min Ji passes it up.

1297
00:53:46,291 --> 00:53:47,391
(Setting out to Seung Ju)

1298
00:53:48,055 --> 00:53:49,756
(Ye Dam closes the block!)

1299
00:53:49,924 --> 00:53:51,090
Seung Ju!

1300
00:53:51,091 --> 00:53:51,924
(Wall set at the net!)

1301
00:53:53,427 --> 00:53:54,427
(Scrambling to get the ball over)

1302
00:53:54,428 --> 00:53:55,395
There we go!

1303
00:53:56,430 --> 00:53:57,897
(Can they dig it out?)

1304
00:54:00,034 --> 00:54:01,101
No!

1305
00:54:01,102 --> 00:54:03,203
(The ball finds the floor.)

1306
00:54:04,538 --> 00:54:06,706
- My fault, everyone!
- Shake it off!

1307
00:54:09,176 --> 00:54:10,510
How do you let that drop
when nobody's even moving?

1308
00:54:10,511 --> 00:54:11,844
How does that ball hit the floor?

1309
00:54:12,846 --> 00:54:15,281
(Every single point is precious.)

1310
00:54:15,282 --> 00:54:17,183
Come on, girls, the set starts right now!

1311
00:54:20,488 --> 00:54:23,213
Good. Let's grind it
out one point at a time!

1312
00:54:23,214 --> 00:54:24,458
(The Pink Spiders regroup.)

1313
00:54:24,459 --> 00:54:25,892
- Get ready!
- Left side!

1314
00:54:27,027 --> 00:54:29,296
Let's slam the door!

1315
00:54:29,297 --> 00:54:30,764
- Focus on the left.
- We can do this.

1316
00:54:30,765 --> 00:54:33,700
(Drop this set, and the match is over.)

1317
00:54:34,468 --> 00:54:36,869
(Seung Ju steps up to serve.)

1318
00:54:38,272 --> 00:54:39,138
Pop it up! Feed her!

1319
00:54:39,473 --> 00:54:40,373
Left pin!

1320
00:54:41,442 --> 00:54:42,876
Ye Eun dives for the dig!

1321
00:54:45,513 --> 00:54:46,413
Cover!

1322
00:54:48,215 --> 00:54:49,315
Can't get a clean touch!

1323
00:54:49,316 --> 00:54:52,384
(Cover defense breaks down.)

1324
00:54:55,256 --> 00:54:56,823
Now, 16 to 13 on the board.

1325
00:54:56,824 --> 00:54:58,959
The deficit stretches back to three...

1326
00:54:59,266 --> 00:55:01,634
as we hit the second technical timeout
of Set 4.

1327
00:55:01,635 --> 00:55:03,397
(Technical timeout)

1328
00:55:03,875 --> 00:55:06,709
- Cover together!
- Yes, Coach.

1329
00:55:06,709 --> 00:55:08,186
Who do you pick up
when they only have two hitters?

1330
00:55:08,836 --> 00:55:11,869
- I told you to track the middle blocker!
- Yes, Coach.

1331
00:55:11,869 --> 00:55:14,736
- Stick to the fundamentals.
- Understood.

1332
00:55:14,736 --> 00:55:15,936
- My bad!
- Shake it off!

1333
00:55:16,136 --> 00:55:18,069
- We've got this!
- Let's run it right.

1334
00:55:18,269 --> 00:55:19,736
Nail the first touch.

1335
00:55:19,736 --> 00:55:20,769
I'll set the play up.

1336
00:55:20,769 --> 00:55:22,803
- Watch the net up front too!
- Got it.

1337
00:55:22,803 --> 00:55:24,169
- One, two, three, fight!
- Fight!

1338
00:55:25,536 --> 00:55:26,569
- Hyo Rim.
- Yes?

1339
00:55:26,803 --> 00:55:28,703
- Keep feeding Ye Eun.
- Understood.

1340
00:55:29,169 --> 00:55:30,203
Ye Eun!

1341
00:55:30,369 --> 00:55:33,869
(Don't bounce it straight down.
Hit it deep.)

1342
00:55:33,869 --> 00:55:35,169
(Nodding)

1343
00:55:36,336 --> 00:55:38,536
I had a lot of faith in Ye Eun,

1344
00:55:38,803 --> 00:55:41,769
and I knew she'd step up
and handle her business,

1345
00:55:41,769 --> 00:55:43,703
so I put her out there.

1346
00:55:44,936 --> 00:55:46,269
It's 16 to 13 on the board.

1347
00:55:50,669 --> 00:55:51,703
- Short serve!
- There it is!

1348
00:55:53,569 --> 00:55:54,569
Yeon Joo.

1349
00:55:54,569 --> 00:55:55,603
She pops it up!

1350
00:55:55,603 --> 00:55:57,069
(Setting Ye Eun)

1351
00:55:57,069 --> 00:55:58,069
Push it deep!

1352
00:55:58,069 --> 00:55:59,103
Rip it!

1353
00:56:00,003 --> 00:56:01,003
Ye Eun.

1354
00:56:03,869 --> 00:56:04,869
She converts!

1355
00:56:04,869 --> 00:56:06,536
(A tool off the block)

1356
00:56:06,536 --> 00:56:07,569
There we go!

1357
00:56:07,569 --> 00:56:12,436
At the moment,
Ye Eun is delivering on offense too.

1358
00:56:13,303 --> 00:56:14,436
Now, 16 to 14.

1359
00:56:14,436 --> 00:56:16,503
(Fourth set,
Pink Spiders 16, Wonder Dogs 14)

1360
00:56:18,603 --> 00:56:20,003
- Put it away!
- Let's go!

1361
00:56:20,003 --> 00:56:21,003
Cover!

1362
00:56:21,003 --> 00:56:23,103
(Going right back to Ye Eun)

1363
00:56:23,303 --> 00:56:24,969
Take your time!

1364
00:56:25,403 --> 00:56:26,403
Swing!

1365
00:56:26,403 --> 00:56:27,903
Ye Eun!

1366
00:56:27,903 --> 00:56:29,203
Ye Eun takes a big cut!

1367
00:56:29,203 --> 00:56:30,703
- That's the way!
- Off the block and out!

1368
00:56:30,703 --> 00:56:33,869
(Another tool off the block)

1369
00:56:34,103 --> 00:56:35,703
(Right on target again!)

1370
00:56:36,036 --> 00:56:37,103
Settle down!

1371
00:56:37,736 --> 00:56:39,869
(Stomping)

1372
00:56:40,469 --> 00:56:43,503
- Lee Ye Eun!
- Lee Ye Eun!

1373
00:56:43,769 --> 00:56:46,403
Ye Eun's father is cheering
his heart out from the stands.

1374
00:56:47,903 --> 00:56:51,303
I almost never got rotated
in as a front-row hitter.

1375
00:56:52,603 --> 00:56:54,836
It's honestly been a year or two...

1376
00:56:54,836 --> 00:56:56,936
since I last scored off an attack.

1377
00:56:57,336 --> 00:57:00,336
I guess I really missed that feeling.

1378
00:57:02,369 --> 00:57:05,503
- Ye Eun keeps tooling the block.
- On it.

1379
00:57:07,336 --> 00:57:09,469
(Bring it on.)

1380
00:57:09,903 --> 00:57:11,069
Ye Eun handles the pass.

1381
00:57:12,103 --> 00:57:13,136
Put it down!

1382
00:57:13,136 --> 00:57:14,369
(Facing a double block)

1383
00:57:14,836 --> 00:57:17,003
It's been so long since I felt that rush.

1384
00:57:17,003 --> 00:57:18,136
(Winding up)

1385
00:57:18,136 --> 00:57:19,603
I genuinely enjoyed every second of it.

1386
00:57:21,003 --> 00:57:22,003
Spike!

1387
00:57:22,003 --> 00:57:23,003
She puts it away!

1388
00:57:23,003 --> 00:57:25,736
(There it is!)

1389
00:57:28,636 --> 00:57:31,203
(No longer just a serving specialist,)

1390
00:57:31,203 --> 00:57:33,103
(she is hitter Lee Ye Eun today.)

1391
00:57:33,803 --> 00:57:35,603
The moment the ball hit the floor,

1392
00:57:37,003 --> 00:57:38,669
I couldn't help jumping up and down.

1393
00:57:39,336 --> 00:57:40,336
Yes!

1394
00:57:41,203 --> 00:57:43,336
(Burned us right there!)

1395
00:57:43,769 --> 00:57:48,636
(So proud of you!)

1396
00:57:49,236 --> 00:57:53,203
I really want to prove myself
as a legitimate hitter again.

1397
00:57:55,069 --> 00:57:56,069
It's 18 to 16 now.

1398
00:57:56,069 --> 00:57:59,103
(Fourth set,
Pink Spiders: 18, Wonder Dogs: 16)

1399
00:57:59,403 --> 00:58:03,169
(We have to keep this run alive
and flip the script.)

1400
00:58:03,869 --> 00:58:05,269
(Sub in.)

1401
00:58:05,936 --> 00:58:06,969
With Chae Rim!

1402
00:58:07,836 --> 00:58:09,269
(Sprinting in)

1403
00:58:10,636 --> 00:58:11,769
Let's roll!

1404
00:58:11,769 --> 00:58:14,269
Enkhsoyol rotates into the front row.

1405
00:58:14,603 --> 00:58:17,069
- They're loading up their attack.
- Absolutely.

1406
00:58:18,669 --> 00:58:20,136
We've got this!

1407
00:58:20,136 --> 00:58:21,769
Keep pushing!

1408
00:58:22,603 --> 00:58:23,936
Their setter is still front row.

1409
00:58:24,169 --> 00:58:25,203
Two hitters.

1410
00:58:25,203 --> 00:58:26,669
Still just two hitters.

1411
00:58:26,669 --> 00:58:28,603
(Two live hitters in the front row)

1412
00:58:28,603 --> 00:58:29,669
Watch the middle blocker!

1413
00:58:30,403 --> 00:58:31,403
Enkhsoyol.

1414
00:58:31,403 --> 00:58:32,803
- Seal half the seam!
- Got it.

1415
00:58:32,803 --> 00:58:34,236
If she gets loose on the slide,
we won't stand a chance.

1416
00:58:34,236 --> 00:58:35,269
I'll take the line.

1417
00:58:35,269 --> 00:58:36,436
On it.

1418
00:58:36,436 --> 00:58:38,803
(Not letting this one slip.)

1419
00:58:38,803 --> 00:58:40,336
Down by 2, 18 to 16.

1420
00:58:40,869 --> 00:58:42,269
Ye Eun at the line.

1421
00:58:42,269 --> 00:58:45,136
I hope Ye Eun can exploit
her biggest weapon here.

1422
00:58:45,136 --> 00:58:46,136
No doubt.

1423
00:58:46,136 --> 00:58:47,969
- Let's go! Boom!
- Let's go! Boom!

1424
00:58:48,269 --> 00:58:49,369
Easy does it.

1425
00:58:49,369 --> 00:58:50,403
- Digs it off the floor!
- Min Ji!

1426
00:58:50,403 --> 00:58:52,003
- Free ball!
- Ball's over!

1427
00:58:52,369 --> 00:58:53,403
Yeon Joo!

1428
00:58:53,403 --> 00:58:54,503
Fast C!

1429
00:58:54,503 --> 00:58:56,103
- Over there!
- Hyo Rim!

1430
00:58:56,103 --> 00:58:57,136
Spike!

1431
00:58:57,136 --> 00:58:58,603
All right, reset!

1432
00:58:58,603 --> 00:59:00,003
Ji Su!

1433
00:59:00,236 --> 00:59:01,736
Na Yeon's slide attack!

1434
00:59:01,736 --> 00:59:02,803
(Ji Su's slide attack)

1435
00:59:03,303 --> 00:59:04,503
Hustle!

1436
00:59:06,936 --> 00:59:07,969
Kept off the floor!

1437
00:59:07,969 --> 00:59:09,436
- There!
- Rip it!

1438
00:59:09,436 --> 00:59:10,936
(Another look off the block)

1439
00:59:11,803 --> 00:59:13,336
Enkhsoyol with the tip!

1440
00:59:13,603 --> 00:59:14,836
Nice touch!

1441
00:59:14,836 --> 00:59:15,869
Back to Ji Su again!

1442
00:59:16,003 --> 00:59:17,103
(One, two!)

1443
00:59:17,103 --> 00:59:18,769
(Three!)

1444
00:59:20,036 --> 00:59:21,203
- Denied at the net!
- Mine!

1445
00:59:21,703 --> 00:59:23,603
(Quick second contact)

1446
00:59:23,603 --> 00:59:24,903
Cover!

1447
00:59:24,903 --> 00:59:25,903
Take a cut!

1448
00:59:27,503 --> 00:59:29,236
Min Ji sails it long!

1449
00:59:29,569 --> 00:59:30,803
- Long!
- No touch!

1450
00:59:31,403 --> 00:59:32,436
Out!

1451
00:59:32,436 --> 00:59:33,469
(It's out!)

1452
00:59:33,469 --> 00:59:35,069
(All right!)

1453
00:59:35,069 --> 00:59:36,636
It sailed out! One-point game!

1454
00:59:37,003 --> 00:59:38,136
Now 18 to 17!

1455
00:59:38,136 --> 00:59:41,369
(Within one at last!)

1456
00:59:41,369 --> 00:59:44,236
Enkhsoyol did a tremendous job
closing at the tape.

1457
00:59:44,236 --> 00:59:46,303
Now that the blocking has tightened up,

1458
00:59:46,303 --> 00:59:48,436
- the other side is forcing errors.
- Exactly.

1459
00:59:48,436 --> 00:59:50,569
(Forced into an unforced error)

1460
00:59:51,069 --> 00:59:52,803
(Block-soyol comes up huge!)

1461
00:59:52,803 --> 00:59:54,769
- Great hustle closing the gap!
- Stay confident!

1462
00:59:56,103 --> 00:59:57,169
Min Ji, take a breath.

1463
00:59:57,769 --> 00:59:58,869
My fault!

1464
01:00:01,303 --> 01:00:03,703
(Glancing)

1465
01:00:04,436 --> 01:00:07,336
(Na Yeon in the front row)

1466
01:00:07,336 --> 01:00:10,669
(Spotted)

1467
01:00:11,136 --> 01:00:12,903
- Hyo Rim, keep running the C.
- Got it.

1468
01:00:12,903 --> 01:00:14,969
Na Yeon's block is low, so keep
swinging right into her hands.

1469
01:00:16,236 --> 01:00:21,636
(Targeting Na Yeon again)

1470
01:00:22,103 --> 01:00:23,836
Now, 18 to 17, down by one.

1471
01:00:25,369 --> 01:00:27,369
Ye Eun serves.

1472
01:00:28,069 --> 01:00:29,803
Take a breath, we're fine.

1473
01:00:32,936 --> 01:00:34,303
- Seung Ju!
- Fast back set!

1474
01:00:34,303 --> 01:00:35,403
- Na Yeon shifts!
- Ji Su!

1475
01:00:35,403 --> 01:00:36,403
(Ji Su loads up to swing)

1476
01:00:36,403 --> 01:00:37,503
One, two.

1477
01:00:37,503 --> 01:00:38,903
(Three!)

1478
01:00:41,836 --> 01:00:42,836
There!

1479
01:00:44,169 --> 01:00:45,203
Rip it!

1480
01:00:45,736 --> 01:00:47,169
(Zeroing in on Na Yeon)

1481
01:00:47,503 --> 01:00:49,203
- Enkhsoyol!
- Rises up!

1482
01:00:50,636 --> 01:00:51,636
(Stuffed)

1483
01:00:51,636 --> 01:00:53,136
Seon Ah digs it out!

1484
01:00:53,136 --> 01:00:54,169
Run it back!

1485
01:00:55,936 --> 01:00:57,469
Enkhsoyol again!

1486
01:00:58,203 --> 01:00:59,669
(Denied again!)

1487
01:00:59,669 --> 01:01:00,669
(Groaning)

1488
01:01:00,769 --> 01:01:01,803
Feed her again!

1489
01:01:02,369 --> 01:01:03,369
Fast C!

1490
01:01:05,036 --> 01:01:06,169
(Taking a cut)

1491
01:01:06,169 --> 01:01:07,736
Third time's the charm!

1492
01:01:08,436 --> 01:01:10,203
Nowhere clean to put it!

1493
01:01:13,736 --> 01:01:15,069
Seon Ah saves it again!

1494
01:01:15,836 --> 01:01:16,903
Fast C!

1495
01:01:17,269 --> 01:01:19,236
Enkhsoyol resets for another approach!

1496
01:01:19,236 --> 01:01:20,403
One more time!

1497
01:01:20,403 --> 01:01:22,136
- Steady! Here it comes!
- Set her up again!

1498
01:01:22,903 --> 01:01:24,203
Cover!

1499
01:01:24,203 --> 01:01:26,069
(I'm putting this one away!)

1500
01:01:30,436 --> 01:01:32,436
(Sails out of bounds)

1501
01:01:32,436 --> 01:01:35,503
Called out!

1502
01:01:36,036 --> 01:01:40,803
(So close!)

1503
01:01:40,803 --> 01:01:43,169
- What an exhausting rally.
- Incredible effort.

1504
01:01:43,869 --> 01:01:48,003
Enkhsoyol stayed aggressive
on that matchup till the end.

1505
01:01:51,469 --> 01:01:53,369
But the blocker pulled her hands back.

1506
01:01:53,369 --> 01:01:55,069
(Na Yeon dropped her
hands to draw the error.)

1507
01:01:56,536 --> 01:02:00,836
(Back to a two-point deficit)

1508
01:02:01,236 --> 01:02:04,069
Once they get it tied,
all the momentum swings their way.

1509
01:02:04,069 --> 01:02:05,069
Definitely.

1510
01:02:05,069 --> 01:02:07,003
(Tying it up is the hardest part)

1511
01:02:08,469 --> 01:02:10,069
Enkhsoyol!

1512
01:02:10,269 --> 01:02:12,336
Go deep down the line
or rip it sharp cross-court!

1513
01:02:13,403 --> 01:02:14,436
Yes, Coach!

1514
01:02:14,936 --> 01:02:16,136
(Exhaling)

1515
01:02:16,603 --> 01:02:17,803
Now, 19 to 17.

1516
01:02:17,803 --> 01:02:18,969
(Min Ji serves.)

1517
01:02:20,503 --> 01:02:21,603
- Fast C!
- Ye Eun.

1518
01:02:21,603 --> 01:02:23,303
- Cover!
- Hyo Rim.

1519
01:02:23,869 --> 01:02:25,003
Take it cross-court, you're fine!

1520
01:02:26,436 --> 01:02:28,169
Enkhsoyol hammers it!

1521
01:02:28,169 --> 01:02:29,903
(That's the response!)

1522
01:02:30,769 --> 01:02:32,536
(Right back within a point)

1523
01:02:32,536 --> 01:02:33,636
Great kill, Enkhsoyol!

1524
01:02:33,636 --> 01:02:35,103
Way to execute!

1525
01:02:37,036 --> 01:02:40,136
(Sigh of relief)

1526
01:02:40,269 --> 01:02:42,203
(Stay dialed in!)

1527
01:02:42,469 --> 01:02:43,969
They still only have two hitters.

1528
01:02:44,669 --> 01:02:45,703
Yes, Coach.

1529
01:02:47,303 --> 01:02:51,236
(Eyes locked on the middle blocker)

1530
01:02:51,603 --> 01:02:52,736
Neck and neck right now!

1531
01:02:53,136 --> 01:02:54,936
Watch the roll shot!

1532
01:02:54,936 --> 01:02:55,969
Got it!

1533
01:02:55,969 --> 01:02:57,803
The score is 19 to 18, one-point game.

1534
01:02:57,803 --> 01:02:59,303
Bo Been steps up to serve.

1535
01:03:03,236 --> 01:03:04,269
Middle!

1536
01:03:05,003 --> 01:03:06,003
Swing!

1537
01:03:09,103 --> 01:03:10,103
(No touch)

1538
01:03:10,103 --> 01:03:12,336
(Sails long!)

1539
01:03:12,336 --> 01:03:13,369
Out!

1540
01:03:14,269 --> 01:03:16,936
Is it long? It's out!

1541
01:03:17,303 --> 01:03:18,669
Knotted up at 19 to 19!

1542
01:03:18,669 --> 01:03:19,803
Yes!

1543
01:03:20,369 --> 01:03:24,169
(All tied up at last!)

1544
01:03:24,769 --> 01:03:27,436
When they commit to sealing
the net like this,

1545
01:03:27,436 --> 01:03:29,703
it completely takes away
the opponent's comfort zone.

1546
01:03:29,703 --> 01:03:30,736
(Baited into an error
trying to avoid the block)

1547
01:03:31,136 --> 01:03:32,669
(Completely fooled!)

1548
01:03:33,936 --> 01:03:38,736
(The blocking scheme pays off cleanly.)

1549
01:03:39,169 --> 01:03:40,503
All square at 19.

1550
01:03:40,503 --> 01:03:44,169
The Wonder Dogs have
finally climbed all the way back.

1551
01:03:44,169 --> 01:03:45,203
(Level at last)

1552
01:03:45,569 --> 01:03:48,303
(The real dogfight starts now.)

1553
01:03:49,403 --> 01:03:50,769
One more!

1554
01:03:51,603 --> 01:03:54,269
Shake it off, just give me a good pass.

1555
01:03:54,636 --> 01:03:55,703
I'll put it down.

1556
01:04:00,336 --> 01:04:01,569
(Glancing)

1557
01:04:01,869 --> 01:04:03,803
Keep your eyes on the left pin.

1558
01:04:04,969 --> 01:04:06,503
(Seung Ju alert issued again)

1559
01:04:06,503 --> 01:04:08,303
Be ready for the ball coming over!

1560
01:04:12,403 --> 01:04:13,436
Da Eun handles the receive.

1561
01:04:13,436 --> 01:04:15,303
- Go!
- Seung Ju opens up on the left!

1562
01:04:15,936 --> 01:04:17,203
I've got this!

1563
01:04:19,003 --> 01:04:20,369
Off the block and out!

1564
01:04:20,736 --> 01:04:22,769
(Damn it.)

1565
01:04:22,769 --> 01:04:24,936
(Pyo Seung Ju!)

1566
01:04:25,903 --> 01:04:27,103
My bad!

1567
01:04:28,703 --> 01:04:30,269
- Way to put it away, Seung Ju!
- Thank you!

1568
01:04:30,669 --> 01:04:33,669
Seung Ju always delivers in crunch time.

1569
01:04:33,669 --> 01:04:34,669
Without question.

1570
01:04:34,669 --> 01:04:36,436
She's a natural closer,

1571
01:04:36,436 --> 01:04:37,964
and she shoulders that responsibility.

1572
01:04:39,469 --> 01:04:43,003
Seung Ju kept her composure...

1573
01:04:43,003 --> 01:04:44,303
and came through when they needed it most.

1574
01:04:44,903 --> 01:04:46,669
We let her get away with
too many points today,

1575
01:04:46,669 --> 01:04:48,103
so she's been a massive headache.

1576
01:04:48,869 --> 01:04:52,136
Still, we have to keep
our foot on the gas.

1577
01:04:53,336 --> 01:04:55,236
Heads up!

1578
01:04:55,236 --> 01:04:56,969
Same two hitters in front!

1579
01:05:01,269 --> 01:05:02,303
Seung Ju!

1580
01:05:02,703 --> 01:05:03,703
Switch!

1581
01:05:03,703 --> 01:05:06,169
Enkhsoyol. Na Yeon.

1582
01:05:09,275 --> 01:05:11,043
Enkhsoyol has a high attack percentage,

1583
01:05:11,044 --> 01:05:12,878
so when we serve,

1584
01:05:12,879 --> 01:05:15,347
go deep to Zone 1,
then switch block assignments.

1585
01:05:15,348 --> 01:05:16,715
Serve deep to Zone 1.

1586
01:05:16,716 --> 01:05:18,350
(Switching blockers?)

1587
01:05:18,884 --> 01:05:22,286
(Moving Na Yeon, the shorter blocker...)

1588
01:05:22,622 --> 01:05:25,657
(away from the primary hitter?)

1589
01:05:25,826 --> 01:05:27,426
It's 20 to 19. Just a one-point game.

1590
01:05:28,294 --> 01:05:30,328
They need to pull level right here.

1591
01:05:32,732 --> 01:05:33,598
Mine!

1592
01:05:33,733 --> 01:05:34,666
Ye Eun handles the pass.

1593
01:05:34,934 --> 01:05:35,767
- Cover!
- C!

1594
01:05:36,101 --> 01:05:37,135
Keep it alive!

1595
01:05:43,643 --> 01:05:45,410
(Seung Ju matches up directly
against Enkhsoyol.)

1596
01:05:45,411 --> 01:05:46,278
Swing away!

1597
01:05:47,013 --> 01:05:47,846
- Mine!
- Go!

1598
01:05:48,181 --> 01:05:49,781
Cover!

1599
01:05:53,462 --> 01:05:55,196
(Setting the right side?)

1600
01:05:55,221 --> 01:05:56,154
Cover!

1601
01:05:56,989 --> 01:05:59,023
Setter dump!

1602
01:05:59,125 --> 01:06:00,358
Setter!

1603
01:06:01,160 --> 01:06:02,026
There you go!

1604
01:06:05,264 --> 01:06:09,133
(Executed to perfection!)

1605
01:06:09,335 --> 01:06:11,636
(My heart can't take this!)

1606
01:06:12,238 --> 01:06:13,305
(Gasping for air)

1607
01:06:13,306 --> 01:06:15,073
My heart completely dropped.

1608
01:06:15,541 --> 01:06:18,409
For a second, it felt like time froze.

1609
01:06:18,745 --> 01:06:20,912
And with Na Yeon closing in,

1610
01:06:20,913 --> 01:06:22,814
I never expected her to try a dump.

1611
01:06:22,815 --> 01:06:23,948
(Pulling off a brilliant surprise dump)

1612
01:06:23,949 --> 01:06:26,584
A setter dump in absolute crunch time.

1613
01:06:26,585 --> 01:06:29,788
(Completely outsmarted
their blocker switch)

1614
01:06:30,149 --> 01:06:34,786
(Two points off setter dumps today)

1615
01:06:35,461 --> 01:06:37,595
(Hyo Rim has ice in her veins.)

1616
01:06:37,596 --> 01:06:40,698
Come on! Keep the run going!

1617
01:06:40,800 --> 01:06:42,300
- Hyo Rim!
- Hyo Rim!

1618
01:06:42,335 --> 01:06:43,835
- Hyo Rim!
- Hyo Rim!

1619
01:06:44,170 --> 01:06:45,971
Come on, let's force a Set 5!

1620
01:06:46,506 --> 01:06:48,039
All tied up at 20!

1621
01:06:48,040 --> 01:06:51,109
(Fourth set,
Pink Spiders: 20, Wonder Dogs: 20)

1622
01:06:51,410 --> 01:06:53,245
- I don't think switching is working.
- Let's just hold our spots.

1623
01:06:53,246 --> 01:06:54,680
We're better off staying put.

1624
01:06:54,681 --> 01:06:56,105
Either way,
whether it plays out like this...

1625
01:06:56,106 --> 01:06:58,039
or Enkhsoyol puts it down,
we're giving up points.

1626
01:06:58,040 --> 01:06:58,804
Understood.

1627
01:06:59,218 --> 01:07:00,852
(Dodge Enkhsoyol,
only to get burned by Hyo Rim)

1628
01:07:01,620 --> 01:07:03,988
(They decided to stick
to their original blocking alignment.)

1629
01:07:03,989 --> 01:07:05,189
(A quick glance across the net)

1630
01:07:07,593 --> 01:07:10,295
(Targeting Na Yeon again)

1631
01:07:10,496 --> 01:07:12,597
(Checking the target's alignment)

1632
01:07:13,065 --> 01:07:14,933
(And stepping up to serve...)

1633
01:07:14,934 --> 01:07:17,802
(the fearless service specialist)

1634
01:07:17,970 --> 01:07:19,804
(A golden window to break their pass)

1635
01:07:20,106 --> 01:07:21,540
(Eagle-eyed Coach Kim locks in.)

1636
01:07:21,741 --> 01:07:23,942
(Scanning for the service target)

1637
01:07:28,147 --> 01:07:30,749
(Targeting Zone 3)

1638
01:07:30,750 --> 01:07:31,649
(Nodding)

1639
01:07:32,952 --> 01:07:35,020
(Da Eun is the target.)

1640
01:07:39,325 --> 01:07:40,325
Pass pops up high.

1641
01:07:40,326 --> 01:07:41,192
There it is!

1642
01:07:42,194 --> 01:07:43,194
Right here!

1643
01:07:45,531 --> 01:07:46,464
Cover!

1644
01:07:46,800 --> 01:07:48,400
What a dig!

1645
01:07:48,401 --> 01:07:50,235
(Tremendous dig by Seon Ah)

1646
01:07:50,303 --> 01:07:51,503
There we go!

1647
01:07:52,004 --> 01:07:52,870
Nice!

1648
01:07:52,871 --> 01:07:54,305
Take a breath, we're fine!

1649
01:07:54,607 --> 01:07:56,141
- Work the block!
- Battle at the tape!

1650
01:07:56,509 --> 01:07:57,476
Play the rebound!

1651
01:07:58,411 --> 01:07:59,478
(Ball comes across.)

1652
01:07:59,479 --> 01:08:00,545
Damn it.

1653
01:08:00,680 --> 01:08:01,613
Ye Dam!

1654
01:08:02,581 --> 01:08:04,448
Popped up! Staying composed!

1655
01:08:04,449 --> 01:08:05,883
Run it back!

1656
01:08:06,152 --> 01:08:07,119
Yours!

1657
01:08:07,120 --> 01:08:08,086
Right side!

1658
01:08:08,788 --> 01:08:09,654
Feed me!

1659
01:08:10,089 --> 01:08:11,022
(Left? Right?)

1660
01:08:11,023 --> 01:08:12,390
Low block on the left!

1661
01:08:12,391 --> 01:08:13,191
(Na Yeon is the target.)

1662
01:08:13,526 --> 01:08:14,926
Swing!

1663
01:08:15,795 --> 01:08:16,728
Rip it!

1664
01:08:17,129 --> 01:08:18,262
Here comes the swing!

1665
01:08:20,065 --> 01:08:22,033
(Pulling her hands back again?)

1666
01:08:22,334 --> 01:08:23,534
(Enkhsoyol elevates without noticing it.)

1667
01:08:26,572 --> 01:08:27,572
Crushed down!

1668
01:08:28,174 --> 01:08:30,275
There it is!

1669
01:08:30,676 --> 01:08:32,944
(Enkhsoyol buries it!)

1670
01:08:33,412 --> 01:08:35,046
(Bursting with pride!)

1671
01:08:35,314 --> 01:08:37,382
(Screaming at the top of his lungs)

1672
01:08:37,516 --> 01:08:39,283
(Roaring even louder)

1673
01:08:39,284 --> 01:08:40,852
(A little overwhelmed)

1674
01:08:41,020 --> 01:08:42,286
(Pure pandemonium)

1675
01:08:42,287 --> 01:08:43,521
The Wonder Dogs take the lead!

1676
01:08:49,323 --> 01:08:52,264
(Fourth set,
Pink Spiders: 20, Wonder Dogs: 21)

1677
01:08:53,999 --> 01:08:56,300
(The tables have officially turned.)

1678
01:08:56,335 --> 01:08:57,902
(Squealing with joy)

1679
01:08:58,271 --> 01:09:01,106
(I knew you'd deliver!)

1680
01:09:01,841 --> 01:09:03,642
- Big-time, Enkhsoyol!
- Great play!

1681
01:09:08,547 --> 01:09:10,153
We have a timeout left, right?

1682
01:09:14,253 --> 01:09:16,621
Pink Spiders take their timeout.

1683
01:09:17,857 --> 01:09:18,790
All right, listen up!

1684
01:09:19,425 --> 01:09:22,127
When Enkhsoyol swings, rotate inside...

1685
01:09:22,128 --> 01:09:24,763
and take away the cross-court angle.

1686
01:09:24,764 --> 01:09:25,897
Commit cross-court!

1687
01:09:25,898 --> 01:09:28,166
Zone 1, cheat in and clean up the tips.

1688
01:09:28,334 --> 01:09:30,101
Zone 6, stay true on the line.

1689
01:09:31,003 --> 01:09:32,403
- That's the setup.
- Got it!

1690
01:09:32,605 --> 01:09:34,373
Let's get a dig!

1691
01:09:34,374 --> 01:09:35,440
We need a stop.

1692
01:09:35,708 --> 01:09:37,275
(Meanwhile,
over in the Wonder Dogs' huddle)

1693
01:09:38,210 --> 01:09:40,511
Both squads are in a two-hitter rotation
right now.

1694
01:09:40,680 --> 01:09:43,248
Enkhsoyol, stay glued to Number 21.
It's either an A quick,

1695
01:09:43,416 --> 01:09:45,517
a back quick, or a delayed slide
from the front. That's the whole menu.

1696
01:09:45,518 --> 01:09:46,951
They're not running true slides right now.

1697
01:09:46,952 --> 01:09:50,354
Ye Dam, they could push outside left.
Take an early step inside and stay ready.

1698
01:09:50,355 --> 01:09:51,589
- Yes!
- Clear?

1699
01:09:51,590 --> 01:09:53,224
- Yes, Coach!
- Keep it simple!

1700
01:09:53,225 --> 01:09:54,626
(Answering defense with defense)

1701
01:09:54,627 --> 01:09:56,227
- Let's roll!
- Come on!

1702
01:09:57,029 --> 01:09:58,429
Stay steady! One point at a time!

1703
01:09:59,131 --> 01:10:00,432
Let's do this!

1704
01:10:00,933 --> 01:10:02,166
(Let's go, Wonder Dogs!)

1705
01:10:02,167 --> 01:10:03,768
- Wonder Dogs!
- Wonder Dogs!

1706
01:10:03,936 --> 01:10:05,636
(Rhythmic clapping)

1707
01:10:05,637 --> 01:10:07,472
- Wonder Dogs!
- Wonder Dogs!

1708
01:10:07,907 --> 01:10:08,840
We've got this!

1709
01:10:08,841 --> 01:10:10,808
(Keeping the momentum going!)

1710
01:10:11,043 --> 01:10:13,144
It's 21 to 20,
a razor-thin one-point margin.

1711
01:10:13,445 --> 01:10:15,179
Wonder Dogs up by one.

1712
01:10:18,384 --> 01:10:19,384
All right.

1713
01:10:19,718 --> 01:10:20,506
Go!

1714
01:10:20,507 --> 01:10:21,485
(Seung Ju is preparing.)

1715
01:10:21,486 --> 01:10:23,821
(Na Yeon elevates at the net.)

1716
01:10:23,969 --> 01:10:26,061
Ye Dam, you have enough time,
so take an early step.

1717
01:10:26,292 --> 01:10:27,058
(She cheats a step over.)

1718
01:10:27,893 --> 01:10:29,193
Seung Ju!

1719
01:10:31,530 --> 01:10:32,630
Spike!

1720
01:10:32,631 --> 01:10:34,365
(The Wall stands tall!)

1721
01:10:34,366 --> 01:10:35,299
Huge play!

1722
01:10:36,335 --> 01:10:39,737
(The roof gets even bigger.)

1723
01:10:39,738 --> 01:10:41,072
Ye Dam!

1724
01:10:42,441 --> 01:10:44,108
Ye Dam!

1725
01:10:44,109 --> 01:10:47,412
Ye Dam the Great Wall!

1726
01:10:48,180 --> 01:10:50,148
Ye Dam was...

1727
01:10:50,149 --> 01:10:52,616
already shading right toward Seung Ju.

1728
01:10:52,617 --> 01:10:54,452
Textbook block right there!

1729
01:10:54,453 --> 01:10:57,421
Spot on. Both hands pressed over cleanly.

1730
01:11:04,296 --> 01:11:06,564
("Damdadi" blaring in the arena)

1731
01:11:06,565 --> 01:11:07,632
- Lee Ye Dam!
- Lee Ye Dam!

1732
01:11:07,633 --> 01:11:10,101
(Damdadi, Lee Ye Dam!)

1733
01:11:10,102 --> 01:11:11,002
Nice!

1734
01:11:11,937 --> 01:11:14,438
- Ye Dam is on an absolute tear today.
- Unreal performance!

1735
01:11:15,073 --> 01:11:17,442
- Shower her with all the praise!
- Deservedly so!

1736
01:11:17,610 --> 01:11:19,411
(Fourth set,
Pink Spiders: 20, Wonder Dogs: 22)

1737
01:11:20,880 --> 01:11:24,749
(The Wonder Dogs have
full control of the momentum.)

1738
01:11:24,950 --> 01:11:26,584
Just one more!

1739
01:11:26,585 --> 01:11:27,685
(Only 3 points away from taking set 4)

1740
01:11:27,686 --> 01:11:29,520
We can close this out!

1741
01:11:29,689 --> 01:11:33,091
Don't get too ahead of yourselves.
Leave the celebrating to me!

1742
01:11:33,092 --> 01:11:35,059
You're already getting
a little too fired up yourself!

1743
01:11:35,060 --> 01:11:37,695
- The players need to keep a cool head.
- Precisely.

1744
01:11:38,597 --> 01:11:41,098
I've got this! Let's go!

1745
01:11:43,135 --> 01:11:44,836
Watch for the short roll.

1746
01:11:44,837 --> 01:11:46,571
(We need to ride this momentum
all the way.)

1747
01:11:46,572 --> 01:11:47,605
Short balls are mine!

1748
01:11:48,541 --> 01:11:49,674
(The service specialist steps up again.)

1749
01:11:51,977 --> 01:11:53,110
- Back combo!
- Back combo!

1750
01:11:53,111 --> 01:11:54,178
Back combo!

1751
01:11:54,412 --> 01:11:56,247
(Number 21 attacks through the middle.)

1752
01:11:56,415 --> 01:11:58,149
(Enkhsoyol, track the middle!)

1753
01:11:59,618 --> 01:12:00,685
Good touch at the net!

1754
01:12:02,221 --> 01:12:03,454
Ye Eun keeps it off the floor!

1755
01:12:03,589 --> 01:12:04,689
There you go!

1756
01:12:04,957 --> 01:12:05,990
Need one more touch!

1757
01:12:06,225 --> 01:12:07,225
Take it!

1758
01:12:07,326 --> 01:12:08,559
(Enkhsoyol approaches for the C attack.)

1759
01:12:08,861 --> 01:12:09,794
C-quick!

1760
01:12:10,095 --> 01:12:11,495
(Defense loading up
to shut Enkhsoyol down)

1761
01:12:11,664 --> 01:12:12,597
Swing!

1762
01:12:16,168 --> 01:12:18,102
Enkhsoyol rips it!

1763
01:12:18,103 --> 01:12:19,570
(Paints the sideline)

1764
01:12:20,573 --> 01:12:22,873
Down right on the line!

1765
01:12:22,874 --> 01:12:25,176
(The arena chants Enkhsoyol's name.)

1766
01:12:25,377 --> 01:12:26,243
In!

1767
01:12:26,244 --> 01:12:27,278
(Enkhsoyol is completely unstoppable!)

1768
01:12:27,713 --> 01:12:29,547
We've got this!

1769
01:12:32,117 --> 01:12:33,751
(Fourth set,
Pink Spiders: 20, Wonder Dogs: 23)

1770
01:12:34,119 --> 01:12:37,288
The Pink Spiders are
feeling the walls close in now.

1771
01:12:38,991 --> 01:12:40,391
Come on, stay together!

1772
01:12:40,392 --> 01:12:41,693
(Just 2 points away
from wrapping up Set 4)

1773
01:12:41,694 --> 01:12:42,961
Watch for the push!

1774
01:12:43,462 --> 01:12:46,531
(Hyo Rim's fourth consecutive serve)

1775
01:12:47,132 --> 01:12:48,466
Enkhsoyol, stay locked on Number 21!

1776
01:12:48,467 --> 01:12:51,369
(Telling Enkhsoyol to shade
Number 21, Hye Rim.)

1777
01:12:52,237 --> 01:12:54,071
- I'll push it deep. Run the A!
- Understood.

1778
01:13:05,017 --> 01:13:06,117
Set me!

1779
01:13:06,251 --> 01:13:07,351
Here it comes!

1780
01:13:07,953 --> 01:13:10,421
(The A quick is purely a decoy.)

1781
01:13:12,524 --> 01:13:13,891
(Feeding Seung Ju on the outside.)

1782
01:13:14,827 --> 01:13:15,860
Out!

1783
01:13:15,861 --> 01:13:16,961
Did that sail out?

1784
01:13:17,296 --> 01:13:19,264
Didn't it brush the fingers?

1785
01:13:19,298 --> 01:13:21,199
(Touch off the block)

1786
01:13:21,433 --> 01:13:22,700
Long!

1787
01:13:22,968 --> 01:13:24,302
(And the official signal is...)

1788
01:13:24,670 --> 01:13:25,970
(Touch-out!)

1789
01:13:25,971 --> 01:13:27,138
Did you get a piece?

1790
01:13:27,139 --> 01:13:28,273
Clean miss.

1791
01:13:28,374 --> 01:13:29,341
Got a touch.

1792
01:13:33,012 --> 01:13:34,879
Brushed Yeon Joo's fingertips.

1793
01:13:35,347 --> 01:13:37,648
(Seung Ju side-outs for the point.)

1794
01:13:38,684 --> 01:13:40,151
That makes it 23 to 21.

1795
01:13:40,586 --> 01:13:41,920
Did it graze you?
Shake it off, you're fine.

1796
01:13:43,088 --> 01:13:44,322
(Seung Ju slams the door on their run.)

1797
01:13:44,323 --> 01:13:46,057
We have to keep leaning on them!

1798
01:13:47,292 --> 01:13:48,492
Let's run it right back!

1799
01:13:49,461 --> 01:13:51,262
- Just one more side-out!
- Caught a finger? No big deal.

1800
01:13:51,764 --> 01:13:54,866
(Seung Ju rallies the squad.)

1801
01:13:55,200 --> 01:13:57,635
(Na Yeon back to serve.)

1802
01:13:59,138 --> 01:14:00,772
Shade toward Enkhsoyol.

1803
01:14:03,008 --> 01:14:04,375
Short ball is mine!

1804
01:14:04,677 --> 01:14:05,710
Let's side out on the first ball!

1805
01:14:09,915 --> 01:14:10,815
Solid pass.

1806
01:14:10,816 --> 01:14:12,884
- Put it away!
- Go!

1807
01:14:12,951 --> 01:14:14,118
Enkhsoyol!

1808
01:14:14,846 --> 01:14:15,454
Swing!

1809
01:14:15,455 --> 01:14:17,221
(Enkhsoyol takes flight.)

1810
01:14:19,058 --> 01:14:20,392
Enkhsoyol swings away!

1811
01:14:20,526 --> 01:14:21,426
Stuffed at the net!

1812
01:14:21,427 --> 01:14:22,694
(Denied by the block)

1813
01:14:22,695 --> 01:14:23,728
Right there for the taking!

1814
01:14:23,729 --> 01:14:25,363
(Sigh)

1815
01:14:25,764 --> 01:14:26,863
(Hye Rim scores with the block.)

1816
01:14:26,864 --> 01:14:29,634
That's the response!

1817
01:14:30,502 --> 01:14:33,504
(Turned away right at set point)

1818
01:14:33,807 --> 01:14:36,574
Back to a one-point game.

1819
01:14:37,242 --> 01:14:39,610
(Breathing right down their necks)

1820
01:14:39,611 --> 01:14:40,911
- One more!
- Finish the play!

1821
01:14:41,113 --> 01:14:42,346
Set the roof!

1822
01:14:44,817 --> 01:14:47,318
Come on, just one more stop!

1823
01:14:47,519 --> 01:14:48,919
All together now!

1824
01:14:50,789 --> 01:14:53,257
(Na Yeon serves again.)

1825
01:14:58,330 --> 01:15:00,631
Hyo Rim.

1826
01:15:00,632 --> 01:15:01,799
- B quick, then back-C.
- Got it!

1827
01:15:01,811 --> 01:15:05,108
(Directing Yeon Joo to attack)

1828
01:15:05,742 --> 01:15:06,642
Na Yeon serves.

1829
01:15:07,642 --> 01:15:08,509
Mine!

1830
01:15:08,776 --> 01:15:09,709
Cover, cover!

1831
01:15:10,176 --> 01:15:11,275
Go for C!

1832
01:15:11,276 --> 01:15:12,076
It's C!

1833
01:15:14,009 --> 01:15:14,942
(Blocked!)

1834
01:15:15,176 --> 01:15:16,675
Just do it one more time!

1835
01:15:16,676 --> 01:15:17,709
(Hyo Rim covers.)

1836
01:15:18,009 --> 01:15:19,009
(But...)

1837
01:15:19,376 --> 01:15:21,342
(The setter is unable to set!)

1838
01:15:21,542 --> 01:15:23,576
(The ball goes to Seon Ah!)

1839
01:15:23,909 --> 01:15:25,975
(Give it to the right side.)

1840
01:15:25,976 --> 01:15:26,709
(Listening)

1841
01:15:27,076 --> 01:15:28,042
Get it!

1842
01:15:28,043 --> 01:15:29,209
(Second contact to the right side)

1843
01:15:30,242 --> 01:15:31,076
Look up!

1844
01:15:31,609 --> 01:15:32,476
(Hyo Rim covers again.)

1845
01:15:32,742 --> 01:15:33,709
One more time!

1846
01:15:33,976 --> 01:15:34,776
Send it up!

1847
01:15:35,242 --> 01:15:36,309
Mine!

1848
01:15:37,109 --> 01:15:38,476
(Setting the ball!)

1849
01:15:41,009 --> 01:15:41,842
Go deep.

1850
01:15:45,109 --> 01:15:47,142
A block touch out off Yeon Joo's attack.

1851
01:15:49,176 --> 01:15:50,342
That's it!

1852
01:15:51,076 --> 01:15:51,942
Out!

1853
01:15:53,809 --> 01:15:55,609
Yeon Joo comes to save the day!

1854
01:15:58,642 --> 01:16:01,141
Seon Ah did such a great job covering.

1855
01:16:01,142 --> 01:16:04,876
Yeon Joo turned the opponent's block
against them.

1856
01:16:07,976 --> 01:16:11,976
(The older teammates showing
veteran prowess)

1857
01:16:12,342 --> 01:16:14,242
(My heart is fluttering.)

1858
01:16:17,209 --> 01:16:19,141
The score is currently 22 to 24.

1859
01:16:19,142 --> 01:16:21,376
(One more point to win the set)

1860
01:16:21,942 --> 01:16:24,909
We're at another set point
for the Wonder Dogs.

1861
01:16:25,209 --> 01:16:26,709
Please, please.

1862
01:16:27,076 --> 01:16:28,575
Ye Eun, she's coming for the right side.

1863
01:16:28,576 --> 01:16:30,808
(The Wonder Dogs get ready.)

1864
01:16:30,809 --> 01:16:32,975
(The Pink Spiders take a deep breath.)

1865
01:16:32,976 --> 01:16:34,408
Let's try again!

1866
01:16:34,409 --> 01:16:35,876
(A turning point in the game)

1867
01:16:36,242 --> 01:16:38,008
(The former captain stands
on the other side.)

1868
01:16:38,009 --> 01:16:39,175
(Facing her...)

1869
01:16:39,176 --> 01:16:41,009
Enkhsoyol will serve.

1870
01:16:43,076 --> 01:16:46,708
The longer the match goes on,
I find myself focusing more.

1871
01:16:46,709 --> 01:16:49,175
I told myself over and over
that we had to win.

1872
01:16:49,176 --> 01:16:51,209
(Desperate to turn the game around)

1873
01:16:51,676 --> 01:16:53,876
(Desperate to secure the victory)

1874
01:16:55,242 --> 01:16:57,476
(Either they fall...)

1875
01:16:58,142 --> 01:17:00,209
(... or take revenge)

1876
01:17:01,809 --> 01:17:04,642
(There is nowhere left to back down.)

1877
01:17:06,009 --> 01:17:09,076
(Enkhsoyol, go for Zone 3!)

1878
01:17:11,642 --> 01:17:13,342
(The target is Park Min Ji.)

1879
01:17:15,542 --> 01:17:16,342
Serve.

1880
01:17:20,342 --> 01:17:21,176
(Target hit)

1881
01:17:22,042 --> 01:17:23,276
(The ball bounces up high.)

1882
01:17:23,609 --> 01:17:25,141
The reception was shaky.

1883
01:17:25,142 --> 01:17:25,942
(It worked!)

1884
01:17:38,242 --> 01:17:42,709
(Enkhsoyol's service ace!)

1885
01:17:43,342 --> 01:17:44,409
That's it!

1886
01:17:49,409 --> 01:17:51,608
Wonder Dogs take the match...

1887
01:17:51,609 --> 01:17:55,176
to the fifth set!

1888
01:18:01,376 --> 01:18:04,176
(Make some noise!)

1889
01:18:09,676 --> 01:18:11,409
(Cheering)

1890
01:18:12,809 --> 01:18:16,841
Let's hope they can bring
back the nice momentum from...

1891
01:18:16,842 --> 01:18:18,342
the match against Shujitsu High...

1892
01:18:19,009 --> 01:18:21,942
and emerge victorious from the fifth set.

1893
01:18:22,909 --> 01:18:25,076
(Let's turn the game around again!)

1894
01:18:25,476 --> 01:18:27,976
(Set score,
Pink Spiders 2 : Wonder Dogs 2)

1895
01:18:28,776 --> 01:18:30,976
(Exhausted chuckle)

1896
01:18:31,876 --> 01:18:33,408
This is amazing.

1897
01:18:33,409 --> 01:18:35,076
This is driving me crazy.

1898
01:18:36,076 --> 01:18:38,276
I was knocked out cold
after the first recording.

1899
01:18:38,509 --> 01:18:41,876
(Excitement that also
knocks out the listener)

1900
01:18:43,309 --> 01:18:45,576
(Maybe he was going too hard.)

1901
01:18:46,342 --> 01:18:48,375
Wonder Dogs take the match
to the fifth set!

1902
01:18:48,376 --> 01:18:49,709
(In a hurry)

1903
01:18:50,042 --> 01:18:53,442
(The most excited he has been in his life)

1904
01:18:53,976 --> 01:18:58,009
(Knocked out
before the fifth set even starts)

1905
01:18:58,242 --> 01:18:59,575
I have no idea what might happen.

1906
01:18:59,576 --> 01:19:03,942
The team with guts will win.

1907
01:19:04,876 --> 01:19:08,375
(Strategy meeting for the fifth set)

1908
01:19:08,376 --> 01:19:09,942
Nice job!

1909
01:19:13,176 --> 01:19:14,975
There's nothing difficult
about the match right now.

1910
01:19:14,976 --> 01:19:19,108
When they have more than two attackers,
that's when we have to score.

1911
01:19:19,109 --> 01:19:20,775
Who should you focus on?

1912
01:19:20,776 --> 01:19:23,075
Their middle blocker.

1913
01:19:23,076 --> 01:19:27,376
Don't forget how we practiced blocking.

1914
01:19:27,876 --> 01:19:29,576
Blocking is all about position.

1915
01:19:29,842 --> 01:19:31,176
The position matters a lot.

1916
01:19:31,776 --> 01:19:34,976
Seung Ju is good
at getting through the gap.

1917
01:19:36,009 --> 01:19:40,009
(Hitting right between the blockers)

1918
01:19:40,676 --> 01:19:42,342
(If you want to block Seung Ju,)

1919
01:19:42,876 --> 01:19:45,576
(fill in the gap.)

1920
01:19:46,042 --> 01:19:49,376
(Operation: Block Seung Ju)

1921
01:19:50,042 --> 01:19:51,076
Seung Ju's strategy is simple.

1922
01:19:52,276 --> 01:19:53,209
Don't worry about her.

1923
01:19:54,276 --> 01:19:56,841
Make sure you keep those blocks tight.

1924
01:19:56,842 --> 01:19:58,609
Stay focused, okay?

1925
01:19:58,809 --> 01:20:00,008
(The Pink Spiders' side)

1926
01:20:00,009 --> 01:20:02,508
Focus on Enkhsoyol.

1927
01:20:02,509 --> 01:20:04,808
- Keep the block solid.
- Yes, Coach.

1928
01:20:04,809 --> 01:20:07,541
Don't just jump haphazardly
during the rally.

1929
01:20:07,542 --> 01:20:08,575
Make sure your jumps are precise.

1930
01:20:08,576 --> 01:20:11,575
This is our last stand.

1931
01:20:11,576 --> 01:20:12,909
We can't lose like this.

1932
01:20:13,409 --> 01:20:15,375
It would be such a waste if we lost now.

1933
01:20:15,376 --> 01:20:16,508
We have to do this.

1934
01:20:16,509 --> 01:20:17,741
There is no other choice.

1935
01:20:17,742 --> 01:20:19,708
Just run.

1936
01:20:19,709 --> 01:20:21,376
Let's go!

1937
01:20:23,076 --> 01:20:24,509
Let's do this!

1938
01:20:24,842 --> 01:20:27,242
Let's pull a reverse sweep.

1939
01:20:28,376 --> 01:20:30,142
This time, we have to win.

1940
01:20:32,642 --> 01:20:35,009
The fifth set is 15 points.

1941
01:20:35,509 --> 01:20:37,208
So they have to take the early lead.

1942
01:20:37,209 --> 01:20:38,076
Right.

1943
01:20:38,077 --> 01:20:39,442
(An early lead is important.)

1944
01:20:39,776 --> 01:20:41,576
Let's get the lead.

1945
01:20:41,876 --> 01:20:42,976
Let's go!

1946
01:20:45,076 --> 01:20:47,242
The fifth set starts off
with Hyo Rim's serve.

1947
01:20:48,909 --> 01:20:50,676
(Her eagle eyes survey the court.)

1948
01:20:54,209 --> 01:20:55,809
(Target found)

1949
01:20:57,209 --> 01:20:58,242
(Target: Zone 2)

1950
01:20:58,542 --> 01:21:00,442
(Stay calm)

1951
01:21:00,742 --> 01:21:03,676
(Service target)

1952
01:21:07,576 --> 01:21:08,542
That was a good serve.

1953
01:21:09,609 --> 01:21:11,175
Seung Ju sends it back.

1954
01:21:11,176 --> 01:21:12,709
(The ball is hastily sent over the net.)

1955
01:21:13,576 --> 01:21:14,709
Hit it!

1956
01:21:15,409 --> 01:21:16,442
(Blocked)

1957
01:21:17,076 --> 01:21:18,376
(The ball goes right to Seung Ju.)

1958
01:21:18,609 --> 01:21:19,576
It's coming!

1959
01:21:19,876 --> 01:21:21,242
(Fill in the gap between blockers)

1960
01:21:21,542 --> 01:21:22,609
One, two...

1961
01:21:22,976 --> 01:21:23,776
(Breached)

1962
01:21:26,909 --> 01:21:28,041
It's defended in the back!

1963
01:21:28,042 --> 01:21:29,042
Cover!

1964
01:21:29,409 --> 01:21:31,042
(Enkhsoyol gets an opportunity.)

1965
01:21:31,476 --> 01:21:33,042
Take your time!

1966
01:21:33,276 --> 01:21:34,476
(Aiming for Na Yeon)

1967
01:21:35,976 --> 01:21:37,042
(Blocked)

1968
01:21:37,442 --> 01:21:38,908
- Front-row attack!
- And to Min Ji.

1969
01:21:38,909 --> 01:21:40,008
(This time, it's Ji Su.)

1970
01:21:40,009 --> 01:21:41,276
It's a tip.

1971
01:21:42,176 --> 01:21:43,076
(Attempts a tip)

1972
01:21:48,242 --> 01:21:50,409
- Oh, no!
- Come on!

1973
01:21:52,109 --> 01:21:53,209
Look at that.

1974
01:21:55,409 --> 01:21:58,642
(The Pink Spiders score the first point.)

1975
01:21:59,076 --> 01:22:00,142
Nicely played.

1976
01:22:04,576 --> 01:22:06,008
I'm sorry.

1977
01:22:06,009 --> 01:22:07,142
The score is 1 to 0.

1978
01:22:07,742 --> 01:22:08,841
Enkhsoyol,

1979
01:22:08,842 --> 01:22:09,976
go deep!

1980
01:22:10,942 --> 01:22:12,809
The setter is fixed.

1981
01:22:15,009 --> 01:22:15,842
Na Yeon,

1982
01:22:16,142 --> 01:22:17,642
block Enkhsoyol.

1983
01:22:20,176 --> 01:22:22,508
(The two...)

1984
01:22:22,509 --> 01:22:25,476
(face off again.)

1985
01:22:27,242 --> 01:22:29,542
The Pink Spiders' first serve goes
to Ji Su.

1986
01:22:30,776 --> 01:22:31,576
Mine!

1987
01:22:31,876 --> 01:22:33,209
- Seon Ah.
- Send it here!

1988
01:22:33,742 --> 01:22:34,976
(The target is Na Yeon.)

1989
01:22:35,876 --> 01:22:36,809
Hyo Rim.

1990
01:22:36,810 --> 01:22:38,742
(The hunt is on.)

1991
01:22:38,942 --> 01:22:39,809
To the line!

1992
01:22:39,942 --> 01:22:41,308
(A head-to-head match)

1993
01:22:41,309 --> 01:22:44,276
Why do you think targeting Na Yeon
would lead to more points?

1994
01:22:44,509 --> 01:22:46,809
Because the setter's block is lower?

1995
01:22:47,376 --> 01:22:48,908
All right.

1996
01:22:48,909 --> 01:22:49,709
(Aiming as coached)

1997
01:22:50,376 --> 01:22:51,176
Enkhsoyol.

1998
01:22:51,176 --> 01:22:52,076
A success!

1999
01:22:52,509 --> 01:22:53,342
Nice!

2000
01:22:53,809 --> 01:22:55,475
As the match progresses,

2001
01:22:55,476 --> 01:22:57,908
Enkhsoyol's attacks are getting
better and better.

2002
01:22:57,909 --> 01:22:59,409
Nice catch.

2003
01:23:00,542 --> 01:23:01,909
Na Yeon, it's okay.

2004
01:23:04,842 --> 01:23:06,309
We just need one point at a time.

2005
01:23:10,376 --> 01:23:11,376
It's Enkhsoyol's serve.

2006
01:23:12,476 --> 01:23:14,142
Her serves are fast.

2007
01:23:14,476 --> 01:23:15,575
Focus on receiving first.

2008
01:23:15,576 --> 01:23:16,842
Make sure she doesn't get a service ace.

2009
01:23:18,509 --> 01:23:19,908
Ye Dam!

2010
01:23:19,909 --> 01:23:21,009
Take one step in.

2011
01:23:29,709 --> 01:23:31,041
It comes down, and she sets the ball.

2012
01:23:31,042 --> 01:23:31,809
It goes to Seung Ju.

2013
01:23:32,542 --> 01:23:35,009
Imagine you're filling in the gap.

2014
01:23:35,176 --> 01:23:38,209
(This time, we'll block it.)

2015
01:23:38,376 --> 01:23:39,309
You have to block it!

2016
01:23:46,942 --> 01:23:50,276
(Ye Dam the Wall blocks the attack.)

2017
01:23:54,942 --> 01:23:56,675
She blocked it!

2018
01:23:56,676 --> 01:23:58,508
Ye Dam the Wall blocks another one!

2019
01:23:58,509 --> 01:23:59,642
The wall is up!

2020
01:24:00,409 --> 01:24:02,208
If you look closely,
they didn't leave any space...

2021
01:24:02,209 --> 01:24:04,609
and precisely stayed close,

2022
01:24:04,876 --> 01:24:07,608
forcing Seung Ju to adjust her angle more.

2023
01:24:07,609 --> 01:24:08,576
Right.

2024
01:24:08,577 --> 01:24:12,408
See how Ye Dam's hand
is in a perfect position?

2025
01:24:12,409 --> 01:24:13,876
She blocked it perfectly.

2026
01:24:14,842 --> 01:24:16,542
That was such a good block.

2027
01:24:23,542 --> 01:24:25,041
I shouldn't have aimed for the gap.

2028
01:24:25,042 --> 01:24:25,942
I had to push deep.

2029
01:24:25,942 --> 01:24:26,876
Take your time.

2030
01:24:27,709 --> 01:24:31,775
The coach said Seung Ju's cross attacks
struggled against Ye Dam last year.

2031
01:24:31,776 --> 01:24:33,376
She agreed not to do cross attacks.

2032
01:24:33,842 --> 01:24:35,476
(During a match
against Suwon Special City last year,)

2033
01:24:36,109 --> 01:24:38,409
(the two clashed.)

2034
01:24:39,276 --> 01:24:40,808
Seung Ju attacks!

2035
01:24:40,809 --> 01:24:43,409
(Ye Dam blocked Seung Ju.)

2036
01:24:44,250 --> 01:24:46,909
(A year later, Ye Dam joins
the Wonder Dogs to block Seung Ju again.)

2037
01:24:47,676 --> 01:24:50,342
(Eagle Coach seeks another prey.)

2038
01:24:56,909 --> 01:24:58,309
(Target found)

2039
01:24:59,109 --> 01:25:00,009
Hyo Rim, what do you see?

2040
01:25:00,842 --> 01:25:01,942
An A-quick.

2041
01:25:02,309 --> 01:25:03,409
Go for it.

2042
01:25:03,409 --> 01:25:04,276
(Mission given)

2043
01:25:04,844 --> 01:25:06,111
Get ready, Ye Dam.

2044
01:25:06,515 --> 01:25:07,382
(Okay.)

2045
01:25:07,883 --> 01:25:08,916
Na Yeon is serving.

2046
01:25:11,687 --> 01:25:12,553
Mine.

2047
01:25:12,655 --> 01:25:13,555
Good reception.

2048
01:25:13,723 --> 01:25:14,756
That's it.

2049
01:25:14,990 --> 01:25:16,323
(A free-ball opportunity)

2050
01:25:16,324 --> 01:25:17,291
That's it.

2051
01:25:17,693 --> 01:25:19,394
Hit it.

2052
01:25:19,395 --> 01:25:21,362
A successful quick attack!

2053
01:25:21,465 --> 01:25:23,334
- Nice!
- That's it.

2054
01:25:23,335 --> 01:25:25,033
(A thunderous quick attack, right on cue)

2055
01:25:27,636 --> 01:25:29,870
(It's Ye Dam again!)

2056
01:25:30,773 --> 01:25:33,141
Ye Dam is on fire today.

2057
01:25:33,409 --> 01:25:35,076
- Dam-da-di.
- Dam-da-di.

2058
01:25:35,778 --> 01:25:36,711
- Lee Ye Dam.
- Lee Ye Dam.

2059
01:25:37,046 --> 01:25:39,414
- Dam-da-di.
- Dam-da-di.

2060
01:25:39,415 --> 01:25:40,482
- Lee Ye Dam.
- Lee Ye Dam.

2061
01:25:41,550 --> 01:25:43,451
It's okay.

2062
01:25:43,452 --> 01:25:45,653
Let's go right away.

2063
01:25:46,222 --> 01:25:48,223
We need to score a lot of points here.

2064
01:25:48,257 --> 01:25:50,258
- I'll give you the signal, Enkhsoyol.
- Okay.

2065
01:25:50,459 --> 01:25:52,326
Keep blocking firmly, just like you did.

2066
01:25:52,327 --> 01:25:53,561
- Watch the timing.
- Okay.

2067
01:25:54,097 --> 01:25:55,363
Short ball.

2068
01:25:55,364 --> 01:25:56,731
(Fifth set, Pink Spiders 3
: Wonder Dogs 3)

2069
01:25:57,700 --> 01:25:59,634
(Instructing to target Enkhsoyol)

2070
01:25:59,768 --> 01:26:01,469
(Instruction received)

2071
01:26:03,839 --> 01:26:04,906
Seung Ju is serving.

2072
01:26:07,243 --> 01:26:09,678
It's over. Go for a quick attack.

2073
01:26:11,213 --> 01:26:12,346
It's blocked.

2074
01:26:12,347 --> 01:26:13,548
Set it again.

2075
01:26:14,116 --> 01:26:15,049
Set it again.

2076
01:26:15,050 --> 01:26:15,983
It's a back C.

2077
01:26:16,185 --> 01:26:17,219
Come on.

2078
01:26:17,220 --> 01:26:18,319
It's one-on-one.

2079
01:26:18,320 --> 01:26:19,053
(Blocked again)

2080
01:26:21,558 --> 01:26:22,657
They kept it alive!

2081
01:26:22,658 --> 01:26:23,491
That's it.

2082
01:26:23,492 --> 01:26:25,026
Again. Try again.

2083
01:26:25,027 --> 01:26:25,961
To the left.

2084
01:26:26,962 --> 01:26:28,595
Ye Eun charges in.

2085
01:26:28,600 --> 01:26:29,365
(An intense rally)

2086
01:26:29,879 --> 01:26:30,979
Send it back!

2087
01:26:31,133 --> 01:26:32,467
Na Yeon.

2088
01:26:32,769 --> 01:26:33,802
One, two.

2089
01:26:35,771 --> 01:26:37,972
To the right. They keep it alive.

2090
01:26:39,208 --> 01:26:41,109
A bump set. Yeon Joo.

2091
01:26:41,410 --> 01:26:42,844
(A powerful spike)

2092
01:26:45,281 --> 01:26:46,914
Seung Ju digs it while falling.

2093
01:26:47,850 --> 01:26:49,284
Mine!

2094
01:26:49,852 --> 01:26:50,952
Go for it.

2095
01:26:50,953 --> 01:26:52,020
Min Ji.

2096
01:26:52,354 --> 01:26:53,354
One, two.

2097
01:26:53,889 --> 01:26:55,056
(We have to block this too.)

2098
01:26:56,659 --> 01:26:58,727
Will Min Ji get blocked? She does!

2099
01:26:58,994 --> 01:27:01,330
(Bo Been gets a block point too.)

2100
01:27:03,832 --> 01:27:07,401
(The intensity is rising.)

2101
01:27:08,104 --> 01:27:10,939
Blocking!

2102
01:27:11,573 --> 01:27:13,473
One thing that has changed
about the Wonder Dogs is...

2103
01:27:13,474 --> 01:27:16,010
their middle blocking
has improved tremendously.

2104
01:27:16,179 --> 01:27:19,147
The opposing left-side hitter
has nowhere to hit.

2105
01:27:19,148 --> 01:27:21,482
(The unstoppable middle-blocking duo)

2106
01:27:22,251 --> 01:27:25,787
(The atmosphere is absolutely electric.)

2107
01:27:27,856 --> 01:27:31,259
Your body is getting stiff.
Just relax and swing freely.

2108
01:27:31,260 --> 01:27:33,995
I don't think we should hit
toward their middle blockers.

2109
01:27:33,996 --> 01:27:35,729
We need to aim somewhere else.

2110
01:27:35,964 --> 01:27:37,799
Min Ji, when facing a high ball,
watch the line.

2111
01:27:37,800 --> 01:27:39,867
(Watch out for their middle blockers.)

2112
01:27:39,936 --> 01:27:41,536
The score is 4 to 3, one point apart.

2113
01:27:42,838 --> 01:27:44,605
We're doing fine.

2114
01:27:44,974 --> 01:27:47,208
It's enough.

2115
01:27:47,543 --> 01:27:49,310
(Let's string some points together.)

2116
01:27:49,311 --> 01:27:52,313
The Wonder Dogs find the momentum
and take an early lead.

2117
01:27:52,314 --> 01:27:54,148
- We need to keep it going.
- Exactly.

2118
01:27:55,451 --> 01:27:57,285
(Searching for a target again)

2119
01:28:02,858 --> 01:28:03,991
(Spotted)

2120
01:28:04,793 --> 01:28:05,993
(Serve to Zone 3.)

2121
01:28:07,864 --> 01:28:09,097
Yeon Joo serves.

2122
01:28:09,865 --> 01:28:11,265
(Going straight at the libero)

2123
01:28:13,168 --> 01:28:14,100
Mine.

2124
01:28:14,101 --> 01:28:15,636
The reception is shaky.

2125
01:28:16,105 --> 01:28:17,072
Nice serve.

2126
01:28:18,173 --> 01:28:19,073
Min Ji.

2127
01:28:19,875 --> 01:28:22,810
(The two face each other again)

2128
01:28:22,878 --> 01:28:25,279
- A soft tip.
- A soft tip.

2129
01:28:26,515 --> 01:28:27,548
A soft tip.

2130
01:28:27,549 --> 01:28:29,217
(The ball deflects off their hands.)

2131
01:28:31,587 --> 01:28:32,888
(Just failed to cover it)

2132
01:28:33,455 --> 01:28:36,557
(Unbelievable)

2133
01:28:36,558 --> 01:28:37,492
(Cheering them on again)

2134
01:28:37,493 --> 01:28:39,894
(Ye Eun's father)

2135
01:28:42,232 --> 01:28:43,098
Are you okay?

2136
01:28:43,110 --> 01:28:45,010
(The players are just as disappointed.)

2137
01:28:47,369 --> 01:28:49,236
- Great connection.
- Well done.

2138
01:28:49,237 --> 01:28:50,471
We're right there with them.

2139
01:28:50,472 --> 01:28:52,873
It's only one or two points.

2140
01:28:54,510 --> 01:28:55,677
The score is tied at 4 to 4.

2141
01:28:55,678 --> 01:28:59,681
