2409
01:41:55,218 --> 01:41:57,718
and get one more point.

2410
01:41:59,851 --> 01:42:00,851
Na Yeon serves.

2411
01:42:02,051 --> 01:42:05,251
Hey! It'll be short!

2412
01:42:06,384 --> 01:42:07,251
Watch for the drop!

2413
01:42:11,784 --> 01:42:12,684
Gosh.

2414
01:42:12,684 --> 01:42:13,618
Left!

2415
01:42:14,318 --> 01:42:16,251
Hyo Rim bumps the ball up for Ye Eun,
who takes a calm swing.

2416
01:42:16,751 --> 01:42:17,718
Get it up!

2417
01:42:18,318 --> 01:42:19,151
A rebound play.

2418
01:42:19,151 --> 01:42:20,018
Left side!

2419
01:42:20,019 --> 01:42:21,150
Let's do it again!

2420
01:42:21,151 --> 01:42:22,018
One more time!

2421
01:42:22,384 --> 01:42:23,584
The ball comes back up for another attack.

2422
01:42:23,818 --> 01:42:24,851
Seon Ah covers it again.

2423
01:42:25,118 --> 01:42:26,817
Set to Yeon Joo!

2424
01:42:26,818 --> 01:42:27,917
Yeon Joo!

2425
01:42:27,918 --> 01:42:28,983
It's set to Yeon Joo!

2426
01:42:28,984 --> 01:42:30,450
- You have to swing!
- Put it away!

2427
01:42:30,451 --> 01:42:31,717
Take your time.

2428
01:42:31,718 --> 01:42:32,984
(Seung Ju gets ready to block.)

2429
01:42:33,418 --> 01:42:34,718
The spike comes in!

2430
01:42:35,318 --> 01:42:37,617
- It's out.
- No!

2431
01:42:37,618 --> 01:42:38,818
I didn't touch it! I swear I didn't!

2432
01:42:39,418 --> 01:42:40,984
It's called out!

2433
01:42:44,884 --> 01:42:45,984
This is bad.

2434
01:42:47,218 --> 01:42:48,618
It's 11 to 10 with just a one-point gap.

2435
01:42:49,418 --> 01:42:51,217
The Wonder Dogs know...

2436
01:42:51,218 --> 01:42:54,250
they still can't afford to relax.

2437
01:42:54,251 --> 01:42:58,683
This is going to make the game
much harder.

2438
01:42:58,684 --> 01:43:00,917
A point here ties it up.

2439
01:43:00,918 --> 01:43:01,983
Let's take it one point at a time.

2440
01:43:01,984 --> 01:43:03,717
This is our chance. Let's get this point.

2441
01:43:03,718 --> 01:43:04,850
No need to rush.

2442
01:43:04,851 --> 01:43:06,884
Take it slow.

2443
01:43:09,284 --> 01:43:10,718
(Na Yeon serves again.)

2444
01:43:12,018 --> 01:43:12,918
- Hey!
- Ye Eun.

2445
01:43:13,084 --> 01:43:14,584
Hyo Rim moves back.

2446
01:43:14,884 --> 01:43:15,718
And Yeon Joo!

2447
01:43:16,518 --> 01:43:17,418
(Na Yeon digs the ball.)

2448
01:43:17,419 --> 01:43:18,583
They keep it alive.

2449
01:43:18,584 --> 01:43:19,551
The ball goes to Da Eun.

2450
01:43:19,551 --> 01:43:20,451
Da Eun!

2451
01:43:20,451 --> 01:43:21,251
She spikes it.

2452
01:43:21,252 --> 01:43:22,484
(The ball ricochets off the hands.)

2453
01:43:24,151 --> 01:43:25,718
(The ball heads toward Yeon Joo.)

2454
01:43:25,951 --> 01:43:26,818
Please.

2455
01:43:32,818 --> 01:43:34,784
(Cheering)

2456
01:43:35,151 --> 01:43:36,418
Nice play!

2457
01:43:37,584 --> 01:43:38,684
This is driving me crazy.

2458
01:43:40,183 --> 01:43:43,517
The Pink Spiders have erased
the three-point gap...

2459
01:43:43,518 --> 01:43:45,317
and tied it at 11!

2460
01:43:45,318 --> 01:43:47,418
We're at square one again.

2461
01:43:48,351 --> 01:43:50,083
This is the crucial stretch.

2462
01:43:50,084 --> 01:43:52,683
But the game hasn't
been turned around yet.

2463
01:43:52,684 --> 01:43:53,614
That's right.

2464
01:43:55,584 --> 01:43:56,551
Na Yeon serves.

2465
01:43:56,552 --> 01:43:57,851
(A tight battle for the final point)

2466
01:43:58,051 --> 01:43:59,851
Read the play. Move farther inside.

2467
01:44:02,751 --> 01:44:03,718
Hey!

2468
01:44:03,719 --> 01:44:05,025
The reception is off.

2469
01:44:05,784 --> 01:44:06,818
It's a chance.

2470
01:44:07,751 --> 01:44:10,118
(The ball is kept alive
and sent toward Ye Dam.)

2471
01:44:10,551 --> 01:44:11,883
(The middle is wide open.)

2472
01:44:11,884 --> 01:44:13,683
- Ye Dam, just swing away!
- Just hit it!

2473
01:44:13,684 --> 01:44:14,484
Ye Dam!

2474
01:44:14,484 --> 01:44:15,484
Ye Dam pushes the ball over.

2475
01:44:15,485 --> 01:44:17,018
Slow down!

2476
01:44:17,284 --> 01:44:18,417
Oh, my goodness.

2477
01:44:18,418 --> 01:44:19,573
They're rushing so much.

2478
01:44:19,818 --> 01:44:20,774
It's going to the right.

2479
01:44:21,251 --> 01:44:22,951
- Da Eun.
- Send it deep!

2480
01:44:23,318 --> 01:44:24,251
Block it!

2481
01:44:27,218 --> 01:44:28,051
The attack is in.

2482
01:44:29,618 --> 01:44:33,351
(Da Eun scores back-to-back points.)

2483
01:44:33,784 --> 01:44:35,317
Let's hang in there a little longer.

2484
01:44:35,318 --> 01:44:36,883
We can do this. Don't give up.

2485
01:44:36,884 --> 01:44:38,884
The Pink Spiders take the lead, 12 to 11!

2486
01:44:40,251 --> 01:44:41,750
Let's keep going.

2487
01:44:41,751 --> 01:44:43,483
Let's keep this momentum going
until the end.

2488
01:44:43,484 --> 01:44:45,618
Let's go! We can do this!

2489
01:44:46,318 --> 01:44:49,351
(Three more points and it's over.)

2490
01:44:50,651 --> 01:44:51,884
Na Yeon serves again.

2491
01:44:53,451 --> 01:44:54,318
- Hey!
- My ball!

2492
01:44:54,751 --> 01:44:55,718
Cover!

2493
01:44:56,184 --> 01:44:57,551
- Ye Eun!
- Ye Eun.

2494
01:44:57,818 --> 01:44:59,618
- Hit it!
- Take the shot!

2495
01:44:59,643 --> 01:45:00,543
You have to swing!

2496
01:45:01,584 --> 01:45:02,384
She gets it over.

2497
01:45:02,651 --> 01:45:03,818
Su Yeon makes the save.

2498
01:45:03,818 --> 01:45:04,651
Okay, C!

2499
01:45:04,652 --> 01:45:06,119
(Everyone crowds the net.)

2500
01:45:06,354 --> 01:45:07,920
(Na Yeon sets it back.)

2501
01:45:08,442 --> 01:45:10,197
(They fell for the fake.)

2502
01:45:10,598 --> 01:45:11,865
The middle is wide open.

2503
01:45:12,166 --> 01:45:13,365
(A determined dig)

2504
01:45:13,366 --> 01:45:14,601
- Good save!
- Let's go!

2505
01:45:14,769 --> 01:45:15,702
Cover!

2506
01:45:15,870 --> 01:45:17,370
Left! Ye Eun!

2507
01:45:17,539 --> 01:45:18,872
- Ye Eun!
- They go again. A hard swing!

2508
01:45:18,873 --> 01:45:20,574
- Mine!
- Mine!

2509
01:45:20,575 --> 01:45:21,842
- Cover!
- Seon Ah plays it calmly.

2510
01:45:22,410 --> 01:45:23,810
Yeon Joo!

2511
01:45:23,811 --> 01:45:25,078
Yeon Joo!

2512
01:45:25,079 --> 01:45:26,981
- Yeon Joo.
- Hit it!

2513
01:45:26,982 --> 01:45:27,981
Softly!

2514
01:45:28,616 --> 01:45:29,916
And they dig it up.

2515
01:45:29,917 --> 01:45:32,652
(The rally goes on and on.)

2516
01:45:32,987 --> 01:45:33,920
C!

2517
01:45:35,123 --> 01:45:36,056
Seung Ju!

2518
01:45:37,091 --> 01:45:38,058
It gets through!

2519
01:45:38,059 --> 01:45:39,893
(Right through the block!)

2520
01:45:40,595 --> 01:45:41,962
Out!

2521
01:45:41,963 --> 01:45:44,598
- Out!
- It's out!

2522
01:45:44,866 --> 01:45:45,766
Yes!

2523
01:45:45,767 --> 01:45:46,900
It's tied at 12.

2524
01:45:46,901 --> 01:45:48,836
They've fought back to tie it.

2525
01:45:48,837 --> 01:45:50,604
(Fifth set, Pink Spiders 12
: Wonder Dogs 12)

2526
01:45:51,773 --> 01:45:53,974
The Wonder Dogs and Pink Spiders are
going head-to-head.

2527
01:45:54,309 --> 01:45:56,443
There are only a few points left.

2528
01:46:00,581 --> 01:46:02,148
(Sighing)

2529
01:46:02,917 --> 01:46:05,185
(Man, this is intense.)

2530
01:46:06,054 --> 01:46:07,555
(Nervous laughter)

2531
01:46:07,556 --> 01:46:08,789
Why do I feel like I'm out there?

2532
01:46:10,025 --> 01:46:12,492
The players are exhausted.
These long rallies...

2533
01:46:12,660 --> 01:46:13,927
leave them gasping for air.

2534
01:46:14,295 --> 01:46:17,297
Both teams are running on fumes,

2535
01:46:17,631 --> 01:46:20,033
so I think it'll come down...

2536
01:46:20,034 --> 01:46:21,668
to who stays just a bit more focused.

2537
01:46:22,970 --> 01:46:24,137
Yeon Joo!

2538
01:46:24,138 --> 01:46:25,539
(Yeon Joo heads to serve with confidence.)

2539
01:46:25,540 --> 01:46:28,508
- Yeon Joo!
- Ye Dam is serving!

2540
01:46:30,512 --> 01:46:32,479
Yeon Joo!

2541
01:46:33,014 --> 01:46:33,914
Yeon Joo!

2542
01:46:34,115 --> 01:46:35,248
Hang in there!

2543
01:46:35,249 --> 01:46:36,383
(Even the veteran is on empty.)

2544
01:46:36,718 --> 01:46:38,652
I had nothing left in the tank.

2545
01:46:38,753 --> 01:46:40,487
I felt like I was losing my mind.

2546
01:46:40,621 --> 01:46:41,621
Now!

2547
01:46:41,823 --> 01:46:43,056
Let's go!

2548
01:46:43,859 --> 01:46:45,659
You got this, Yeon Joo!

2549
01:46:45,660 --> 01:46:46,927
We got this! Let's go!

2550
01:46:47,528 --> 01:46:49,896
It's okay. Just one more.

2551
01:46:50,331 --> 01:46:52,332
I'll do one more. Sorry.

2552
01:46:55,369 --> 01:46:57,436
(Once again, Seung Ju is the target.)

2553
01:46:57,437 --> 01:46:58,504
Ye Dam to serve.

2554
01:46:58,505 --> 01:47:00,840
- Ye Dam, just get it over!
- Ye Dam, no errors!

2555
01:47:01,175 --> 01:47:02,142
Serve!

2556
01:47:04,212 --> 01:47:05,846
(She throws off the reception.)

2557
01:47:06,114 --> 01:47:07,714
Na Yeon sets to Seung Ju.

2558
01:47:07,982 --> 01:47:08,916
Off the block!

2559
01:47:08,917 --> 01:47:09,983
Free ball!

2560
01:47:09,984 --> 01:47:10,951
That's it!

2561
01:47:11,420 --> 01:47:12,786
- Nice!
- Hey!

2562
01:47:12,954 --> 01:47:13,921
Hyo Rim.

2563
01:47:14,222 --> 01:47:17,157
Come on, Ye Eun!

2564
01:47:17,492 --> 01:47:19,026
- Swing!
- Ye Eun.

2565
01:47:19,594 --> 01:47:21,395
Cover her! Go right!

2566
01:47:21,396 --> 01:47:23,330
- Again!
- Yeon Joo!

2567
01:47:23,564 --> 01:47:24,664
Right!

2568
01:47:24,665 --> 01:47:25,798
Get it up!

2569
01:47:26,501 --> 01:47:27,501
Pass!

2570
01:47:27,802 --> 01:47:29,369
Na Yeon's set goes awry.

2571
01:47:29,370 --> 01:47:30,437
They have to go for it!

2572
01:47:30,438 --> 01:47:31,739
(Never one to miss an opening,)

2573
01:47:31,740 --> 01:47:33,440
(Seung Ju goes for it.)

2574
01:47:34,542 --> 01:47:35,642
Why?

2575
01:47:37,745 --> 01:47:38,678
Free ball.

2576
01:47:38,846 --> 01:47:39,979
She sends a soft shot deep.

2577
01:47:41,382 --> 01:47:43,016
Da Eun off the back set.

2578
01:47:43,985 --> 01:47:44,985
(Refusing to give up)

2579
01:47:44,986 --> 01:47:45,886
Okay!

2580
01:47:45,887 --> 01:47:46,954
Yeon Joo.

2581
01:47:46,955 --> 01:47:48,355
It catches the net and goes over.

2582
01:47:48,856 --> 01:47:49,856
Just one more.

2583
01:47:50,057 --> 01:47:51,791
- Again!
- Back to the right side.

2584
01:47:52,226 --> 01:47:53,259
A push shot!

2585
01:47:53,260 --> 01:47:54,227
Come on!

2586
01:47:54,228 --> 01:47:55,495
(Whistle blows)

2587
01:47:55,596 --> 01:47:56,896
- What?
- What happened?

2588
01:47:57,165 --> 01:47:58,132
What is it?

2589
01:47:59,033 --> 01:48:02,335
- Net violation!
- Right.

2590
01:48:03,638 --> 01:48:06,073
(Da Eun commits a net violation.)

2591
01:48:07,008 --> 01:48:10,310
(A lucky point for the Wonder Dogs)

2592
01:48:10,945 --> 01:48:12,212
A net violation by Da Eun.

2593
01:48:12,213 --> 01:48:13,747
The Wonder Dogs retake the lead.

2594
01:48:13,748 --> 01:48:17,284
(Fifth set, Pink Spiders 12
: Wonder Dogs 13)

2595
01:48:19,687 --> 01:48:21,621
- It's okay. You're okay.
- We've got this.

2596
01:48:21,622 --> 01:48:22,622
We've got this.

2597
01:48:25,760 --> 01:48:26,927
Come on.

2598
01:48:26,928 --> 01:48:29,296
(A point earned through sheer grit)

2599
01:48:29,297 --> 01:48:32,533
Da Eun loses her balance at the net.

2600
01:48:32,534 --> 01:48:33,767
It's 13 to 12.

2601
01:48:34,035 --> 01:48:37,671
The Wonder Dogs are back in the lead
on a net violation.

2602
01:48:37,672 --> 01:48:39,006
(The lead changes hands again.)

2603
01:48:43,644 --> 01:48:45,845
- One good dig!
- They've got the momentum now.

2604
01:48:45,846 --> 01:48:48,949
It'd be great to put together
a run of points here.

2605
01:48:48,950 --> 01:48:51,284
We can do this!

2606
01:48:51,285 --> 01:48:53,753
- Let's go!
- They certainly can.

2607
01:48:53,754 --> 01:48:56,956
Where will Na Yeon set the ball?

2608
01:48:58,626 --> 01:49:00,493
I can't send it down the line.

2609
01:49:00,829 --> 01:49:02,395
It's too short.

2610
01:49:02,396 --> 01:49:03,964
(Targeting Seung Ju pays off.)

2611
01:49:03,965 --> 01:49:04,998
Bo Been,

2612
01:49:05,132 --> 01:49:06,432
we're stopping her.

2613
01:49:06,968 --> 01:49:07,935
Okay.

2614
01:49:07,936 --> 01:49:10,603
We need to score!
Hye Rim, you do your part too.

2615
01:49:10,604 --> 01:49:12,705
- Got it.
- It's a running set!

2616
01:49:12,907 --> 01:49:13,973
(Seung Ju is the target again.)

2617
01:49:13,974 --> 01:49:16,410
We need to stay calm first.

2618
01:49:16,411 --> 01:49:18,311
The Wonder Dogs keep their composure.

2619
01:49:18,546 --> 01:49:20,480
The short ones are mine!

2620
01:49:23,217 --> 01:49:24,184
The serve.

2621
01:49:26,454 --> 01:49:27,120
(They're shaken.)

2622
01:49:27,588 --> 01:49:28,588
Up the middle.

2623
01:49:28,789 --> 01:49:29,789
Close the gap!

2624
01:49:29,790 --> 01:49:31,190
Inside!

2625
01:49:31,191 --> 01:49:32,425
(Bo Been goes up for a solo block.)

2626
01:49:32,760 --> 01:49:34,060
Bo Been goes up alone!

2627
01:49:34,328 --> 01:49:35,928
(One, two)

2628
01:49:35,929 --> 01:49:37,397
I knew I had to stop it.

2629
01:49:38,933 --> 01:49:40,867
A stuff block!

2630
01:49:40,868 --> 01:49:42,903
(Cheering)

2631
01:49:42,904 --> 01:49:44,104
That's it!

2632
01:49:46,741 --> 01:49:50,677
Bo Been! What a brilliant moment!

2633
01:49:52,813 --> 01:49:54,380
- Yes!
- You did it!

2634
01:49:54,415 --> 01:49:56,083
A block point!

2635
01:49:56,084 --> 01:50:01,021
(Fifth set, Pink Spiders 12
: Wonder Dogs 14)

2636
01:50:01,022 --> 01:50:04,525
What a play by Bo Been!

2637
01:50:05,026 --> 01:50:07,494
Just one more!

2638
01:50:11,366 --> 01:50:15,168
Bo Been has started to read
Na Yeon's setting tendencies.

2639
01:50:15,636 --> 01:50:18,037
See how she held her ground in the middle?

2640
01:50:18,906 --> 01:50:20,206
(Frustrated)

2641
01:50:20,207 --> 01:50:22,375
When Na Yeon can't set it wide,

2642
01:50:22,376 --> 01:50:24,010
- she always goes to the middle.
- Right.

2643
01:50:24,345 --> 01:50:26,980
It's match point for the Wonder Dogs!

2644
01:50:27,181 --> 01:50:28,781
Let's get one more!

2645
01:50:29,283 --> 01:50:32,552
(Just one point away from victory)

2646
01:50:33,921 --> 01:50:35,922
They know me...

2647
01:50:36,490 --> 01:50:38,391
pretty well over there,

2648
01:50:38,592 --> 01:50:39,592
so it wasn't easy.

2649
01:50:39,593 --> 01:50:42,395
(They knew each other so well,)

2650
01:50:43,164 --> 01:50:46,733
(so they went after each other
even harder.)

2651
01:50:47,401 --> 01:50:51,004
(How did we end up facing off like this?)

2652
01:50:52,139 --> 01:50:54,307
But I still had to play.

2653
01:50:54,875 --> 01:50:56,375
I had to win.

2654
01:50:56,376 --> 01:50:57,577
(Her determination to win remains.)

2655
01:50:57,578 --> 01:50:59,212
That was all I could think about.

2656
01:50:59,680 --> 01:51:01,080
(Eyes snap open)

2657
01:51:01,749 --> 01:51:04,150
We can do this. Don't give up. It's okay.

2658
01:51:04,852 --> 01:51:07,353
Hye Rim, get into position on defense!

2659
01:51:07,354 --> 01:51:09,155
Min Ji, this one's yours.

2660
01:51:10,491 --> 01:51:12,826
It's okay. We can do this!

2661
01:51:13,060 --> 01:51:14,994
Just one good dig.

2662
01:51:15,964 --> 01:51:18,865
Front combo, back combo! Watch the back!

2663
01:51:22,937 --> 01:51:25,372
- It's coming fast!
- Okay!

2664
01:51:25,373 --> 01:51:27,073
(An exhausted Seung Ju is
the target yet again.)

2665
01:51:28,175 --> 01:51:29,609
We can get one.

2666
01:51:29,610 --> 01:51:31,511
It's coming straight over!

2667
01:51:31,512 --> 01:51:32,912
We can get one.

2668
01:51:33,447 --> 01:51:35,014
This is a running set!

2669
01:51:37,852 --> 01:51:38,885
Here comes the serve.

2670
01:51:40,855 --> 01:51:42,022
- Nice serve!
- Nice serve.

2671
01:51:42,023 --> 01:51:43,757
- A shaky reception!
- There it is!

2672
01:51:43,758 --> 01:51:45,091
Mine!

2673
01:51:46,093 --> 01:51:47,193
Da Eun!

2674
01:51:47,695 --> 01:51:49,162
(Da Eun gets the call, not Seung Ju.)

2675
01:51:49,163 --> 01:51:50,163
Go in!

2676
01:51:50,199 --> 01:51:52,966
- Go!
- Watch the right!

2677
01:51:52,967 --> 01:51:54,767
- Da Eun!
- Da Eun goes for the kill!

2678
01:51:55,836 --> 01:51:57,670
(She slips.)

2679
01:51:57,805 --> 01:52:00,373
Where are you going?

2680
01:52:01,008 --> 01:52:04,877
(A collective groan)

2681
01:52:05,513 --> 01:52:07,547
- Okay!
- Fourteen to thirteen.

2682
01:52:07,782 --> 01:52:10,317
It's still match point
for the Wonder Dogs.

2683
01:52:10,718 --> 01:52:15,388
I think Seung Ju was a big part
of their success as a leader.

2684
01:52:16,391 --> 01:52:18,324
Let's get one!

2685
01:52:18,325 --> 01:52:20,059
(The momentum shifts again.)

2686
01:52:20,628 --> 01:52:23,230
Both teams have given everything
through five sets.

2687
01:52:23,231 --> 01:52:26,233
Now comes the final test
that could decide the match.

2688
01:52:26,234 --> 01:52:27,367
(A grueling battle)

2689
01:52:28,870 --> 01:52:31,971
This could be the end,
or we could be headed for a deuce.

2690
01:52:32,840 --> 01:52:36,943
(One more point lost means a deuce.)

2691
01:52:38,279 --> 01:52:40,080
Short ones in the middle are mine!

2692
01:52:40,081 --> 01:52:41,014
Just watch the short ones.

2693
01:52:41,649 --> 01:52:42,682
I'll take the deep ones.

2694
01:52:43,584 --> 01:52:47,520
(The hitter the Pink Spiders expect)

2695
01:52:48,123 --> 01:52:49,422
Min Ji.

2696
01:52:49,758 --> 01:52:51,925
Stay square and cover the inside.

2697
01:52:52,493 --> 01:52:53,993
I'll cover the line.

2698
01:52:53,994 --> 01:52:54,861
(They shut down Yeon Joo.)

2699
01:52:55,697 --> 01:52:58,031
In the end, the player I could trust
to finish it was...

2700
01:52:58,032 --> 01:53:00,200
(Coach Kim's choice for the final attack)

2701
01:53:00,668 --> 01:53:01,601
Ye Eun!

2702
01:53:02,269 --> 01:53:03,135
Ye Eun!

2703
01:53:04,172 --> 01:53:05,505
Ye Eun!

2704
01:53:07,508 --> 01:53:08,808
Ye Eun!

2705
01:53:08,809 --> 01:53:10,111
(It's up to you to finish this.)

2706
01:53:10,112 --> 01:53:11,111
Got it.

2707
01:53:13,447 --> 01:53:15,281
I was a little surprised.

2708
01:53:15,683 --> 01:53:18,184
When I was playing professionally,

2709
01:53:18,819 --> 01:53:20,553
I never went in to attack.

2710
01:53:20,755 --> 01:53:22,522
I only came in to serve.

2711
01:53:23,023 --> 01:53:26,959
(Ye Eun, a hitter unaccustomed
to attacking)

2712
01:53:27,161 --> 01:53:28,461
Ye Eun!

2713
01:53:28,462 --> 01:53:29,730
(Coach Kim puts the match in her hands.)

2714
01:53:29,731 --> 01:53:32,465
In a way, she was giving me a chance.

2715
01:53:32,466 --> 01:53:34,400
I wanted to prove myself.

2716
01:53:35,569 --> 01:53:38,272
(You can do it.)

2717
01:53:38,273 --> 01:53:41,808
- It's 14 to 13. Match point, Wonder Dogs!
- Come on!

2718
01:53:42,476 --> 01:53:45,211
(Seung Ju serves.)

2719
01:53:45,547 --> 01:53:46,646
Serve!

2720
01:53:47,915 --> 01:53:49,382
- Nice!
- Right side!

2721
01:53:50,151 --> 01:53:51,685
(As expected, they go to Yeon Joo.)

2722
01:53:51,686 --> 01:53:52,552
Good!

2723
01:53:53,488 --> 01:53:56,122
- No!
- Mine!

2724
01:53:56,291 --> 01:53:58,392
- Ye Eun!
- The line!

2725
01:53:58,393 --> 01:53:59,993
A high ball is coming. Just one.

2726
01:54:00,194 --> 01:54:02,195
- Just one more!
- Good!

2727
01:54:02,196 --> 01:54:03,762
Ye Eun, watch the line!

2728
01:54:03,763 --> 01:54:05,331
- Swing!
- Hit it!

2729
01:54:05,332 --> 01:54:06,832
I thought, "I'll finish it myself."

2730
01:54:07,134 --> 01:54:09,035
She goes for it!

2731
01:54:16,243 --> 01:54:17,410
(Out!)

2732
01:54:20,047 --> 01:54:22,348
(The Wonder Dogs erupt in cheers.)

2733
01:54:22,850 --> 01:54:25,285
(A point off the block out)

2734
01:54:25,486 --> 01:54:27,487
(Out)

2735
01:54:27,721 --> 01:54:28,888
(Roaring in triumph)

2736
01:54:28,989 --> 01:54:30,790
(Overwhelmed with joy)

2737
01:54:31,158 --> 01:54:32,225
Come here, quick!

2738
01:54:38,232 --> 01:54:39,399
(Whoosh)

2739
01:54:40,301 --> 01:54:41,301
Let me in too!

2740
01:54:44,004 --> 01:54:46,105
They pulled it off!

2741
01:54:46,106 --> 01:54:48,341
The Wonder Dogs have pulled it off!

2742
01:54:48,342 --> 01:54:50,910
(We won!)

2743
01:54:52,313 --> 01:54:53,913
A stunning comeback!

2744
01:54:54,648 --> 01:54:56,248
A wonderful victory!

2745
01:54:57,484 --> 01:54:59,318
From 2 sets down to a 3 to 2 win.

2746
01:54:59,454 --> 01:55:01,588
They've pulled off another miracle,

2747
01:55:01,856 --> 01:55:03,599
another reverse sweep!

2748
01:55:03,972 --> 01:55:06,040
The Wonder Dogs beat the Pink Spiders!

2749
01:55:07,008 --> 01:55:08,142
(They beat the most decorated team.)

2750
01:55:08,143 --> 01:55:09,509
They actually did it!

2751
01:55:10,511 --> 01:55:14,380
What a thrilling victory...

2752
01:55:14,682 --> 01:55:16,650
for the 2,000 fans here today.

2753
01:55:16,651 --> 01:55:19,619
What a game by the Wonder Dogs.

2754
01:55:20,254 --> 01:55:24,657
First against Shujitsu,
and now against the Pink Spiders,

2755
01:55:25,126 --> 01:55:28,995
the Wonder Dogs have won both
in five-set reverse sweeps.

2756
01:55:28,996 --> 01:55:29,896
(Cheering wildly)

2757
01:55:30,665 --> 01:55:32,933
Just two matches in,
and my voice is already shot.

2758
01:55:34,035 --> 01:55:35,769
Neither win came easy.

2759
01:55:36,104 --> 01:55:37,871
You really hung in there.

2760
01:55:38,373 --> 01:55:39,606
Great job!

2761
01:55:42,377 --> 01:55:44,144
Thank you.

2762
01:55:44,379 --> 01:55:45,579
You did great.

2763
01:55:47,382 --> 01:55:48,282
Don't cry.

2764
01:55:54,422 --> 01:55:57,723
Honestly, after leaving the pro league,

2765
01:55:57,724 --> 01:56:00,760
I wondered if I'd ever hear
fans cheering for me again...

2766
01:56:00,761 --> 01:56:04,765
or get to experience anything
like this again.

2767
01:56:05,232 --> 01:56:08,568
So hearing those cheers today was
a real thrill.

2768
01:56:09,804 --> 01:56:12,306
Who would you pick as today's MVP?

2769
01:56:12,307 --> 01:56:14,276
I'd go with Ye Eun.

2770
01:56:14,277 --> 01:56:14,814
Absolutely. Ye Eun.

2771
01:56:14,828 --> 01:56:17,930
But today, she showed
she can do so much more.

2772
01:56:17,931 --> 01:56:20,032
Exactly. And seeing
how much she's changed...

2773
01:56:20,033 --> 01:56:22,935
under Coach Kim's guidance is impressive.

2774
01:56:22,936 --> 01:56:25,404
Isn't that what the Wonder Dogs
are all about?

2775
01:56:25,405 --> 01:56:27,940
- From underdogs to Wonder Dogs.
- Exactly.

2776
01:56:27,941 --> 01:56:29,841
(Soaring to even greater heights)

2777
01:56:30,577 --> 01:56:32,645
We won!

2778
01:56:32,913 --> 01:56:34,313
We actually won!

2779
01:56:35,348 --> 01:56:36,381
We did it.

2780
01:56:37,417 --> 01:56:38,684
We did it!

2781
01:56:42,289 --> 01:56:43,689
I'm totally wiped out.

2782
01:56:43,957 --> 01:56:46,125
Another hard-fought win today.

2783
01:56:47,094 --> 01:56:48,160
We won.

2784
01:56:49,697 --> 01:56:51,097
We could've won that so easily.

2785
01:56:51,098 --> 01:56:52,631
I'm sweating like crazy right now.

2786
01:56:54,501 --> 01:56:55,468
Those girls.

2787
01:56:56,369 --> 01:56:57,936
Another match going all five sets.

2788
01:56:59,606 --> 01:57:02,575
(And then...)

2789
01:57:04,177 --> 01:57:05,577
What am I going to do with them?

2790
01:57:09,149 --> 01:57:11,284
Seung Ju looks disappointed.

2791
01:57:11,285 --> 01:57:14,219
Right. She played well
in so many ways today.

2792
01:57:14,220 --> 01:57:15,788
She must have mixed feelings.

2793
01:57:15,789 --> 01:57:17,490
She's disappointed about losing,

2794
01:57:17,491 --> 01:57:20,092
but she's probably proud to see...

2795
01:57:20,093 --> 01:57:21,961
how well the Wonder Dogs are doing.

2796
01:57:21,962 --> 01:57:22,962
Absolutely.

2797
01:57:23,464 --> 01:57:25,699
Watching them play,

2798
01:57:25,700 --> 01:57:27,667
compared to Season One,

2799
01:57:27,668 --> 01:57:31,704
I could see they'd improved even more.

2800
01:57:32,472 --> 01:57:35,340
I don't think Seung Ju can
ever be replaced.

2801
01:57:35,742 --> 01:57:37,843
Her absence was really felt.

2802
01:57:38,044 --> 01:57:42,147
(Has the team filled the void left
by Seung Ju?)

2803
01:57:42,483 --> 01:57:45,151
We can't replace Seung Ju.

2804
01:57:45,318 --> 01:57:46,618
We can't,

2805
01:57:47,254 --> 01:57:51,023
but to make up for what we're missing,

2806
01:57:51,024 --> 01:57:53,292
all six players...

2807
01:57:53,560 --> 01:57:55,861
have each stepped up and done their part.

2808
01:57:56,330 --> 01:57:59,065
And I think that's how we can become
an even better team.

2809
01:58:00,000 --> 01:58:01,334
(But who's today's standout player?)

2810
01:58:01,335 --> 01:58:02,568
Today's standout?

2811
01:58:03,870 --> 01:58:04,903
I'd say Enkhsoyol.

2812
01:58:05,171 --> 01:58:07,372
I'm picking Hyo Rim today.

2813
01:58:07,373 --> 01:58:08,306
(Enkhsoyol picks Hyo Rim.)

2814
01:58:08,307 --> 01:58:10,709
Ye Dam came through for us today.

2815
01:58:10,710 --> 01:58:11,610
(Hyo Rim picks Ye Dam.)

2816
01:58:11,611 --> 01:58:12,779
Yeon Joo.

2817
01:58:12,780 --> 01:58:15,714
Ye Eun did a great job when she came in.

2818
01:58:16,816 --> 01:58:21,520
I think the most important thing is
for everyone to give their best...

2819
01:58:22,055 --> 01:58:23,756
in whatever role they have.

2820
01:58:25,226 --> 01:58:28,661
Every player has done their part,

2821
01:58:28,662 --> 01:58:29,962
and that's what makes this team special.

2822
01:58:30,230 --> 01:58:31,263
Let's do our cheer.

2823
01:58:31,765 --> 01:58:34,367
- Number one!
- Wonder Dogs!

2824
01:58:34,368 --> 01:58:36,836
(MVP: Wonder Dogs)

2825
01:58:37,911 --> 01:58:39,617
I was surprised at first.

2826
01:58:41,682 --> 01:58:44,317
We'd be facing each other
as opponents across the net.

2827
01:58:44,926 --> 01:58:48,201
I never expected we'd face them.

2828
01:58:48,729 --> 01:58:50,763
Honestly, they're pretty intimidating.

2829
01:58:50,764 --> 01:58:53,499
(Seon Ah returns to her former team.)

2830
01:58:53,500 --> 01:58:55,902
(Ho Bin returns to her former team.)

2831
01:58:57,137 --> 01:58:59,171
(A perennial powerhouse
in semi-pro volleyball)

2832
01:59:01,075 --> 01:59:02,275
Hey!

2833
01:59:02,609 --> 01:59:06,545
(Pohang Sports Council)

2834
01:59:06,847 --> 01:59:08,681
I really don't want to lose.

2835
01:59:08,849 --> 01:59:10,383
(Now facing each other across the net)

2836
01:59:10,384 --> 01:59:11,885
(Rivals brought together by fate)

2837
01:59:12,086 --> 01:59:13,153
(Opposite versus...)

2838
01:59:13,154 --> 01:59:14,387
(Opposite)

2839
01:59:15,022 --> 01:59:16,322
(Libero versus...)

2840
01:59:16,323 --> 01:59:17,724
(Libero)

2841
01:59:18,225 --> 01:59:19,292
(Blocker versus...)

2842
01:59:19,293 --> 01:59:20,693
(Blocker)

2843
01:59:21,528 --> 01:59:22,461
Ye Dam!

2844
01:59:22,462 --> 01:59:23,729
(Twenty-two years of coaching versus...)

2845
01:59:23,730 --> 01:59:24,964
(Just two years)

2846
01:59:28,335 --> 01:59:29,335
There you go!

2847
01:59:30,704 --> 01:59:32,193
(The Wonder Coach 2)

2848
01:59:32,240 --> 01:59:33,853
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
